Zhang Guangjun was appointed vice governor of Guangdong Province.
The fifth meeting of the Standing Committee of the 13th National People's Congress of Guangdong Province held the second plenary meeting in Guangzhou on the 30th.
By a vote, the meeting decided to appoint Zhang Guangjun as the vice governor of the People's Government of Guangdong Province.
Previously, Zhang Guangjun served as the deputy secretary of the party committee of the China Academy of Engineering Physics.
Zhang Guangjun's résumé: Zhang Guangjun, male, Han Chinese, born in February 1968, Chongqing, joined the party in April 1994, participated in work in July 1991, graduated in electronic instruments and measurement technology of the Department of Radio Engineering of Harbin University of Technology, university degree, senior engineer, enjoy the special allowance of the government of the State Council experts.
He is currently a vice-prefect of the Guangdong provincial government and a member of the party group.
From 1987 to 1991, he studied electronic instruments and measurement technology in the Department of Radio Engineering of Harbin Institute of Technology.
From 1991 to 1998, he was a technician, deputy director of the General Engineering Research Institute of the Chinese Academy of Engineering Physics, and the secretary and deputy director of the party branch of the room.
From 1998 to 2002, the deputy director of the General Engineering Research Institute of the Chinese Academy of Engineering Physics and the deputy secretary of the party committee (during which: 1999.05-2000.12 also served as the secretary of the discipline commission of the Research Institute, 2001.09-2001.12 Sichuan Provincial Party Committee)
From 2002 to 2002, Party Secretary and Deputy Director of the General Engineering Research Institute of the Chinese Academy of Engineering Physics (during which: 2002.03-2004.05 postgraduate courses in management science and engineering at Fudan University School of Management)
From 2002 to 2009, the director of the Political Department of the Chinese Academy of Engineering Physics, the head of the party committee office and the vice-principal of the party school (during which: 2005.09-2006.01 training courses for young cadres in the Central Party School)
From 2009 to 2014, the director of the director of the major special management office of the Chinese Academy of Engineering Physics (during which: 2011.09-2012.01 training courses for young and middle-aged cadres of the Central Party School)
From 2014 to 2015, assistant dean of the China Academy of Engineering Physics and director of the major engineering management office
Deputy Secretary of the Party Committee of the China Academy of Engineering Physics 2015-2018
In September 2018, he served as the deputy governor of the Guangdong provincial government and a member of the party group.
Gen. William Moran, U.S. undersecretary of naval operations, said the U.S. will continue to prioritize the Asia-Pacific region, which the Pentagon has expanded to include the Indo-Asia-Asia-Pacific, even as it reinvigorates its power to deal with an increasingly worrying Russia on both sides of the Atlantic.
According to the British "Jane's Defense Weekly" website reported on September 24, the United States listed China and Russia as strategic competitors in the new national defense strategy released at the beginning of the year.
Since then, the U.S. Navy has reinvigorated the Second Fleet in order to more directly counter Russian activities.
The moves have raised questions and concerns among allies and analysts that the U.S. Navy could move away from the “Asia-Pacific rebalancing” strategy that marked the Obama administration.
But Admiral Moran said the U.S. Navy’s focus remains on the Western Pacific.
“There have been no major changes for us,” at a round-table discussion entitled “Responding to the challenges of the high seas” hosted by the U.S. National Agency for Asian Studies in Washington on January 24, 2018.
â€œThe focus is still rebalancing, shifting the center of gravity, or no matter how you want to describe it,â€ Moran said.
However, he admitted that the United States has close relations with Europe.
â€œWe’re going to keep an eye on the growth of the West Coast and balance what we can,â€ he said.
“Russians may face demographic and economic challenges, but history proves that they will be very tough if we come into conflict with them.”
As part of U.S. re-emerging operations against Russia, China and other contenders, the U.S. Navy is dynamically deploying troops into a â€œnew mode of operationâ€ , which could help catch adversaries off guard against where U.S. aircraft carrier battle groups or other assets will be deployed at any given time and location, Admiral Moran said.
â€œOur Navy and the Marine Corps support it â€“ the concept of operational unpredictability â€“ don't appear in the same place over and over again, almost like a clockwork â€“ that's what we've done," he said.
The first to try this new approach was the USS Harry Truman carrier strike group, whose early deployment included working visits to ports and patrols in areas that normally pass through.
Moran said that the U.S. Navy is currently working to ensure that allies know that these warships will still patrol in traditional areas, and is also solving logistical and family liaison issues for the new deployment process.
The Royal Australian Navy’s commander, Lieutenant General Michael Nunan, also spoke at the event, saying Australian troops could work seamlessly with U.S. aircraft carrier strike groups.
This will continue as the Royal Australian Navy plans to purchase nine additional frigates equipped with the Aegis combat system, he said.
A number of airlines will raise or resume the fuel surcharge from October 5, and the plane will have to increase the amount of money next Friday.
Yesterday, Xianpeng Airlines, Orkai Airlines and other airlines announced that since October 5, 2018 (the ticketing date), the domestic route fuel surcharge of 800 kilometers (inclusive) per passenger will be charged a fuel surcharge of 20 yuan per passenger, more than 800 kilometers of routes per passenger to charge a fuel surcharge of 30 yuan.
Xangpeng Airlines, Okai Airlines and other companies announced that since October 5, 2018 at 0:00 (ticket date), 800 kilometers (inclusive) domestic route fuel surcharge standards increased from 10 yuan / person to 20 yuan / person, more than 800 kilometers of domestic route fuel surcharge collection standard increased from 10 yuan / person per passenger to 30 yuan / person.
Children, military and police disabilities are all 10 yuan / person; infants continue to be exempt.
According to the relevant person in charge of Ctrip's ticket, the airline has pointed out in the notice that the charge of the fuel surcharge is based on the original ticket date, and the fuel surcharge will not be refunded when the ticket is exchanged.
This means that the domestic route tickets issued before October 5, if you want to change to October 5 (inclusive), do not have to pay the fuel surcharge according to the new standard.
Since June 5, 2018, a number of airlines, such as Air China, China Eastern Airlines, HNA, Shanghai Airlines, Spring and Autumn Airlines, Shenzhen Airlines, Western Airlines and Okai Airlines, have reinstated a fuel surcharge that has been cancelled for 3 years on domestic routes, with a standard rate of 10 yuan per person.
This time, Xianpeng Airlines and Okai Airlines took the lead in announcing an increase in fuel surcharges, as of the reporter's press release, they have not yet seen the news that the four major domestic airlines have announced follow-up adjustments.
It is also understood that the Hong Kong Civil Aviation Department stipulates that airlines can decide whether or not to charge a fuel surcharge in November.
Cathay Pacific first announced on September 27 that it will re-charge the fuel surcharge on November 2.
According to Cathay Pacific's website, all tickets issued or re-issued by Cathay Pacific and Cathay Dragon on or after 2 November will include a fuel surcharge for long-haul flights between Hong Kong and the South-West Pacific, North America, Europe, the Middle East, the Middle East and India and Africa with a fuel surcharge of US$652, while short-haul flights will be charged $146.
Fees are applicable to all ticket types, calculated according to each flight segment, and are included in ticket quotes from all Cathay Pacific's direct sales channels.
On the eve of the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, Chinese Premier Li Keqiang met with the new ambassadors of 29 countries and regions in the Great Hall of the People on the afternoon of the 30th.
Li Keqiang shook hands and had a cordial conversation with his ambassadors in China.
Li Keqiang welcomed the envoys to serve in China, and asked them to convey their sincere greetings and good wishes to the leaders and people of various countries and the leaders of the relevant institutions.
Li Keqiang commented positively on China's good relations with other countries and regions, stressed that China is committed to enhancing bilateral political mutual trust, deepening practical cooperation, and strengthening coordination and cooperation in international and regional affairs. He hoped that envoys will walk and see more, and make new positive contributions to the development of China's relations with their respective countries and regions in their new positions.
The Chinese government is willing to provide convenience and support to envoys in the performance of their duties.
Li Keqiang pointed out that China adheres to the path of peaceful development and unswervingly promotes economic globalization.
This year marks the 40th anniversary of China's reform and opening-up. As the world's largest developing country, we are willing to achieve common development with other countries in the process of further opening-up.
In the context of the rise of protectionism and unilateralism, we are willing to work with all parties to continuously consolidate and strengthen the partnership based on the principles of mutual respect, equality and mutual benefit, promote the docking development strategy, promote the “Belt and Road” construction and cooperation based on the principle of joint consultation, joint construction and sharing, jointly safeguard multilateralism and free trade, jointly build an open world economy, and inject new impetus into the stable and balanced development of the world economy.
The diplomatic envoys of various countries and institutions in China warmly congratulated on the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, conveyed the greetings of the leaders of their respective countries and institutions to Chinese leaders and the people, and said that China's development has made remarkable achievements, and believes that further deepening reform and expanding opening-up will bring more development opportunities to the world in the future.
They are willing to play a positive role in promoting friendly cooperation between their respective countries and regions with China to better achieve mutual benefit and win-win results.
Subsequently, the diplomatic envoys of various countries and institutions in China were invited by Li Keqiang to attend the National Day Reception.
State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended the event.
Japan's Itochu Corporation on Friday reported $1.3 billion in impairment losses on its investment in China's CITIC shares, a write-down of its largest corporate investment deal due to trade tensions between China and the United States.
In May 2016, in Tokyo, Japan, a man walked past the headquarters of Marubeni Corporation.
Marubeni said that the trade war has hit its U.S. grain division, Gao Hung, which has suspended financial transactions in agriculture.
Some Japanese heavy equipment manufacturers and telecommunications companies have warned about the impact of Sino-U.S. trade frictions when announcing the latest results, and now these Japanese trading houses have also joined the ranks.
The U.S. and China have imposed tariffs on hundreds of billions of dollars of each other's goods, and U.S. President Donald Trump has threatened to expand the tax to more than 500 billion U.S. dollars if the dispute can't be resolved.
Tsuyoshi Hachimura, Itochu’s chief financial officer, said the trade dispute could have a bigger impact on China’s economy next year.
In 2015, Ito Corporation invested $10 billion in CITIC, acquiring a 20 per cent stake.
Hachimura said Ito Corporation lost 14.33 billion yen ($1.3 billion) in its shareholding because it did not believe CITIC's share price would recover in the near future.
Ito Corporation maintained its profit forecast for the fiscal year ending March 31, 2019 at 500 billion yen.
In July, China imposed 25 percent import tariffs on U.S. soybeans in response to Washington’s efforts in trade frictions.
â€œOur grain business has been hit hard by U.S.-China trade frictions,â€ said Mr. Yan, Chief Financial Officer of Marubeni.
He said that Gao Hong has stopped the financial transactions of his own accounts since September.
In a statement on Friday, Gao Hong spokesman Pat Burke pointed out that the company's move is "restricted in accordance with internal policies and due to a lack of market opportunities."
He also said that the suspension of financial transactions will not lead to the loss of jobs.
Marubeni maintained an annual profit estimate of 230 billion yen, supported by the pulp and paper and power generation businesses.
Sumitomo Corporation on Thursday reported earnings growth of 16% from April to September, emphasizing that "the outlook for U.S.-China trade problems are uncertain."
Mitsubishi Corporation on Friday raised its annual profit forecast to record levels due to increased coking coal production and higher prices for commodities such as oil and coal.
Mitsubishi Corporation has also announced a new business plan, aiming to increase its earnings in the fiscal year ending March 31, 2022, from an estimated 64 billion yen this year to 900 billion yen ($7.98 billion).
According to a comprehensive report, the U.S. midterm election vote has entered the countdown.
On Nov. 4, President Donald Trump and his Democratic opponents actively campaigned against their core constituents.
The two major parties pointed out that the voter turnout will be the key to the election.
According to reports, 48 hours before the popular vote in the United States, Trump was busy attending the campaign of Republican candidates, and former President Barack Obama went to Indiana to stand for Joe Donnelly, the Democratic candidate for the urgent election, and shouted to the masses before the final appeal.
On Nov. 4, Mr. Trump went to Maytown, Georgia, to stand for Republican gubernatorial candidate Brian Kemp, saying, â€œYou have to go to the polling station on Tuesday, you have to vote.â€
"The comparison of this election could not have been clearer."
Voters’ political fervor rose to a rhoddging peak, and early voting in some states was far higher than usual.
Successive U.S. presidents are facing their first midterm elections, and members of Congress from his party tend to have fewer seats.
According to a new opinion poll released by the Washington Post and ABC News on the 4th, although the Democratic Federal House of Representatives election still maintains an advantage, Republicans can benefit from economic evaluation and Trump's strict focus on border security.
According to the poll, there are more registered voters who like Democratic House candidates than Republicans, at 50% to 43%, but they are still down 14 percentage points from the 14-percentage-point lead in August.
In a separate poll conducted by NBC and the Wall Street Journal, Democrats are still seven percentage points ahead of Republicans.
It is reported that Obama said to the masses on the occasion of Senator Donoli's campaign: "When people don't tell the truth, when words don't represent anything anymore, it will inevitably have evil consequences.
Democracy will not work when people lie on their part.”
“The only way you can stop these Republicans right now is with you and your vote.”
Democrats are facing the most difficult election in the Senate in decades, and Republicans now hold more than half of the 51 seats.
However, the Democratic Party needs to win another 23 seats to control the 435-seat House of Representatives.
According to analysts at FiveThirtyEight.com, the Democratic Party's chances of winning the House of Representatives are as high as 85 percent.
The CPPCC held an important ideological and theoretical seminar of General Secretary Xi Jinping on strengthening and improving the work of the CPPCC Wang Yang attended and delivered a speech.
From the 29th to the 30th, the CPPCC held an important ideological and theoretical seminar of General Secretary Xi Jinping on strengthening and improving the work of the CPPCC.
The Standing Committee of the Politburo of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and Chairman of the CPPC CPPCC attended the meeting and delivered a speech.
He stressed that General Secretary Xi Jinping's important ideas on strengthening and improving the work of the CPPCC have profoundly elucidated the role, goals, tasks, responsibilities, and practical requirements of the CPPCC, scientifically answered a series of directional, overall and strategic major issues, which is a powerful ideological weapon to guide the work of the CPPCC in the new era.
It is necessary to earnestly study and implement this important idea, grasp its great significance, rich connotation and spiritual substance, and earnestly work hard to learn and understand and make practical efforts, promote the quality improvement of the CPPCC's work with theoretical learning and ideological force, and earnestly assume the new mission of the CPPCC in the new era.
From September 29th to 30th, the CPPCC held an important ideological and theoretical seminar of General Secretary Xi Jinping on strengthening and improving the work of the CPPCC in Beijing.
Wang Yang pointed out that since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, General Secretary Xi Jinping has put forward a series of new ideas and new opinions on strengthening and improving the work of the People's Political Consultative Conference. For the first time, the CPPCC is an important channel and a special consultative body for socialist consultation and democracy, is an important part of the national governance system, it is an institutional arrangement with Chinese characteristics, for the first time clarifies the characteristics and advantages of a new political party system.
Wang Yang stressed that the CPPCC at all levels should take theoretical study and discussion as an opportunity to further find the weak links and shortcomings in the work of the CPPCC, work hard to strengthen and improve and seek breakthroughs.
It is necessary to comprehensively strengthen the party building of the CPPCC system to ensure that the decision-making and deployment of the Party Central Committee are fully implemented into the work of the CPPCC.
It is necessary to strengthen ideological and political guidance, improve the system, procedures and mechanisms of "two-way force" of advice and administration and consensus, and implement ideological and political guidance into all aspects and the whole process of performing their duties.
It is necessary to focus on the central tasks to perform their responsibilities, better comply with the overall situation of serving the party and the state, improve the quality of advice and administration, and enhance the effectiveness of performing their duties.
It is necessary to strengthen the CPPCC's own construction, do a good job in the education and training of members and cadres, give full play to the basic role of the special committee, and consolidate the foundation for the CPPCC to perform its duties.
It is necessary to strengthen the guidance for the work of the local CPPCC, take the direction, demonstration and solve the problem, and improve the overall level of the CPPCC's work.
In order to thoroughly study and implement Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era and the spirit of the 19th National Congress of the Communist Party of China (CPPCC), the National People's Political Consultative Conference (CPPCC) system began in May to carry out General Secretary Xi Jinping's important ideological research activities on strengthening and improving the work of the CPPCC, held 8 regional symposiums and seven symposiums of experts and scholars, identified 18 key topics and 6 basic theoretical topics.
BEIJING, Nov. 5 (Wang Xiaoyan) Under the current wave of â€œmass entrepreneurship and innovation â€“ more and more technology companies have begun to attach importance to patent research and development and related protection work, tap the potential value of patents, and occupy the dominant position in the market.
Similarly, many science and technology companies have encountered a lot of infringement in terms of patent technology licensing and the use of patented technologies.
At the end of 2017, Tan Wei, He Zhanghong and Lai Bin from Guangdong Province took "Dip Travel" APP's developer Beijing Xiaoqing Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as small orange technology), operator Didi Travel Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Dixi Travel"), the seller Guangdong Pacific Internet Information Service Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Guangdong Pacific) to the Guangzhou Intellectual Property Court.
The three plaintiffs applied to the court for an order, and the three defendants immediately stopped the act of manufacturing, selling, promising to sell and using the plaintiff's patents.
On October 30, 2018, the China Referee Documents Network announced the "First Instance Civil Ruling for Infringement of Infringement of Invention Patent Disputes such as Tan Wei, He Zhanghong and Beijing Xiaoqing Technology Co., Ltd.", which disclosed the details of some of the cases in which Didi Chuxing APP was sued for patent infringement.
The three plaintiffs believe that the patentees and inventors of the "car-sharing service system and methods based on mobile terminals" patent, and that the entire operation process of the "windmill" application in the "drop travel" APP corresponds to the technical scheme of patent protection, which constitutes patent infringement.
However, during the court's ruling, Xiaoqing Technology believes that Guangdong Pacific is not a qualified defendant, it has only provided a free download of the APP "drop travel" involved on the Internet, did not implement the patent method, there is no direct or indirect infringement, and should not be classified as a defendant in this case.
Second, the violation in this case does not exist in Canton.
In accordance with the provisions of the law, the infringement of the patent involved shall be the place where the patented method in question will be fully implemented, so the jurisdiction of the court will be challenged, and the case should be transferred to the defendant's place of residence, the Beijing Intellectual Property Court.
The Guangzhou Intellectual Property Court held that it was not inappropriate for the defendant Guangdong Pacific to provide an alleged infringement of Didi Travel APP products on its online platform, and it was not inappropriate for the plaintiff to classify the defendant Guangdong Pacific as a defendant.
In addition, the defendant's Guangdong Pacific residence is located in Guangzhou and belongs to the jurisdiction of the Guangzhou Intellectual Property Court.
Defendant Xiaoqing Science and Technology advocated that the case be transferred to the Beijing Intellectual Property Court for trial, on an insufficient basis, rejected the defendant Xiaoqing Technology Co., Ltd.'s objection to the jurisdiction in this case, and bear the cost of accepting the jurisdictional opposition case.
At present, the other hearing of the case has not yet been announced, and the reporter will pay close attention to the follow-up details of the patent infringement case.
Interview with the Chief Executive Officer of the Australian Federal Scientific and Industrial Research Organization: Australia-China scientific and technological cooperation has achieved remarkable results
"China's science and technology have developed rapidly in the past few decades, and Australia and China can work together in the fields of science to achieve fruitful results."
Larry Marshall, CEO of the Australian Federal Organization for Scientific and Industrial Research, recently said in an interview with the China News Agency in Beijing that from addressing climate change to the cooperation of the "Heavenly Eye" project, the cooperation between Australia and China in the field of science and technology has shown great vitality.
As the largest state-level scientific research institution in the Commonwealth of Australia, CSIRO has achieved many innovative research results in marine, energy, biology, materials, astronomy and other fields that have attracted the world's attention.
The CSIRO has always maintained close cooperation with scientific research institutions such as the Chinese Academy of Sciences.
“It’s an enduring friendship that embraces a tradition of mutual trust and long-term cooperation,” Marshall said.
In May of this year, China's 500-meter-caliber spherical radio telescopic telescopic "China Eye" installed the world's first 19-beam L-band receiver.
At present, the world's most state-of-the-art 19-beam feeder receiver has been jointly developed by Chinese and Australian scientists.
Marshall pointed out that the successful development of the receiver is based on CSIRO's many years of technical accumulation, after the launch, the FAST survey speed will be increased by 5 to 6 times, at the same time, it will also expand more scientific observation targets.
â€œThis is CSIRO’s contribution to FAST.”
In addition to the above-mentioned cooperation, CSIRO also has close cooperation with Chinese scientific research institutions in the construction of square kilometers array radio telescopes, the development of new fuel technologies, energy conservation and emission reduction.
"In the past, scientific research has often focused on the problems of hundreds of years later, and now more scientific research forces are needed to solve the problems in front of them."
Marshall believes that Australia and China have complementarities in the field of scientific development, and both countries face a series of challenges in development.
For example, extreme weather occurs frequently around the world, droughts and floods have led to reduced food production, and food shortages have seriously affected human development.
At the same time, problems such as population explosion, aging and chronic diseases are also currently facing serious challenges.
"The cooperation between Australia and China in recent years is mainly aimed at solving these current problems."
Marshall said that CSIRO and the Qingdao National Laboratory of Marine Science and Technology co-founded the International Southern Hemisphere Marine Research Center, its focus is to observe the El Niño phenomenon and La Niña phenomenon, study the relationship between the two and extreme weather, and establish extreme weather early warning facilities; CSIRO and the Chinese Academy of Sciences jointly developed a new variety of grains to overcome extreme weather, can also alleviate the food shortage caused by extreme weather.
"In the current environment, scientific and technological innovation is very difficult to complete on their own, requires extremely high costs, to be solved is also a lot, so cooperation is particularly important today."
Marshall pointed out that the closer the cooperation, the more likely it is to make a breakthrough, which is also the significance of strengthening cooperation between Australia and China under the "Belt and Road" framework.
"Strengthening bilateral cooperation is mainly scientific and technological cooperation for us."
Marshall, for example, CSIRO has recently developed a gold purification method that does not use cyanide, because the traditional cyanide gold purification method is very harmful to the environment, and many countries hope to find a gold purification method with small environmental pollution.
"We are very willing to introduce this technology to China, which is one of the results of our participation in the Belt and Road cooperation."
On the 29th, the 2018 Baoji · Silk Road tourism promotion and project cooperation talks were held in Urumqi City, Xinjiang, and the participating guests can also enjoy the local cuisine and feel the heavy local history and culture while appreciating the development achievements of Baoji.
In the first month of this event, Baoji successively carried out a series of high-density and large-scale tourism publicity and promotion activities in eight cities along the Silk Road, such as Tianshui, Pingliang, Lanzhou, Yinchuan, Guyuan, Xining, Zhangye and Hami, which laid a good foundation for the success of the 2018 Baoji and Silk Road tourism promotion and project cooperation talks.
Baoji City, Shaanxi Province Mayor Hui Jincai introduced that Baoji has a long history and culture and a strong industrial base, which is the second largest city in Shaanxi Province and the sub-central city of Guantian economic zone and Guanzhong Plain urban agglomeration, and an important node city along the "Belt and Road" initiative.
In recent years, Baoji City has continued to enhance the five functions of industrial clusters, logistics hubs, integrated services, open highlands, and cultural agglomeration, and has accelerated the promotion of catch-up beyond and high-quality and high-quality development.
At the meeting, the Baoji City Tourism Development Committee signed a strategic tourism cooperation agreement between the two places with the Urumqi Tourism Bureau.
At the same time, a number of travel agencies in Xinjiang have signed tourism cooperation agreements with Baoji Da Shuichuan Tourist Scenic Area, Famen Temple Buddhist Cultural Scenic Area, Taibai Mountain Tourism Scenic Area and Guanshan Prairie Scenic Area.
Baoji Municipal Tourism Development Commission market promotion section chief Chen Magnificent said: â€œDami-Xinjiang, some tourism resources are complementary, and we have come along the way to promote tourism to Xinjiang, which mainly introduces humanistic precious chickens, gourmet chickens, natural scenery, etc., and selects more than 500 kinds of photos, so that merchants can feel the beautiful scenery of precious chicken.
Focusing on tourism resources, tourism projects, tourist routes and so on, the exhibition of cultural and cultural tourism resources and projects, the organization of tourism photography exhibitions, the production of promotional exhibitions, the distribution of promotional materials, docking tourism cooperation and other forms, comprehensively promoting the overall image of Baoji tourism, high-quality tourism products and high-quality tourism industry projects, consolidating the source market in Xinjiang, comprehensively singing the "Look at China Baobao chicken" brand, enhancing the influence and popularity of Baoji City in the northwest.
Feng Xu, deputy director of Baoji City China Merchants Bureau, said: "In this event, various departments at all levels, counties and districts, and development zones in Baoji City have actively participated in negotiations, and coordinated and implemented a large number of good projects and large-scale projects.
Up to now, a total of 41 contracted projects have been implemented, involving a total amount of 26.043 billion yuan."
In recent years, around the goal of building an international city along the "Belt and Road" initiative, a famous city in the equipment manufacturing industry, a famous city of history and culture, and a beautiful and happy city with a livable and livable industry to continuously enhance the five major functions of industrial clusters, logistics hubs, comprehensive services, open highlands, and cultural agglomeration has been accelerated to catch-up and high-quality development.
In 2017, the gross domestic product reached 218 billion yuan, an increase of 8.7%.
It has won more than 20 national-level honors such as national civilized city, national ecological garden city and Chinese living environment award.
Urumqi Municipal Party Committee Standing Committee and Deputy Mayor Yan Naimin introduced that Urumqi, as an important town on the New North Road on the Silk Road, has a special geographical location advantage, since ancient times, it has been an important channel connecting the north and south of Tianshan Mountains, communicating Xinjiang with the mainland, and connecting China with Central Asia, West Asia and Europe is an important window for China's opening to the west and foreign economic and cultural exchanges, and has a good investment environment.
This event focuses on equipment manufacturing, logistics and commerce, and tourism industry, with the sincerity of complicity in good opportunities for good development and joint consultation and cooperation plans to shine in Urumqi.
At the meeting, local merchants in Xinjiang signed six projects with Baoji counties, involving an amount of 3.25 billion yuan.
On the same day, representatives of Kyrgyzstan's visa office in Urumqi, representatives of the Russian Novosibirsk Law Company, representatives of the Tajik Chamber of Commerce and Industry in Urumqi, and representatives of the Russian Tatarstan Chamber of Commerce attended the talks.
About 500 people from Urumqi's China Merchants Bureau, Commerce Bureau, Agriculture and Animal Husbandry Bureau, Tourism Bureau and other departments, as well as enterprises and the media, participated in the talks.
Revitalization in the Northeast is related to the overall situation of national development.
Industrial enterprises in the northeast region are more important and the foundation is better, for the northeast, grasping innovation is grasping development, seeking innovation is seeking the future.
Is it possible to reinvigorate and release the vitality of the old industrial base and affect the heart of the general secretary?
North Korea's Foreign Minister Lee Yong-ho told the U.N. on Saturday that continuing to impose sanctions has deepened North Korea's distrust of the United States, and North Korea cannot unilaterally give up its nuclear weapons under such circumstances.
At the U.N. General Assembly, he said North Korea had taken a “very friendly approach” over the past year, including halting missile and nuclear tests, demolishing nuclear test sites, and committing to the non-proliferation of nuclear weapons and technology.
“But we didn’t see any corresponding U.S. response,” he said.
"If we don't trust the United States, we don't have confidence in our national security, and under such circumstances, we can't unilaterally give up our weapons first."
While he repeated North Korea’s complaints about U.S. opposition to “phased” denuclearisation by the United States, his speech was of great significance because it did not completely reject unilateral denuclearisation, as North Korea had done before.
Ri Yong-hao referred to the June 12 joint statement between Kim and Trump, when Kim agreed to work on “denuclearisation of the Korean Peninsula” and Trump promised to protect North Korea’s security.
North Korea has sought to formally end the 1950-53 Korean War, but the U.S. says it must give up its nuclear weapons first.
The U.S. has also rejected a request to ease international sanctions on North Korea.
"The United States insists on 'de-nuclearization first' and increases the pressure of sanctions to achieve its goals in a high-pressure manner, and even refuses to issue a 'Declaration to end the war,'" Li Yonghao said.
“The idea that sanctions can make us kneel and ask for forgiveness is that people who don’t know about us are daydreaming.
“But the problem is that such persistent sanctions are deepening our mistrust.”
Li Yonghao did not mention the U.S. president's plan for a second special financial meeting at the United Nations earlier this week.
On the contrary, he highlighted the three meetings between Kim and South Korean President Moon Jae-in over the past five months, saying, “The denuclearization of the Korean peninsula will not become so deadlocked if it is South Korea rather than North Korea on the other side.”
Since November 1, 2018, China has reduced import tariffs on 1,585 tax items.
Since the beginning of this year, China has taken the initiative to reduce import tariffs.
On May 1 of this year, the comprehensive tax reduction of drugs, including anti-cancer drugs, all ordinary drugs and alkaloids with anti-cancer effects, as well as the actual import of traditional Chinese medicine, a total of 28 tariff items were adjusted to zero.
At the same time, it has also greatly reduced the value-added tax burden on the production and import of anti-cancer drugs.
On July 1, taxes were reduced on 218 vehicles and spare parts.
After the tax reduction, China's automobile vehicle tax rate has been lower than the average level of developing countries, in line with the reality of China's automobile industry.
The tax reduction will promote the restructuring of the industry and optimize the allocation of resources, accelerate the survival of the fittest, improve the quality of products and services, is expected to promote the adjustment of automobile prices to a certain extent, so that consumers can get more benefits.
On July 1, 1,449 daily consumer goods will be reduced.
The tax reduction of daily consumer goods is closely related to the needs of the people for a better life.
The tax reduction is not only a large number but also strong, the average tax reduction rate of 56%.
The tax reduction of daily consumer goods directly benefits the vast number of consumers and promotes the competitiveness of the domestic industry.
On November 1, taxes will be reduced for industrial products such as electromechanical equipment, spare parts and raw materials for 1,585 tax items.
Properly reducing the import tariffs on some of China's much-needed industrial products can attract more foreign investment, which is conducive to increasing the effective domestic supply and assisting industrial upgrading, while also helping enterprises to allocate resources on a global scale, reducing production costs, and also helping to reduce the pressure carried by the domestic environment.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Customs Tariff Commission Office of the State Council of the People's Republic of China, the above four independent tax reductions, as well as the implementation of the third-step tariff reduction implemented on July 1st this year according to the information technology agreement, will reduce China's overall tariff level from 9.8% in the previous year to 7.5%.
The overall adjusted tariff level is slightly higher than that of the European Union, lower than that of most developing countries, which is at a moderately low level, which basically matches the status and development stage of developing countries in China.
As one of the important indicators of China's openness in the field of trade in goods, the overall level of tariffs should be compatible with China's economic development stage and reflect the characteristics of the times.
The scale of China's trade in goods ranks first in the world, and it already has the economic foundation for further opening up, but there is still a gap between the quality and efficiency of trade development compared with the developed economies, so the overall tariff level should be appropriately reduced.
Tariff is a means to protect compliance, tariff levels should be compatible with the competitiveness of the industry, to encourage healthy competition, excessive protection is not conducive to industrial development and improve the quality.
The adjustment of tariff rates should take into account production needs and consumer demand.
We should focus on reducing commodity tax rates with large domestic demand and conducive to industrial transformation and upgrading, striving to increase the import of characteristic and advantageous products that are more concentrated in the needs of the people, continuously enhancing the sense of acquisition of enterprises and the public, and meeting the upgrading needs of industrial structure and consumption structure.
The tax reduction should take into account the affordability of fiscal revenue and industrial development.
It is necessary to uncoordinate the relationship between the two markets at home and abroad, upstream and downstream aspects, and production and consumption in the selection of specific tax-reducing goods and the choice of tax reduction, so as to maintain China's steady and good development momentum in China's economy.
The official stressed that this year is the 40th anniversary of reform and opening up, and China's initiative to reduce the overall level of import tariffs is a major measure made in accordance with China's own need to achieve high-quality development, which is conducive to the overall use of international and foreign two kinds of resources, promote the quality improvement of the domestic supply system, and meet the consumption upgrading needs of the people.
These actions and measures show that China will unswervingly pursue a mutually beneficial and win-win opening-up strategy, firmly support economic globalization, firmly uphold the principle of free trade and the multilateral trading system with the WTO as the core, continue to draw development momentum from opening up to the world, and make China's development better benefit the world.
The presidents of Serbia will meet tomorrow to discuss the situation in Kosovo
The office of the Serbian president said that in view of the Kosovo special forces' occupation of the corridor of the Gaziwada hydropower station in northern Kosovo, which is controlled by Belgrade, Serbian President Vučić ordered the country's armed forces to enter a state of maximum combat readiness.
On September 29, Serbia's Defense Minister Vulin announced that the Serbian army has entered a state of full-scale combat readiness.
Vulin stressed that as long as the order issued by Vučić is still valid, Serbia will continue to monitor the current situation in Kosovo, no matter which direction the situation will develop, the Serbian army will respond.
According to Russia's TASS news agency, on September 29, Vucic said in an interview that he has briefed the United States, Russia and Europe on the current situation, and will go to Moscow on October 2 to meet with Russian President Vladimir Putin to seek Putin's support on the Kosovo issue.
When asked if Serbia needed Russia's military support like Syria, Vučić gave a negative answer: "I don't want a major military conflict on our territory."
Vučić also said that the Serbian army has entered an all-out state of readiness only to form a deterrent to prevent the occurrence of the conflict, but it is also a clear warning that no acts of violence in Kosovo will ever be tolerated.
It is related to the two major actions on the part of the Serb army in improving its combat readiness in Kosovo.
According to the Serbian side, in recent days, Albanians have been in the northern part of Kosovo for mass arrests of ethnic Serbs who have lived there for generations without violating any laws.
Vučić said that since March 26 this year, the head of the Serbian government's office in Kosovo and Metohija has been beaten and detained by the Kosovo Albanian army by the Kosovo Albanian army, the ethnic Albanians have escalated the situation in the region, making inhumane arrests and expulsions of Serbs.
In addition, more than 100 self-declared ROSU special forces, armed police and Snipers of the Ministry of Internal Affairs of the Republic of Kosovo occupied positions in the vicinity of Qazivoda Hydropower Station, entered the ecological and sports centre near the levees in the northern part of the Kosovo region, and sealed off all nearby roads, which would have been controlled by the Serbian side.
Vučić pointed out that Kosovo's military adventure was carried out instigated by Western countries, and the Kosovo army's actions did not inform the Serbian side in advance, in violation of Chapter IX, paragraph 1, of the Brussels Agreement, as well as the United Nations Security Council resolution 1244 and the military-technical agreement between Serbia.
Vučić has spoken to NATO Secretary-General Jens Stoltenberg, criticizing Western hypocrisy on Kosovo.
The root cause of the current conflict is the centuries-old feud between the Serbs of Kosovo.
With regard to the ownership of Kosovo, there are separate Serb and ethnic Albanian statements.
Serbia regarded Kosovo as the birthplace of the nation and the cradle of its culture, because Serbia established its most powerful state here in the 12th century, and the Albanians moved in in large numbers only after the invasion of the Ottoman Empire and the defeat of the Serbian army in the north.
The Albanians, on the other hand, insisted that the Illyrians, the primitive tribes that lived in Kosovo in the 4-5th century BC, were the ancestors of ethnic Albanians, so Kosovo has been an Albanian territory since time immemorial since ancient times.
Subjective political divisions have resulted in violent conflicts between different ethnic groups, religions and cultures, resulting in fierce confrontations between Serbs and Albanians in the Kosovo region.
In 1912, the Kosovo Albanians first declared the independence of Albania.
After the First World War, a large number of ethnic Albanians living in the Balkans moved to Turkey, the proportion of Serbs increased relatively, in the view of the Serbs "just to take back their own land" approach, but by the Albanians as "Great Serbianism" plundered, the contradiction between the two communities intensified.
Kosovo became a “powder keg” for the Balkans.
In 1999, Albanian separatists in the Kosovo Liberation Army (KLA) clashed with the Serbian army and police, which led to the bombardment of the Federal Republic of Serbia and Montenegro and the outbreak of the war in Kosovo.
On February 17, 2008, Kosovo unilaterally declared its independence from Serbia.
Since then, although there has been news that Serbia will normalize relations with Kosovo and sign a global and legally binding agreement, due to historical national grievances and geopolitical constraints, the agreement, which is subject to multiple forces such as the United States, Europe and Russia has not been able to be signed.
Just a month ago, for the first time, Vuččić made it clear that he advocated the isolation of Serbs and Albanians in Kosovo, and once again made the contradiction between the two communities public.
Electric power communication is still interrupted, and Indonesia's strong earthquake and tsunami rescue is difficult.
According to figures released by the Indonesian Disaster Relief Agency in the early morning of the 30th, a strong earthquake and a tsunami caused by Dungala County, Central Sulawesi Province in the country on the 28th, has killed 420 people.
The head of the Indonesian Disaster Relief Agency, Wilem Rampangilei, said that this figure is only the preliminary statistics of Palu, the capital of Central Sulawesi Province, about 80 kilometers away from the epicenter, due to the lack of large-scale search-and-rescue machinery, many hotels, shopping malls, warehouses and other densely populated buildings in the city that were damaged by the collapse of the earthquake have not yet been searched.
On September 29, 2018, local time on September 29, 2018, a bridge damaged by an earthquake and tsunami collapsed into several knots.
Due to the severe destruction of electricity and communication facilities, the epicentre of Donggala County and the neighboring Shiji area are still "islands" that cannot be contacted, and the number of victims cannot be counted.
According to media reports, Indonesian Vice President Carla said that the death toll may be in the tens of thousands.
Power outages, telecommunications disruptions, blocked roads, damage to the airport ... rescue efforts after strong earthquakes and tsunamis were difficult.
Due to the power outage, some hospitals and rescue settlements in Palu need to rely on fuel to generate electricity.
Roads into and out of the city were blocked due to landslides, and large transport vehicles, including oil tankers, were unable to enter, making the fuel supply very tight.
Indonesia's Social Minister Agus said that due to road damage, emergency relief materials such as tents, mattresses, blankets, clothes, food and household kits from the neighboring provinces of South Sulawesi and Gollundello provinces have not yet arrived in the affected areas.
Remedial relief materials transferred from the capital Jakarta are being transported to the affected areas by air force transport aircraft.
In view of the damage caused by the tower and runway of Palu airport in the earthquake, in order to ensure the safety and security of rescue, all commercial flights have been grounded, and military aircraft carrying relief supplies and personnel have taken off and landed.
Indonesia's co-ordinating minister for political, legal and security affairs in the earthquake-stricken area called for the resumption of power supply and airport commercial flight services as soon as possible to ensure the operation of rescue institutions such as hospitals, so that more rescue workers, volunteers and aid materials can be transported to the affected areas.
There were a number of consecutive strong earthquakes in Dongala County, Sulawesi Province, Indonesia on the 28th, of which a 7.7-magnitude earthquake occurred at 17.02 local time, causing a major disaster in Palu City, Dungala County and Xiji District.
BEIJING, Oct. 1 (Reporter Yin Li) The turquoise, the sky is clear, the sky is full... Recently, Beijing has continued to turn on the most beautiful blue sky mode, attracting thousands of Beijing people on the social platform fancy show map, in the continuous swipe of happiness, called "under the blue and white clouds, 'drunk' skyline, this is the best business card in Beijing."
Since the beginning of August, Beijing has ushered in the "bluedest sky".
In Beijing, you can see the people at any time or holding a smartphone, or holding a SLR camera to take pictures.
On social platforms such as Weibo and the WeChat circle of friends, you can see the Forbidden City, Tian'an Gate, bird's nest and alleys in the lens of netizens everywhere... all kinds of buildings show different beauty under the blue sky.
Some netizens said that such a "scenery blockbuster" is the best urban propaganda film in Beijing; there are netizens ridiculed that if such a blue sky for a long time, people with cervical spondylosis can be cured; more netizens hope that "this kind of blue can overwinter and meet the spring and summer, so that the sky curtain in Beijing will be blue."
Why do people in Chicago love the blue sky?
Just because the people who lived in this city in the past suffered from smog, they were particularly eager for the blue sky, and in Beijing launched the "blue sky defense war", after the continuous improvement of air quality, the smog has become less and the blue sky has increased, and the people are happy in their eyes.
On the day of the National Day, the weather in Beijing was fine.
At 8 a.m., the vast majority of the city's 35 air quality monitoring stations were displayed as "first-class excellent" green.
On the social platform, the "bluedest sky"-themed photo contest by the public is still continuing.
Why is the sky so blue in Beijing lately?
According to the relevant person in charge of the Beijing Municipal Environmental Protection Bureau, in August this year, the average concentration of fine particulate matter (PM2.5) in Beijing was 35 micrograms per cubic meter, the best record for the same period in the history of the past five years.
The real-time concentration of PM2.5 in September is a single-digit.
One of the major factors in the emergence of the "bluedest sky" is the overall favorable meteorological conditions in recent times, more importantly, Beijing has persistently carried out air pollution control, vigorously promoted the clean air action plan in the past five years, the continuous release of environmental benefits, and reduced the total amount of pollutant emissions in the region, which has laid the foundation for the continuous improvement of air quality.
In 2013, Beijing officially released and implemented the "Beijing Clean Air Action Plan 2013-2017".
According to the plan, officials continue to guide non-capital functional dredging, promote energy clean substitution and pollution reduction, a total of 4,923 coal-fired boilers have been phased out.
As a result, Beijing has become the first large city in mainland China to achieve full-network natural gasization.
According to the data, from 2013 to 2017, the average annual concentration of PM2.5 in Beijing decreased by 35.6%; the average number of air quality days increased by 50 days; the number of first-level preferential days increased by 25 days; the number of heavy pollution days decreased by 35 days, and the incidence of heavy pollution decreased significantly.
At the same time as the continuous improvement of the air quality, according to the analysis of a new round of PM2.5 sources, in September this year, the "three-year plan of action for winning the blue sky defense war in Beijing" was released, in view of the current governance stage and pollution characteristics, focusing on key prevention and control areas such as diesel trucks, dust, and volatile organic compounds, optimizing and adjusting the transportation structure, industrial structure, energy structure and land use structure, strengthening regional joint prevention and control, focusing on strengthening urban fine management, and comprehensively promoting green development.
During the National Day Golden Week this year, relevant departments such as the Municipal Tourism Commission, industry and commerce, urban management, public security and other relevant departments will strengthen the law enforcement inspection of the "one-day tour" market, focusing on the "six black" chaos of tourism, and once the violators have been verified, they will be severely and severely punished in accordance with the law.
On the morning of yesterday, the municipal government held a special meeting to severely crack down on illegal "one-day trips", and deployed special actions to further crack down on the illegal "one-day tour".
At the meeting, it was revealed that focusing on the "six blacks" chaos, focusing on the intertwined "six blacks" in the interest chain of black tickets, black guides, black guides, black cars, black shops and black net interest chains, the city has launched a special action to crack down on illegal "one-day tours" since July 28.
So far, the city has accepted a total of 39 "one-day tour" complaints, down 63% year-on-year; since this year, the city has accepted 270 "one-day tour" complaints, down 62% year-on-year.
In the past two months, the city seized 248 sets of "black cars", investigated and dealt with 158 violations of the tourism passenger transport business, shut down 29 shopping "black shops" and performing arts venues, investigated and dealt with 13 "black society", "black guide" 27 people, confiscate 26,000 illegal advertisements, remove 31 illegal "one-day tour" billboards, 3 bus fake station signs, investigate and deal with all kinds of travel-related violations.
After remediation, the illegal "one-day tour" chaos has basically been curbed, and the "one-day tour" market order has shown a steady and positive trend.
According to reports, in recent years, the city has continued to increase the rectification of illegal "day trips".
In terms of 2016 and 2017, the Municipal Tourism Commission accepted 1,612 and 897 "day trips" complaints, a decrease of 79% and 44% year-on-year respectively, but the illegal "one-day tour" is still repeated and constantly rebounded, and has formed a "six black" chaos where the interest chains such as black tickets, black guides, black societies, black cars, black shops, and black nets are intertwined.
In particular, the street illegal pick-up personnel is "black ticket", the illegal website that publishes false tourism information is the "black network", the travel agency engaged in the illegal "day tour" or does not have the qualification of the travel agency or the "black society", the "black club" hired without a tour license or illegal practice of the tour guide is "black guide", its use of non-tour tourism passenger qualification vehicles or for illegal "day tour" to provide passenger transport services of the "black car".
In this special operation, the city has continued to increase the fixed inspection and mobile inspection of illegal "one-day tour", in response to illegal "one-day tour" high-incidence and influential tourist routes, the relevant departments have sent unannounced visits to the group every day, found illegal and illegal evidence in accordance with the law.
Among them, "black car" and "black shop" has become the focus of the special action of the two.
According to reports, there is no black car, the illegal "day tour" can not travel, the black car is easy to find, remember and investigate, but also a fixed asset with a relatively high value.
The use of road traffic monitoring probes to increase the supervision of key "one-day tour" route tourism bus, the use of scientific and technological intelligent means such as technical defense, material defense and other intelligent means can be found in a timely manner "black car".
Tourism shopping "black shop" due to a small number, sitting business, has also become the focus.
In order to strengthen the deterrence and crackdown on illegal "one-day trips", all functional departments in the special operation will be severely punished in accordance with the law.
In August of this year, the city also held a seminar on relevant legal issues to strictly combat illegal "one-day tour" to discuss the combination of administrative punishment and criminal conviction.
The municipal tourism committee said that in the future, it will encourage more regular travel agencies to carry out Beijing's "one-day tour" and increase the supply of regular "one-day tours" to further squeeze the living space of illegal "one-day tour".
In addition, the Municipal Tourism Commission has also continuously improved the electronic itinerary information system of tour groups to ensure that each team is included in the supervision of the electronic itinerary platform.
From a tourist symbol to a digital economy symbol, what has Wuzhen experienced in these years?
As the permanent site of the World Internet Conference, how Wuzhen undertakes the dividends of the summit is of great concern.
Since the beginning of the first World Internet Conference, in the past five years, the changes in Wuzhen have been obvious to everyone.
In 2014, there were only 12 enterprises related to the digital economy and the Internet, and by the third quarter of this year, there were more than 500.
This is a microcosm of Wuzhen's development of the digital economy.
The convening of the Internet Conference, so that local enterprises can accept the enlightenment of the digital economy and the wave of digitalization at zero distance, the desire for enterprise transformation and upgrading is very strong, and traditional manufacturing enterprises have increased their investment and research and development in machine substitution, intelligent management and other aspects.
Jiang Wei, party secretary of Wuzhen town, said that Wuzhen will build a new economic empowerment center in the future.
The development of the digital economy is inseparable from the support of infrastructure.
This year, on the basis of achieving 4G communication network and full coverage of free WiFi, Wuzhen launched the 5G pilot work.
At the same time, as the first county-level city in the country to build a special channel for international Internet data, Tongxiang City, where Wuzhen is located, has also become a hot land for the development of the Internet industry.
Since the first World Internet Conference, Tongxiang has introduced a total of 565 digital economy projects, with a total planned investment of 37.725 billion yuan, and in the first three quarters of this year, the core manufacturing industry of the digital economy has achieved a total output value of 8.73 billion yuan, and the added value has increased by 13% year-on-year.
â€œWuzhen used to be a tourist symbol, and then there were more theatrical and cultural symbols. Because of the Internet conference, it has now become a symbol of the Internet and the digital economy.â€
Sheng Yongjun, secretary of the Tongxiang Municipal Party Committee, believes that the dividends of the World Internet Conference have accumulated over time, so it is even more necessary to build a platform to undertake the superimposed introduction of talents, projects, technologies and other factors.
Tongxiang people have been working abroad for more than 20 years, due to the connection with the Internet conference, returning home to start a business.
On December 2 of last year, he entered the 4th Internet Light Expo with a high-capacity tamper-proof digital technology solution, which was favored by many customers.
Shen Yi chose to start a business in Wuzhen is not only because of his hometown complex, "in Wuzhen, it's easier to recruit than I thought, our application also landed very quickly, Wuzhen intelligent parking project has our application."
A Wuzhen Avenue, showing the spillover effect of the Internet conference.
This road that runs through the north and south of Tongxiang not only connects tourist attractions, but is also an industrial avenue.
Relying on it, Wuzhen Avenue science and technology agglomeration area came into being.
The reporter learned that in the future, Wuzhen Avenue will become the main position for the industrial development of Tongxiang, taking the lead in a large-scale application of intelligent medical care, smart old-age care, smart government and other achievements, and gathering industries accounting for 80% of the city's GDP and many high-level talents.
Tsunami caused by earthquake in Indonesia has killed at least 410 people.
According to the evening of the 29th of the public information director of the Jakarta police in Indonesia, the earthquake in Central Sulawesi province has killed 410 people, of which 97 people have been identified.
Twenty-nine people were missing and 540 were injured.
Palu airport remains closed.
The survival rate of premature babies aged 29 weeks and above in China has reached 98%, which has reached the level of developed countries.
SHANGHAI, Sept. 30 (Xinhua) -- The National Children's Medical Center and Fudan University Affiliated Pediatric Hospital disclosed on the 30th that it has introduced Canada's advanced methods in leading the "China NICU Inpatient Premature Prognosis Quality Improvement Project".
The results of the project show that after active treatment, the survival rate of premature babies aged 29 weeks and above in China has reached the level of developed countries, but there is still much room for improvement in the uncomplicated survival rate of premature and premature infants with very small gestation age.
In the past 20 years, the Chinese government has been concerned about the treatment of newborns.
At present, the infant mortality rate in the Shanghai region has dropped to 3.71 ‰, which is significantly lower than the national average and has reached the advanced level of developed countries.
Through four years of unremitting efforts to improve the quality of premeditated premature babies, the quality of life of prempant babies has been greatly improved.
Professor Cao Yun, director of the neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) of Fudan University Affiliated Pediatric Hospital, told reporters that while improving the survival rate of premature babies, paying attention to reducing the survival quality of premature babies, reducing the incidence of complication, improving the prognosis of neurodevelopment, and improving the overall outcome of children is of great significance to improving the overall survival quality of premature babies and the quality of the population.
Through four years of unremitting efforts, tens of thousands of premature infants with a gestational age of 33 weeks and below have been included in tens of tens of thousands of preterm babies with a gestational age of 33 weeks and below, reducing the mortality rate of premature babies with small gestation age and small birth weight by 1/3, while the incidence of serious complications in preterm infants has decreased significantly, greatly improving the quality of survival of premature babies.
Through the establishment of a national neonatal quality improvement cooperation network and the introduction of a collaborative quality improvement concept, radiate 25 collaborative hospitals across China, and establish a complete, systematic and effective collaborative quality improvement method suitable for domestic national conditions to improve the prognosis of premature infants and improve the level of neonatal treatment.
Fudan paediatric hospital is working with the national neonatology department to develop guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of neonatal infections according to the accumulated experience of the project, so as to provide reference and guidance for the standardized diagnosis and treatment of neonatal infections in China.
It is understood that in the "China Premature Prognosis Quality Improvement Project", paediatric hospitals have introduced the EPIQ method to 25 large NICUs in 19 provinces across the country, and are committed to solving the problem of premature baby infections that plague China's neonatal monitoring units.
After more than 10 years of continuous improvement, Canada's no-complication survival rate of premature babies has increased by about 1/3, and Canada is now one of the world's best prognosis for premature babies.
The EPIQ method has now been applied to all NICUs in Canada and has been adopted in six countries.
Paediatric hospitals revealed that two years after the EPIQ intervention, the infection of preterm infants fell by 35%, while the use of antibiotics fell by 20%.
In the future, paediatric hospitals affiliated to Fudan University will continue to promote and implement this method nationwide, focusing on comprehensively reducing the incidence of all communicants in preterm infants and improving the quality of treatment for newborns across the country.
At present, it is an indisputable fact that there are differences in the level of treatment in various parts of China and unevenness.
As an important construction unit of the National Children's Medical Center, paediatric hospitals will play a leading role in radiation, and this study covers many western provinces such as Xinjiang, Guizhou, Gansu and Shaanxi, in order to gradually promote the homogenization and standardization of neonatal treatment throughout the country.
It is understood that Fudan paediatric hospital is working with the strength of the national neonatology department, based on the accumulated experience of the project to develop guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of neonatal infections, and provide reference and guidance for the standardized diagnosis and treatment of neonatal infections in China.
It is revealed that in 2019, the coordination center is located in the China Newborn Cooperation Network of affiliated paediatric hospitals of Fudan University, and will jointly carry out the next stage of national quality improvement with 63 hospitals across the country, in order to promote the homogeneous development of China's neonatal treatment level.
Wu Xianlei, director of the Shanghai Municipal Health and Family Planning Commission, said that Shanghai can become a central city in the center of Asia, which is not only reflected in research and the construction of the entire service system, the quality of service and service results should have a place in Asia, so as to truly reflect China's medical level.
Xin Zhenping: Building the "Hero Monument" in the heart - written on the Fifth Martyrs' Day.
On September 30, on the eve of the 69-year-old birthday of the Republic, we ushered in the 5th Martyr's Remembrance Day, and Xi Jinping and other party and state leaders came to Tiananmen Square to participate in the flower basket ceremony to the people's heroes.
At this time, wherever you are, please pay homage.
Remembrance Day is rejuvenation, and it’s a wake-up call.
Open the heavy history, behind every martyr's name, is a vivid life.
They also have a fiery youth, a sincere love, and a concerned family.
However, because they firmly believe that "theism we believe in is the truth of the universe", they are willing to sacrifice everything in order to â€œexorcate the suffering of the next generation.
â€œWhen I live one day, I will cry one day for China.â€
Traveling through time and space, heroes set up spiritual signposts and guided the direction of progress.
â€œWhere do you come from, where are you going, â€œWhat kind of a kind of person you are going to be â€œWhat kind of a person you want to know?
The most important thing is to build a "monument of heroes" in the heart.
According to incomplete statistics, since the beginning of the revolutionary war, there have been about 20 million martyrs who bravely died for national independence, people's liberation and national prosperity.
For a variety of reasons, many martyrs didn’t even leave their names.
Countless heroes water ideals with blood, practice their beliefs with their lives, remember their English names, and pass on their spirit, which is to protect the roots and soul of the nation.
This "monument of heroes" does not have any defacement or destruction.
For a period of time, historical nihilism, pan-entertainment and other undercurrents.
All kinds of practices that distort history and depreciate heroes, challenge the conscience of justice, and decipher the value judgment, arouse the public anger and alarm of the whole society.
Heroes cannot be blasphemed and heroes cannot be forgotten.
The act of touching the bottom line should not be allowed, and we must dare to shine the sword and safeguard the dignity of heroism with the rule of law and justice.
On May 1 of this year, the Protection Law of Heroes and Martyrs was officially implemented.
Juddging from judicial practice, the verdicts in some cases are popular, not only to effectively maintain the glorious image of Yinglie in accordance with the law, but also to release the positive energy of renouncing heroes and renouncing martyrs.
A nation that pursues can’t live without a hero, and an ideal country can’t live without a vanguard.
Remembrance of martyrs and calls for heroes has become a universal social consensus.
At present, there are millions of commemorative facilities of various types in the country, and more than 100 million people visit the Martyrs Cemetery every year.
The human heart is the strongest building block.
Let the heroes, defend the heroes, learn the heroes, and care for the heroes, so that the spirit will be integrated into the national bloodline, and the "hero monument" will stand between the heavens and the earth and the depths of the human heart.
BRUSSELS, Sept 28 (Reuters) - After Italy flouted the European Union’s demands for a large-scale budget deficit, it took a non-confrontational stance against Italy on Friday, but it may take a more aggressive stance if it sticks to too bold goals.
Italy's Euroskeptic government's goal is to run a budget deficit equivalent to 2.4% of gross domestic product (GDP) for the next three years, which shows that there is still no debt reduction in the face of austerity demands.
“We have no interest in the crisis between the Commission and Italy,” the European Commission’s Commissioner for Economic Affairs said on Friday that he was responding cautiously as the European Union’s proposals and sanctions could have had little impact on Italy.
European Union officials and diplomats still hope that market forces will be able to persuade the country to adjust its budget before Italy is formally presented to the European Commission in mid-October.
The euro fell to its lowest level in nearly two weeks on Friday after the government announced its plans, while Italian bond yields hit their highest in three weeks.
If the deficit target remains unchanged ahead of the October deadline, the European Commission may veto Italy’s draft budget, something the commission has never done to any country.
Speaking at a later meeting in the Latvian capital Riga on Friday that Italy's current fiscal plan "seems to be incompatible with a stability and growth convention," referring to the EU's fiscal rules.
But he didn’t say it would trigger the EU’s response.
Bidders can submit an application to participate in this public bidding by October 26 this year.
Earlier, the Russian Ministry of Agriculture regarded China as one of the priority markets for Russia's agricultural exports.
Russia's agricultural supervision agency announced in May that Russia's grain exports to China exceeded 1 million tons for the first time this agricultural year, setting a new record.
The bureau predicted that China may be among the top 10 Russian grain importers.
Sapporo, Sept. 30 (Xinhua) -- Following a 3:0 victory over the Cuban team, the Chinese women's volleyball team once again defeated the Turkish team 3:0 on the 30th, winning two consecutive victories in the group stage of the 2018 World Championships.
However, compared with the first battle, the Chinese women's volleyball campaign is even more difficult.
There are a total of 24 teams participating in the 2018 women's volleyball world championships, and the Chinese women's volleyball team and Italy, Turkey, Bulgaria, Canada and Cuba are in Group B.
Judging from the world rankings and the overall strength of the teams in Group B, the Turkish team and the Italian team are the main opponents of the Chinese team.
At the beginning of the day's game, the Chinese team quickly entered the state, took the lead at the beginning, maintained the advantage throughout the whole process, gave the opponent a lot of pressure on the serve and on the Internet, and won the first game more smoothly with 25:18.
In the second game, the Turkish team's service was very ferocious, the opening took a lead of 6:2, the Chinese team requested the suspension to adjust the formation, and gradually chased the score to 7 levels, and then blocked the net score many times, playing a 7:0 scoring tide; at the end of the game, the Turkish team once chased the score to 15:19; after the Chinese team got the game point at 24:20, the tenacious Turkish team chased 2 points; the Chinese team again requested the suspension.
The situation in the third bureau was very glued, and the scores of the two sides rose alternately, and at one point they reached 19 levels.
At the crucial moment, the Turkish team made a mistake, the Chinese team took the lead by 21:19, and with Zhu Ting's strong kill and Zhang Chang Ning's attack to 24:21 to obtain the match point; then the Turkish team chased the score to 23:24, after the Chinese team requested the suspension, Zhang Changning attacked the score, and the Chinese team locked the victory with 25:23.
The Chinese women's volleyball coach Lang Ping admitted after the game that the whole game was not easy.
â€œWe are more fully prepared, the net is good, the Turkish team technology is more comprehensive, we have to reduce mistakes, and strive to win through their own active score.â€
In the face of unfamiliar teammates, Zhu Ting, who plays for Turkey's Wakifo Bank, was subjected to a lot of restrictions in the first game on the same day, and then she took the initiative to change and still played a strong attack.
"And the opponent is very familiar with each other, by the opponent's attention is very normal, but the Chinese team to play to the extreme, in the case of unsatisfied blocking the net and the attack are playing very well."
Next, the Chinese women's volleyball team will truce one day to carry out physical fitness and technical training; on October 2, it will face the third opponent, the Canadian team in the group stage.
Zhongxin network Hengshui September 30 (Cui Zhiping Wang Peng) On the 30th, Hebei Hengshui High-tech Zone held a centralized opening ceremony for key projects in the second half of 2018.
On the same day, six projects were started, with a total investment of 4.29 billion yuan.
On the same day, Hengshui Municipal Party Standing Committee and Vice Mayor Yang Shikun announced the start of construction.
According to Hebei Hengshui high-tech zone management committee director Yao happiness, today's six projects, a total investment of 4.29 billion yuan, are industrial projects, including the transformation and upgrading of traditional industries, as well as the cultivation and introduction of emerging industries, covering civil-military integration, cloud factories, food, medicine, chemical and many other industries, projects with high scientific and technological content, high industrial level and high value-added products.
It is believed that the construction and commissioning of these projects will surely inject a strong impetus into high-tech zones to achieve the goal of "constructing 100 billion-level industrial parks and creating national-level high-tech zones" ahead of time.
Hengshui Municipal Party Committee Standing Committee, Vice Mayor Yang Shikun announced the start of the project.
Yao said that the district has successfully carried out a series of major activities such as the China · Hengshui International Life Science Summit and the Great Health Industry Development Forum, the Hengshui Summit of high-end equipment industry of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, and the Hengshui Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei "dual synergy" innovation forum in 2018, vigorously developing three strategic emerging industries such as new material energy, big health and high-end equipment manufacturing.
The Sino-US stem cell project will be officially put into operation by the end of the year.
Zhongke corritium and tweetar project ten thousand-ton pilot base, the domestic first, the world's world's largest supercritical carbon dioxide compressor experimental platform began construction.
Xiong'an (Hengshui) advanced supercomputing centers among the world's top ten has been approved and built by provinces and cities.
Yao happiness said that by the end of the year, the district will complete the two main projects of 240,000 square meters such as digital information, new energy and new materials, life and health three research and development bases and display centers.
It will actively build an "upgraded version" of the innovation model of the "Chinese Academy of Sciences +", build a "two houses, a platform and a base", and promote the integration and innovation of scientific and technological achievements through multi-disciplinary interdisciplinary, multi-unit collaboration, and multi-industry integration.
Nearly 1,000 state-owned scenic spots reduced ticket prices by more than half by more than 20%
[Summary] As of September 28th, all localities have issued and announced 981 scenic spot free opening or price reduction measures to the public (free opening of 74, 907 price cuts), Yunnan Stone Forest, Dali Santa, Yulong Xueshan, Guangxi Guilin Li River, Fujian Wuyi Mountain, Hunan Zhangjiajie, Shaanxi pedestal, Jiangxi Sanqing Mountain, Xinjiang Kanas and other scenic spots have been implemented.
In order to implement the central economic work conference and the decision-making and deployment of the "government work report", the National Development and Reform Commission on June 28 issued the "Guidance on improving the ticket price formation mechanism of state-owned scenic spots to reduce ticket prices in key state-owned scenic spots" (hereinafter referred to as the "guidance") (hereinafter referred to as the guidance), which requires the reasonable definition of ticket pricing cost composition, innovative price management methods, and strict implementation of pricing procedures.
In accordance with the deployment requirements, all localities have actively carried out their work and have successively reduced the ticket prices of a number of key state-owned scenic spots.
As of September 28th, 981 scenic spots have been implemented or issued to the public announced 981 scenic spots free opening or price reduction measures (free opening of 74, 907 price cuts), of which 5A-level scenic spots 159, 4A-level Scenic Area 534, a total of 693, accounting for 70.6%.
Among the 907 scenic spots with a price reduction of more than 20%, 491, accounting for 54.3%, a decrease of more than 30% of 214, accounting for 23.6%.
Yunnan, Shandong, Guangxi, Shaanxi and other provinces have a large number of price-decreased scenic spots, of which the number of reduced-price scenic spots in Yunnan is more than 100, with an overall decline of more than 30%.
Anhui, Chongqing and other 8 provinces (autonomous regions and municipalities) government pricing 5A-level Scenic Area all achieved price reduction.
The high degree of social concern in Yunnan Shilin, Dali Santa, Yulong Xueshan, Guangxi Guilin Lijiang River, Fujian Wuyi Mountain, Hunan Zhangjiajie, Shaanxi soldiers and horses, Jiangxi Sanqing Mountain, Xinjiang Kanas and other scenic spots have implemented price cuts.
The ticket prices of key state-owned scenic spots have gradually returned to a reasonable range, which is conducive to promoting the transformation and upgrading of the tourism industry from the ticket economy to the industrial economy, niche tourism to mass tourism and attraction tourism to global tourism, which is conducive to the formation of a virtuous cycle of optimizing the supply structure of tourism and the steady expansion of tourism consumption demand, and promoting the sustainable and healthy development of scenic spots and tourism.
At the same time, the National Development and Reform Commission also stressed that all localities should strengthen the price order norms of scenic spots, guide scenic spots to improve services, and ensure that price cuts do not reduce quality.
In addition, the National Development and Reform Commission has carried out a special inspection on issues such as the decline in ticket prices of individual scenic spots reflected by the recent media, requiring all localities to seriously deal with them, respond to social concerns in a timely manner, and effectively implement the price reduction in place.
The CCPIT carries out short-, medium- and long-term optimization work in an orderly manner
The Macao Trade and Investment Promotion Bureau has submitted a short, medium- and long-term optimization work report on "major investment immigrants" and "skilled immigrants". At present, in addition to stepping up the promotion and implementation of various tasks in the report, it has also continuously listened to the opinions of the society and continuously optimized the content of the report and related work.
As soon as possible, the CCPIT will introduce the relevant optimization work to all sectors of society.
Of these, five are short-term measures to be carried out this year; five are medium-term measures to be carried out in 2019; and 1 are long-term measures.
In addition, the CCPIT also fully reviewed the internal management system in accordance with the instructions of the Secretary for Economic and Financial Affairs Liang Weiwei.
The five short-term measures implemented this year include:
Prioritize the investigation of cases that are about to expire in seven years, the cases mentioned in the CCAC's report, as well as the newly renewed cases. If there are cases where there have been signs of misconduct or illegal behavior are found, they will actively refer them to the relevant judicial organs for follow-up;
On-the-spot inspections involving “major investment immigration” projects. By the end of September, more than 20 investment projects had been inspected;
To conduct a comprehensive review of the current evaluation system, the six principles for the analysis of investment projects have been redefined in the review of "major investment immigration" applications, and the relevant examination and approval mechanism will be improved by clarifying the elements that are conducive to the development of Macao and the conditions that give priority to the absorption of talents. At the same time, the list of "Five Industry and Ten Jobs" that prioritizes the introduction of talents every year has been established in order to cooperate with the policy direction of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government and attract talents in a more targeted manner;
To increase the transparency of information, including plans to gradually publish approval standards, scoring standards and proportions from the fourth quarter of this fiscal year, and to further refine and disclose approval data;
In terms of improving the work of the recognition mechanism, it has been required to confirm the work in Australia; major investments must go to the on-the-spot verification and submission of financial statements.
The five medium-term measures to be implemented in 2019 include:
Establish a mechanism to regularly listen to the views of the Talent Development Commission and the Economic Development Committee, which held a working meeting with the Economic Development Committee in September to discuss the establishment of relevant mechanisms.
The applicant is required to submit annual financial statements made by an independent third party in order to continuously review the operation of the investment project;
To further standardize the application and approval process for individual cases to reduce human error;
Completely review the current manpower configuration and cooperate with the implementation of a number of optimization measures;
Intensifies the work on the Temporary Residency System for investors, managers and specially qualified technical personnel.
With regard to long-term measures and step-by-step law reform studies, it is expected to carry out the drafting of relevant regulations in the first half of 2019, strive to complete them as soon as possible, further clarify the approval standards, review mechanism and confirmation mechanism of temporary residence permits, and increase the investigation function of the CCPIT, so as to more accurately approve and supervise temporary residence permit applications.
The experts of the national filmless cotton on-the-spot observation and discussion and exchange activities walked into the experimental field and listened to the presentation by the representatives of the academician team of the Chinese Academy of Engineering.
Shaya, Xinjiang, September 30 (Geng Dandan Wang Xiaojun) is located in Shaya County, Xinjiang's filmless cotton planting test base, film-free cotton grows gratifying, compared with the surface film cotton "not inferior", a cluster of snow-white cotton competition "open", hanging branches.
From September 27th to 28th, the national filmless cotton on-site observation and discussion and exchange activities were held in Shaya County, Xinjiang.
At the observation meeting, the reporter learned that the filmless cotton technology system, which is the main body of "China Cotton 619" and its supporting cultivation measures, has initially achieved the goal of filmless cultivation in cotton fields, reducing the pollution of Xinjiang's cotton-grained film to the ecological environment and raw cotton, and making significant progress in the comprehensive technical research and demonstration of film-free cotton.
The academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering, a well-known cotton genetic breeder and the chief scientist of the cotton system of the country's modern agricultural industry technical system, introduced the growth of film-free cotton to the Party Secretary of the Zhejiang University of Agriculture and Forestry.
"Our research and development of film-free cotton comprehensive technology can completely realize the cultivation of cotton without film, which can completely solve the problem of residual film pollution and achieve green cotton planting."
The Chinese Academy of Engineering academician Yu Shuxun introduced.
According to the statistics of the National Bureau of Statistics, Xinjiang's cotton planting area was 35 million mu in 2017, accounting for 61% of the country's cotton area.
Since the introduction of the film into China in 1982, all kinds of crops in the Xinjiang region have covered an area of more than 50 million mu, with an annual use of about 300,000 tons.
Among them, the cotton film coverage rate reached 100%, cotton field film accounted for about 60% of Xinjiang's film use.
Membrane-free cotton can be measured, and cotton production can fully produce 320 kilograms to 350 kilograms per mu.
With the continuous increase of land film input in Xinjiang, the recovery rate of residual membranes is low, the amount of residual membrane in the soil has gradually increased, and a series of problems such as the destruction of soil structure caused by residual membranes have seriously affected the sustainable development of agriculture.
The residual film not only causes serious pollution to the soil, but also has a great impact on the quality of cotton fibers.
At present, more than one-third of Xinjiang's cotton fields have achieved mechanized harvesting.
In 2017, Xinjiang's cotton collection area was about 14 million mu.
In the process of cotton harvesting, a large amount of the surface and the shredded film on the cotton plants are mixed in the raw cotton processing, and it is difficult to remove it in the raw cotton processing process, and it cannot be completely removed in the subsequent textile processing process, which seriously affects the quality of the textile products.
On September 28th, the national filmless cotton on-site observation and discussion and exchange activities were held in Shaya County, Xinjiang.
In order to focus on solving cotton field membrane pollution, simplify cotton planting technology, and improve the efficiency of cotton fields, he led his team through 8-year time, the implementation of "Chinese cotton 619" filmless cotton technology planting, for Xinjiang's agricultural green development "add wings".
Through the new ideas of innovative breeding, it has fostered a relatively precocious, salinity-resistant, low-temperature and abundant new land-based cotton line "Chong cotton 619".
â€œChina Cotton 619â€ has realized a series of supporting measures such as membrane-free sowing machinery under the conditions of film-free cultivation in the southern region of Xinjiang, sowing in-depth improvement, shallow emcharide under membrane-free conditions, suitable sowing density screening, and reasonable chemical control.
At present, Aksu, Korla, Aral and other places have set up filmless cotton demonstration bases, with an output of 4,800 kilograms per hectare.
Membrane-free cultivation of cotton has achieved fruitfulness, savings, environmental protection, and improved comprehensive efficiency.
Zhang Donghai, a agronomist of the 3rd Division of the Xinjiang Production and Construction Corps, said that through nearly six years of research and demonstration of film-free cotton cultivation techniques, the output of film-free cottonseeded cotton can be completely 320 kilograms to 350 kilograms per mu, and may even be higher.
â€œWine-free cotton cultivation technology has great prospects.â€
Zhang Donghai believes that at present, filmless cotton cultivation technology can completely solve the problem of soil residual film pollution, but there is still a certain gap in economic benefits compared to film cultivation.
â€œThe support of cotton purchase price will be conducive to the promotion in the future.â€
In the next step, he and his team will continue to carry out in-depth research and large-scale promotion and application of filmless cotton, make the filmless cotton industry bigger and stronger, and completely solve the problem of soil pollution caused by geomembranes.
Guangdong sea, land and air to actively deal with the National Day Golden Week transport - Sino-Singapore network
On September 29, it is the 7th anniversary of the official opening of the high-speed rail section in Hong Kong, and it is also the first weekend after its opening.
National Day Golden Week (October 1 to 7) holiday is approaching, in the past few days, the reporter learned from the relevant departments, Guangdong railways, aviation, water transport, roads and other transport departments actively plan to increase capacity delivery, the introduction of various safeguard measures to ensure the safe and orderly transportation of domestic passengers during the Golden Week.
China Railway Guangzhou Bureau Group Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Guangzhou Railway Group") said that during this year's National Day Golden Week, Canton Railway Group is expected to transport 17.8 million passengers, an increase of 1.505 million passengers, an increase of 9.2%.
In order to meet the travel needs of passengers, Canton Railway Group plans to open 104 high-speed trains and 85 high-speed trains, which are mainly concentrated in popular lines such as Beijing-Guangzhou, Hukun, Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong, and Hangshen high-speed trains.
Guangzhou Baiyun Airport may become the busiest airport in the mainland during this year's National Day Golden Week, which is expected to transport more than 1.4 million passengers and more than 9,200 flights.
With the increasing number of international routes, it is expected that the significant increase in international passengers will be a significant feature of this year's Golden Week holiday compared to the past.
It is understood that Singapore, Bangkok, Phuket, Jakarta, Colombo, the Maldives, Manila and other places are this year's National Day holiday travel popular cities, Kathmandu, Kuala Lumpur, Bali and other popular tourist places also continue to be popular, part of the flight "one vote is difficult to find".
Some airlines have specifically increased the frequency of operations, such as: Shenzhen Airlines has added one Guangzhou-Hainan flight every day; Iran Mahan Airlines has added one Guangzhou-Tehran flight every Saturday, and Vietnam Vietjet Airlines has added one Guangzhou-Hainan flight every Tuesday and Thursday.
In order to do a good job of holiday protection, Baiyun Airport has increased the protection of key positions such as "station allocation", "baggage guarantee", "check-in service" and "passenger security inspection", and prepared for large-scale flight delays.
China Southern Airlines said that this year's National Day Golden Week routes to ANZ, North America and Japan and South Korea are very popular, and flights to Hainan, Chengdu, Luzhou, Jiuhua Mountain, Anshan, Huangshan and other mainland Chinese tourist destinations are also relatively tight.
China Southern plans an increase of 50 flights during Golden Week, including an increase of 10 flights on the Guangzhou-to-Chiang Mai route.
The Guangdong Maritime Affairs Bureau said that before the festival, it carried out strict safety hazard investigations on key ships such as water sightseeing cruise ships, Qiongzhou Strait passenger ferries, high-speed passenger ships in Zhujiangkou and ferry ferries to ensure that the water traffic safety situation was stable during the long holiday period.
During the Golden Week, traffic in Guangdong Province is expected to occupy the top spot in China.
Guangdong Provincial Transportation Group has recently issued holiday highway travel guidelines, and it is expected that highway traffic will increase by about 12%.
The General Administration of Market Supervision recently issued the "notice on strengthening market price supervision during the Mid-Autumn Festival National Day in 2018", which calls for strengthening price supervision in the fields of housing leasing and real estate, severely rectifying the collusion of rent prices, hoarding rental sources, fabricating false information to raise rents, bundling service charges, publishing misleading price information, and unspecified price violations.
It is necessary to strengthen price monitoring and early warning and pay close attention to market price dynamics.
All localities should pay close attention to the daily necessities such as large-consumption of grain, oil, poultry, egg and vegetable milk and salt, as well as the changes in the market and price changes of the special commodities consumed by local residents on holidays, so as to strengthen price monitoring and analysis and early warning.
As soon as the propensity of market fluctuation is found, take timely and effective measures to resolve it.
It is necessary to strengthen the supervision and inspection of the wholesale and retail aspects of daily necessities, increase the monitoring frequency and supervision of places that are closely related to the daily consumption of the masses, such as supermarkets and farmers' markets, and urge operators to abide by the law.
The notice pointed out that it is necessary to strengthen the inspection of key areas to create a good holiday consumption environment; strengthen ticket price supervision in state-owned scenic spots; focus on investigating and punishing state-of-the-art scenic spots do not implement the price level or fluctuation range stipulated by the government, adding additional charging items without authorization, increasing ticket prices in the form of illegal "garden" tickets, high pricing and large discounts, bundling sales, not according to the regulations.
According to the notice, we should strengthen the price supervision of daily necessities, especially agricultural products.
Affected by seasonal changes, natural disasters and sudden epidemics, the prices of necessary agricultural products such as vegetables and pork in some regions have fluctuated recently.
All localities should take into account the local actual situation, effectively strengthen the market price supervision of agricultural and by-products, cooperate with the relevant departments to do a good job in stabilizing production and market supply, and organize forces to carry out key market inspections and random spot checks.
For goods such as pork with tight supply and rapid price increases, increase the frequency of inspections, and seriously investigate and deal with illegal acts such as hoarding, inflating prices, and complicity in price increases.
The notice pointed out that it is necessary to strengthen price supervision in the field of housing leasing and real estate.
The Mid-Autumn Festival and the National Day coincide with the peak season of housing rental and commercial housing sales, all localities should pay close attention to real estate enterprises, intermediary companies and housing rental-related corporate price behavior, strict regulation of rent price collusion, hoarding of rental sources, fabricating false information to raise rents, bundling service charges, publishing misleading price information, unspecified code prices and other price violations, etc.
The notice mentioned that all localities should earnestly do the price supervision of other aspects of the tourism industry, focus on standardizing the price order of catering, accommodation, shopping, sightseeing, entertainment, parking and other links, guide the operators to do a good job of listing prices and charges, and seriously investigate and deal with all kinds of price violations.
The notice said that it is necessary to strengthen the inspection of transportation prices such as highways, railways, civil aviation, and water transportation, and seriously investigate and deal with illegal activities such as illegal price increases, out-of-price charges, and non-compliance with the regulations.
The "green lanes" for the transportation of fresh and live agricultural products and the policy of exempting small bus tolls on major holidays will be implemented.
It is necessary to innovate regulatory measures and working methods, strengthen the promotion of price laws and regulations for online and offline commodity retail enterprises and e-commerce platforms, urge operators to improve price promotion programs, and investigate and deal with fictitious original prices, misleading price labeling, and non-compliance with price commitments and other illegal acts in accordance with the law.
The reporter was informed on the 1st that on the 15th anniversary of the Shanghai-Hong Kong train, it has experienced three accelerations, and the passenger flow has continued to grow so far; the total number of passengers traveling between the two places has exceeded 1.7 million.
At the same time, Hong Kong and Macao passengers will not exceed 15 seconds.
On October 1, 2003, the State Council approved the establishment of a temporary port for direct-to-car trains from Shanghai to Kowloon, and as the first long-distance railway passenger port directly to Hong Kong in mainland China, marking that Shanghai already has the port opening pattern of water transportation, aviation and land routes.
So far, Shanghai-Hong Kong trains have been in direct operation for 15 years.
On the 1st, the Shanghai railway border inspection, which is responsible for the Shanghai-Hong Kong direct-to-entry border inspection task, disclosed on the 1st that since its opening, the Shanghai-Hong Kong trains have been accelerated three times, and the one-way driving time has been reduced from nearly 30 hours to 19 hours; the average annual inbound passenger traffic has increased from less than 80,000 to more than 150,000; in the past 15 years, the total number of passengers transported to and from Shanghai and Hong Kong has exceeded 1.7 million.
It is reported that in the past 15 years, the Shanghai railway entry-exit border checkpoint has signed a police coordination mechanism with the stations along the Shanghai nine train, and sent police officers to carry out vehicle supervision to achieve the full coverage of 1991 kilometers of service and control.
In the past 15 years, a total of nearly 1,000 cases of various types of violations have been detected at the Shanghai railway border inspection station, which has successfully cracked the cases of foreigners entering the country with false certificates and impersonating exits with other people's documents.
The station has also set up work exchanges and other mechanisms with the joint inspection unit, regularly carried out sudden drills at the comprehensive counter-terrorism department of railway ports, joint prevention and linkage, and built a "three-level moat" protective belt for railway ports.
It is understood that in the past 15 years, the Shanghai railway border inspection department has continuously innovated its services, and the customs clearance speed has been greatly improved.
The border inspection station has also set up a "Jinglan" volunteer service team to provide loving assistance to the elderly, pregnant women and passengers with infants.
The reporter learned from the Ministry of Finance on the 30th that the four departments of the Ministry of Finance, the State Administration of Taxation, the National Development and Reform Commission and the Ministry of Commerce have recently jointly issued a notice that in order to further encourage foreign investors to invest in China, the profits distributed by foreign investors from China's resident enterprises should not be levied for domestic direct investment.
This policy has been implemented as of January 1, 2018.
The notice makes it clear that the direct investments made by foreign investors to share the profits, including equity investment behaviors such as capital increase, new construction, and equity acquisitions made by overseas investors to share profits, but they do not include the addition, transfer and acquisition of shares of listed companies in addition to qualified strategic investments.
Foreign investors who, in accordance with the regulations, can enjoy the policy of suspending the withholding of income tax but do not actually enjoy it, may, within three years from the date on which the relevant taxes are actually paid, and refund the taxes that have been levied.
Not only that, after overseas investors have enjoyed the treatment of the policy of suspending withholding income tax, the restructuring of the invested enterprise meets the conditions for special restructuring, and the tax treatment is actually carried out in accordance with the special restructuring, and can continue to enjoy the policy treatment of not collecting the withheld income tax for the time being.
In order to ensure that the profits shared by foreign investors are actually used for direct investment, the notice stipulates that the profits used by foreign investors for direct investment are paid in the form of cash, and the relevant funds are directly transferred from the accounts of the profit-distributed enterprise to the account of the invested enterprise or the equity transfer party, and may not be rotated in other accounts at home and abroad before the direct investment.
The notice also asked the tax department to strengthen follow-up management in accordance with the law.
Foreign investors have enjoyed the policy of not collecting withholding income tax for the time being, verified by the follow-up management of the tax department that does not meet the prescribed conditions, in addition to the corporate responsibilities for the distribution of profits, it is deemed that foreign investors have failed to pay the corporate income tax in accordance with the provisions, and will be investigated for delaying the payment of taxes in accordance with the law, and the time limit for the payment of taxes shall be calculated from the date of payment of the relevant profits.
The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) said on Friday that it will no longer allow the import of raw materials produced by China's Huahai pharmaceutical industry and the use of the company's APIs.
Previously, a drug produced by Huahai Pharmaceutical was recalled because it contained potentially carcinogenic substances.
The European Medicines Agency said it was considering taking further action on other ingredients produced by the company.
The FDA said it found major production process problems during the FDA's inspection of Huahai Pharmaceutical's pharmaceutical companies and then stopped imports.
The FDA also said it will be banned from imports until Huahai Pharmaceutical discovers how these impurities are generated and improves its quality control system.
Huahai Pharmaceutical issued a statement on the company's website on September 29, saying: "For the problems existing in the official inspection of the United States and Europe, the company is rectified with a positive attitude and forceful measures; the company is very surprised and sorry about the official handling of the United States and Europe.
In the current complex market environment, the company is worried about this.
At present, the company is organizing teams, including professional lawyers, in accordance with the relevant procedures and the United States and the European Union officials to communicate and complain, in order to resume production as soon as possible."
SHANGHAI, September 29 (Reuters) - The China Securities Regulatory Commission (SFC) approved the initial application (IPO) of the People's Insurance Group Limited (IPO) in accordance with legal procedures.
However, the CSRC's official WeChat public account did not disclose the size of the IPO fundraising.
On September 29 of last year (1339.HK), we applied to the China Securities Regulatory Commission to issue up to 4.599 billion A-shares, which are scheduled to be listed on the Shanghai Stock Exchange.
According to the pre-confided materials previously published by the CSRC, the company's application does not exceed 9.78 percent of the total share capital after the issuance of the listing, and it does not include any shares that may be issued according to over-allotment options.
The funds raised will be used to enhance the company's capital.
On April 9 of this year, the CSRC announced the prospectus (declaration draft) of China's insurance.
According to the prospectus, before the A-share issuance, the total share capital of China's national insurance was 42.424 billion shares, assuming that 4.599 billion A shares were issued and did not exercise the over-allotment option, after the issuance of A shares, the total share capital of the group did not exceed 47.023 billion shares, of which A shares did not exceed 38.296 billion shares and the number of H shares was 8.726 billion shares.
On June 5, the Chinese IPO application went through the censor.
As of December 31, 2017, the Ministry of Finance held 70.47 per cent of China's total share capital and the Social Security Foundation held 10.2 per cent.
The shareholding ratio of the Ministry of Finance will be diluted up to 63.58%, and the shareholding ratio of the Social Security Foundation will be 9.2%.
As of the end of the day, the H-shares in China closed at HK$3.52, up 1.44% on the same day.
Ex-foreign aid accuses of playing match-fixing Northern control in response to "unwarranted"-Zhongxin.com
In the afternoon of yesterday, the Beijing Holding Football Club made an official response to the party's former foreign aid Anichebe accusing the team of allegedly kicking the fake ball, and the Northern Controls issued a statement saying that there was absolutely no such thing as a fake ball on the side of the club, which was entirely Anichebe himself in the process of arbitration, in order to cover up the fact that he had flagrantly violated the contract and fabricated lies for the improper economic purposes of his individual.
At the same time, the northern control said that it will reserve the right to pursue the responsibility of the relevant parties by all means.
According to the British "Daily Mail" news, the Nigerian player Anichebe told FIFA that the Beijing Northern Control team he played for last year was suspected of playing a fake ball, including the Beijing Derby in the 21st round of the 2017 season.
At that time, it was the key stage of the Beijing people and the rush, and the final road in the game was 0-2 lost to the Beijingers and Anicheby's first appearance.
For the Nigerian player's statement, the official response was made by the northern control club yesterday.
The statement said that after the club's previous internal investigation, there were no matches in the games that the team participated in.
Anichebe joined the Beijing Northern Control in June 2017, and in December of the same year, Anichebe refused to return to the team to participate in the winter training without proper reasons, and still refused to return to the team in the case of repeated reminders from the club.
At present, the dispute between the two sides has been submitted to FIFA, and the arbitration is ongoing.
The statement also mentioned that the high-profile â€œfake ball chargesâ€ was actually a lie fabricated out of thin air for the improper economic purposes of Anichebe during the arbitration process in order to cover up the fact that he flagrantly violated the contract.
The sole purpose of denigrating clubs and denigrating Chinese football is to obtain improper economic benefits.
The club also does not accept that any organization or any individual, for the sake of its economic interests and personal gratification, unwarranted accusations, defamation, slander and denigration of the club.
As a result, the Northern Control side said that it would reserve the right to pursue the responsibility of the relevant parties by all means.
The Agricultural Development Bank of China will invest 20 billion yuan to support Jilin autumn grain acquisition.
Since the beginning of September, crops in various parts of Jilin Province have successively ushered in the peak harvest period.
The reporter learned from the Jilin Province Branch of the Agricultural Development Bank of China that at present, the agricultural issuance has sufficient 20 billion yuan of credit funds to ensure the sufficient supply of Jilin autumn grain acquisition funds.
It is understood that the food production situation in Jilin this year is generally stable, and some grain processing enterprises have increased due to the expansion of production capacity, the operating rate has risen, and the food market demand has increased.
In order to ensure the supply of grain policy acquisition funds, agricultural issuance has actively carried out the autumn grain acquisition banking enterprise docking meeting by visiting farmers, processing enterprises, trading enterprises and other acquisition entities.
At present, agricultural issuance has invested 5.2 billion yuan to support all kinds of grain acquisition entities to acquire 11.58 billion pounds of autumn grain.
There are more than 120 major grain acquisition entities in Jilin Province layout of nearly 300 acquisition outlets, to ensure "full coverage" of grain-producing counties, leaving no "empty points" in the supply of acquired funds.
The relevant person in charge of agricultural issuance said that in accordance with the progress of acquisitions and the needs of enterprises, if the scale of acquisition funds is insufficient, the agricultural issuance will apply for additional funds on the basis of 20 billion yuan of credit funds to ensure the timely and full supply of funds, maintain the stability of the grain market, and protect the interests of farmers.
A Chinese journalist was taken away by the police in the British Conservative Party every year, and China asked for an apology.
According to the website of the Chinese Embassy in the United Kingdom, the spokesperson of the Embassy in the United Kingdom responded to the reporter's questions on the 1st about a Chinese reporter being taken away by the police during the annual meeting of the British Conservative Party.
“We call on the Conservative Human Rights Committee to stop meddling in China’s internal affairs, stop meddling in Hong Kong’s affairs, and ask the organisers of the conference to apologize to Chinese journalists.
Q: During the annual meeting of the British Conservative Party on September 30, the party's human rights committee held a side meeting on the Hong Kong issue and invited the Hong Kong opposition to make a speech.
A Chinese journalist was taken away by the police.
Do you have any comments please?
In the past 21 years since Hong Kong's return to the motherland, the practice of â€œone country, two systemsâ€ has achieved great success, and Hong Kong's development achievements are universally recognized.
Hong Kong is China's Hong Kong, and Hong Kong's affairs are purely China's internal affairs.
The Conservative Human Rights Committee used the party's annual meeting to hold a side event for anti-China separatist forces, and the Chinese side expressed serious concern and strong dissatisfaction.
We are firmly opposed to anyone interfering in Hong Kong's affairs in any way.
It is futile for any attempt and action to promote “Hong Kong independence”.
The spokesman said that the United Kingdom has always boasted of freedom of speech, but when Chinese journalists ask questions to express their views at the side meeting, they have been obstructed and even personally violated, which is completely unacceptable.
“We call on the Conservative Human Rights Committee to stop interfering in China’s internal affairs, stop meddling in Hong Kong’s affairs, and ask the conference organisers to apologize to Chinese journalists.
The 5th World Internet Conference will be held from November 7th to 9th in Wuzhen, Zhejiang Province, and the world's Internet is about to once again enter "Wuzhen time".
As a global Internet event, the World Internet Conference has received a high degree of attention and wide recognition in the global Internet field.
In the past five years, the World Internet Conference has set up a big stage for the display and exchange of Internet cutting-edge technologies, and the wide application of technological achievements at the conference has added new impetus to global economic development.
Publish results bring together the world's Internet cutting-edge science and technology
In the field of the Internet, what are the top and most striking achievements in the world today?
The leading scientific and technological achievements released by the World Internet Conference can give an answer.
The 3rd World Internet Conference for the first time released 15 leading scientific and technological achievements.
The results of the display are active in innovation, a wide range of applications and a large radiation-driven effect, reflecting the latest and most important scientific and technological achievements in the field of the global Internet at that time, reflecting the development speed and future prospects in the field of network information.
Light quantum computers, 5G, artificial intelligence that is able to calculate emotions, the results released at the 4th World Internet Conference are even cooler.
The organizing committee of the conference specially set up the world's leading scientific and technological achievements recommendation committee, composed of 44 well-known experts and scholars from China, the United States and other 10 countries, gathered nearly a thousand innovative achievements in the field of the Internet from all over the world, and finally evaluated 18 representative results, including "Huawei 3GPP 5G pre-commercial system", "Arm security architecture", "Microsoft small ice", "Beidou satellite navigation system" and "major application results based on the "Shenwei Taihu light" supercomputer system.
At present, the Beidou satellite navigation system application covers more than 50 countries and regions, involving more than 3 billion people.
The Shenwei Taihu light supercomputer has completed more than 2 million tasks and supported more than 100 application studies.
The "Microsoft Little Ice" created by Microsoft's R&D team in China has now landed in China, Japan, the United States, India, Indonesia and other countries, serving as television moderators, radio presenters, singers and many other roles. The figure of China's Internet science and technology development has frequently flashed into the forefront of the world's science and technology camp, attracting the world's surprising attention and becoming a gathering place for the world's top Internet science and technology.
The "Light of the Internet" exposition to build a new platform for technical exchanges
As one of the important contents of the World Internet Conference, the "Light of the Internet" exposition drives the interactive exchange of global Internet scientific and technological innovation achievements and builds an important platform for Internet companies to show the latest achievements.
"Internet of light" exposition showcases the new achievements, new technologies and new applications of the Internet around the world, with different thematic exhibition areas and functional plates, according to different scientific and technological classifications, select the world's well-known Internet companies and innovative enterprises, gather cutting-edge achievements, display innovative technologies, and reflect the light of civilization, the light of the future and the light of the world of Internet communication.
Taking the 4th World Internet Conference "Light of the Internet" Expo as an example, the expo attracted 411 well-known domestic and foreign enterprises from all over the world to participate in the exhibition, covering the latest achievements of global Internet technology and application innovation and digital economic development such as cloud computing, the Internet of Things, and artificial intelligence, highlighting the characteristics of global vision, innovation-driven and open cooperation.
More than 110 new product and new technology release activities held during the conference, and 10 special matchmaking meetings for Internet project cooperation have provided a broad stage for global digital economy cooperation.
A paper test paper, scanned by a mobile phone or tablet, can immediately identify the content and approve the distribution; half a meter high unmanned small car carrying goods, can independently complete the rapid delivery; only with the owner's voice instructions, the smart home can achieve voice shopping, mobile phone recharge, take-out, music playback, "Internet of light" on a top Internet science and technology achievements, has become the global science and technology industry and the development of the Internet to build a new platform.
The achievements of the development of Internet science and technology for the benefit of the people of all countries
The innovative development driven by Internet technology is ultimately to create a better future for the peoples of the world and create a more equal, open and inclusive environment for human happiness, economic development and the beauty of society.
In such a large Internet country with a huge user base in China, Internet technology has a strong amplification effect in terms of specific applications.
For example, China Beidou provides users with high-precision, high-reliable positioning, velocity measurement, timing services, and has a unique short message communication ability; the rapid development of artificial intelligence technology has a reshaping function for the traditional industry, promotes industry progress, plays a positive role in many fields such as finance, transportation, health, and safety; earth communication technology helps to effectively solve the online problems of vehicles such as aircraft and high-speed rail, and improves the user's online experience.
According to the "Statistical report on the development of China's Internet" released by the China Internet Network Information Center, China, as the world's largest Internet market, is promoting social development and progress with a digital process.
The dividend of the development of Internet technology is not limited to China, and its achievements have also brought a strong driving force to the development of the Internet and even the economic and social development of the whole world.
For example, China's cross-border e-commerce and sharing economy have gone overseas to support the world's economic growth; China's cloud computing, big data, Internet of Things, mobile Internet and other new-generation information technology development has accelerated the deepening of the global industrial division of labor and economic restructuring, and reshaped the global economic competition pattern.
As outlined in the Wuzhen Initiative issued by the 2nd World Internet Conference, sharing the results of network development, promoting the early formation of a global network market and creating more employment opportunities will provide strong support for the sustained and healthy development of the global economy, and allow more countries and people to ride the express train of the information age.
It is known as the “Kingdom of Grains”.
From September 30th to October 7th, the 2nd Luliang Famous Functional Food Fair and the first Farmers Harvest Festival were held in Shanxi Luliang Fenyang City.
During the event, representatives of officials from Lvliang Shi District, Fenyang City, Jiaocheng County, Lan County and other places invited tourists to experience the beauty of the countryside through on-the-spot promotion and jointly celebrated the harvest festival of farmers.
On the eve of the National People's Day, during the autumn harvest season, Luliang City, known as the "heavy grain kingdom", held a "grain event", and more than 200 merchants brought 426 kinds of special functional foods to participate in the exhibition.
As one of the main producing areas, Lanxian County in recent years through the research and development of potato practices, the development of the industry at the same time to drive the villagers out of poverty, exhibitors through the "potato feast" food display, the introduction of the new potato eating; merchants from Linxian brought fresh red jujube, green beans, peas, millet and so on.
Luliang agriculture has a long history, grain cultivation began in the Neolithic era, soybeans, beans, lintels and other cultivation history for four or five thousand years, jujube cultivation can be traced back to the Western Han Dynasty.
The unique climate and diverse landforms have formed many special agricultural products of Luliang, which are well-known red dates, walnuts, small miscellaneous grains and fragrant liquor production bases throughout the country.
At present, Lüliang City has initially formed Linxian County, Liulin red dates, Fenyang, Zhongyang walnuts, Lan County Potatoes, Xingxing County small grains, Fangshan Chinese herbal medicine, edible fungi, filial piety facilities for vegetables, Wenshui sea buckthorn, Shilou honey and other special production base counties, has been certified pollution-free green organic product production area of 1.6 million mu, 172 products.
More than 200 merchants brought 426 kinds of special functional foods to participate in the exhibition.
Shanxi Provincial People's Political Consultative Conference Vice Chairman and Luliang Municipal Party Committee Secretary Li Zhengyin said that the city will further expand the opening up of agriculture, promote the docking of production and marketing, and promote Luliang's more well-known functional food to the whole country and go to the world.
In addition to paediatric melon fruits and vegetables, the farmers are delicious, and the beauty of the countryside lies in visiting the ecological countryside and enjoying the actual performances.
During the event, representatives of officials from Shi District, Fenyang City, Jiaocheng County, Lan County and other places introduced local scenic spots to the participants, and invited tourists to travel and sightseeing.
Li Huiyi, deputy mayor of Fenyang City, introduced that Fenyang ancient Yusheng general Di Qing, now has a well-known director Jia Zhangke; in addition to the popular Fenzhou threography song, "no drama culture" and other folk culture, as well as tourist attractions such as "Chinese wine apricot village, rural rejuvenation of Jiajiazhuang, the ecological sacred landscape of the ancient cultural lake."
The implementation of the rural revitalization strategy and the promotion of agricultural supply-side reform are Lvliang's poverty alleviation measures in a series of special hardship areas.
Li Zhengyin frankly said that to win the fight against poverty, consumer poverty alleviation is a very important way to achieve poverty alleviation and increase income for people in poor areas. "We warmly hope that friends from all walks of life will buy products from poor areas and contribute to poverty alleviation and love."
With the theme of â€œcelebrating the harvest, promoting culture and revitalizing the countrysideâ€, the event aims to invite tourists to â€œspecialize mountain treasures, enjoy folklore culture, scenic scenery of Luliangâ€ by organizing activities such as rural tourism, folklore performances, food tastings, special agricultural products and functional food exhibitions, etc. to create a number of well-known agricultural products with high reputation and market competitiveness.
During the event, there will also be investment promotion and trade signing activities, as well as awards activities such as â€œTop Ten Growersâ€ , â€œTop Ten Rich Leadersâ€ , â€œTop 10 Rural E-commerce Leadersâ€ , and â€œTop Ten Famous Chefsâ€ .
The Xiamen Municipal People's Government recently issued a notice that since October 1, migrant workers who hold the 5th anniversary of the continuous completion of the residence permit in Xiamen City, go through the employment registration formalities and participate in the 5th consecutive anniversary of social pension insurance and have the "Xiamen Municipal Land and Housing Rights Certificate" in Xiamen.
Residents whose hukou in Jimei District, Haicang District, Tong'an District or Xiang'an District have completed the 5th anniversary of their employment registration formalities and participated in the 5th consecutive anniversary of Xiamen's social old-age insurance, and owning the "Xiamen Municipal Land and Housing Warrant Certificate" in Siming District and Huli District.
At present, there are six municipal jurisdictions in Xiamen City, which are divided into Siming District and Huli District on the island; off-island Cancang District, Jimei District, Tong'an District and Xiang'an District.
This is the first time since August 2010 that Xiamen has eased the conditions for settling in Xiamen Island.
Xinhua News Agency, Fuzhou, October 1 (Reporter Qiu Xiao'an) On October 1, the "Fujian High-speed Railway Safety Management Regulations" was officially implemented.
According to the regulations, it is forbidden to fly kites, balloons, porous bright lights, aircraft and other airborne objects and small aircraft within a distance of 500 meters on both sides of high-speed rail power lines.
On the basis of superior laws such as the Railway Law of the People's Republic of China and the "Regulations on the Administration of Railway Safety" of the People's Republic of China, in accordance with the geographical and climatic characteristics of Fujian Province, supplementary provisions on the prohibitions and restrictions that affect the safety of high-speed railways, standardize the construction and construction of high-speed railways and the planting of trees and other behaviors, further clarify the main body of high-speed rail supervision and the scope of supervision, and clarify the responsibilities and legal responsibilities and legal responsibilities.
According to the provisions of Fujian Province for coastal high winds, lightweight construction (construction) construction materials and light floats along the high-speed rail will affect the safety of high-speed rail, and it is stipulated that within 500 meters on both sides of the high-speed rail power lines, it is forbidden to fly kites, balloons, porous lamps, power umbrellas, aircraft and other airborne objects and small aircraft.
In addition, lightweight objects such as plastic greenhouses, colored steel plates and sunshades along the high-speed rail, as well as low-altitude floats, plastic protective films and other light floats produced during the construction process, all people or users should take reinforced protective measures to prevent hazards to the safety of high-speed railways.
In view of Fujian Province's high-speed railway tunnels in hilly areas and many high-speed railway tunnels, it is required to carry out the construction of mountain ponds, reservoirs and dykes within 200 meters on both sides of the central line above the high-speed rail tunnel, excavating rivers, dry canals, drilling wells and other acts that may affect the safety of the tunnel, and the opinions of railway construction units or railway transportation enterprises should be solicited.
At the same time, those who violate the relevant responsibilities of the "provisions" will be ordered by the public security organ to make corrections; if the circumstances are more serious, the units shall be fined not less than 5,000 yuan but not more than 10,000 yuan, and a fine of not more than 200 yuan but not more than 500 yuan shall be imposed on the individual; if the circumstances are serious, a fine of not more than 10,000 yuan but not more than 30,000 yuan shall be imposed on the individual.
If it causes losses, it shall be liable in accordance with the law.
It is understood that with the rapid development of railway construction, the high-speed railway mileage of more than 200 kilometers per hour in Fujian Province has now reached 1,516 kilometers, which has realized the city's electric vehicles, and it is expected that in the next five years in Fujian at a speed of 200 kilometers per hour and above the railway lines will reach 2,150 kilometers.
The implementation of this provision will standardize the safety management of high-speed rail in Fujian Province, further implement the responsibilities of local government departments, coordinate railways and local forces, work together to ensure high-speed rail safety, and improve the high-speed rail safety prevention and control system in Fujian Province.
HONG KONG, Nov 5 (Reuters) - China Resources Beer (Holdings) Limited (0291.HK), China’s largest brew producer, announced on Monday the acquisition of six breweries Heineken (HEIN.AS) established in the mainland through its China Resources Snowflake Beer (HEIN.AS), as well as the entire issued share capital of Heineken Hong Kong, at a total cost of about HK$2.355 billion.
At the same time, the company has also signed a trademark licensing agreement with Heineken to authorize CRRC to use the relevant Heineken® trademarks in mainland China, Hong Kong and Macao to produce, market, distribute and sell licensed products for a period of 20 years, after which they will be renewed in accordance with the same terms and conditions for a period of 10 years, until the termination of the trademark license agreement.
In August of this year, China Resources Beer announced that its direct controlling shareholder, China Resources Group (Beer) Limited, reached an equity cooperation agreement of approximately HK$ 28.5 billion.
At the same time, CR Beer has entered into a long-term strategic cooperation arrangement with Heineken, which includes the acquisition of Heineken's existing businesses in China, Hong Kong and Macao, as well as the integration of CR Beer's beer business in China.
The transaction is the further implementation of this cooperation agreement.
CR beer said that the transaction with Heineken provides the group with an important strategic, long-term development and value enhancement opportunity to expand the high-end beer market, so the long-term cooperative relationship between the two sides will be highly complementary.
CR Beer closed at HK$28.85 on Friday, down nearly 4.5% over the past month.
The number of people killed or as many as tens of thousands after Indonesia's strong earthquake and Tsunami
According to comprehensive reports, a 7.5-magnitude shallow earthquake occurred on the Indonesian island of Sulawesi on September 28, triggering a 6-meter-high tsunami.
On September 30, the national disaster response department announced that the death toll had increased to 832, mainly concentrated in the capital Palu and neighboring Donggala County.
Vice President Carla pointed out that because the number of casualties in some affected areas has not yet been calculated, the number of victims may be as many as thousands.
A powerful earthquake on the afternoon of Sept. 28 in Sulawesi, Indonesia, has killed 832 people.
Collapsed thousands of buildings, 2.4 million people were affected.
Palu was devastated, thousands of buildings collapsed and several roads were fractured, affecting an estimated 2.4 million people, authorities said.
A hotel on the local coast collapsed, and only 24 guests escaped safely, and it is estimated that about 50 to 60 people were trapped in the rubble, the scene from time to time shouted for help, and rescuers successfully rescued a young woman on September 30.
In order to ensure the safety of the trapped people, the authorities were unable to use heavy machinery to remove the rubble, and the search and rescue progress was slow.
A shopping mall in the city also collapsed, and hundreds of residents rushed to the scene, waiting for the news of relatives and friends.
Many residents use social platforms to send articles to find separated relatives and friends.
On September 30, local time, a hotel collapsed and the rescue work was carried out in the city of Central Sulawesi Baru, Indonesia.
Palu, 10,000 rescued, 5 foreigners undecided
Authorities said about 10,000 people in Palu were waiting for help and were scattered in 50 locations.
It is reported that at the time of the earthquake, there were 71 foreigners living in Palu, 66 of whom are known to be safe, including 21 Chinese citizens, the remaining 2 French, 2 Malaysian tourists and 1 South Korean are unaccounted for.
The Chinese Embassy in Indonesia, through a variety of channels to verify the situation of Chinese citizens in the disaster-stricken areas, has not yet received reports of casualties among Chinese citizens.
Communications in Dungala County, near the epicentenary quake, were temporarily reported to have killed 11 people, but there were no more details.
According to the on-the-site screen, the coastal areas and ports of Dongara County were seriously damaged, a large number of buildings were swept away, the bodies were scattered everywhere, and the Red Cross rescue team was going to the local search and rescue.
The Indonesian president visited the disaster and said that the reconstruction work should be carried out as soon as possible.
The roads of Palu and Dungala were severely damaged, and Palu airport was only opened for the use of aircraft carrying relief supplies on September 30, allowing relief supplies and personnel to arrive as soon as possible and the removal of the seriously injured.
A number of local hospitals are still without power, and the injured have to be treated outdoors.
More than 10,000 people have been admitted to reception centers, and some people are worried that aftershocks do not dare to go home, preferring to spend the night outdoors.
Following the collapse of the Palu prison during the earthquake, which caused hundreds of prisoners to escape, more than 100 prisoners in Dongara County also took advantage of the chaos caused by the earthquake, and prisoners were set on fire in detention centers.
Indonesian President Joko Widodo visited Palu on September 30 and pointed out that a large number of problems should be solved in a short period of time, including it is very difficult to restore communication.
He called on the affected people to be patient and said that the authorities would start the reconstruction work as soon as possible.
On the other hand, Indonesia's finance minister has announced that the government has set aside 560 billion Indonesian guilders for disaster relief.
Guangdong Province Confirms Case of H5N6 Avian Influenza
The health bureau said that according to the latest report from the mainland health department, a human case of H5N6 avian influenza has been confirmed in Guangdong Province.
The Health Bureau urged residents to avoid contact with birds and pay attention to personal and food hygienic.
According to the data, the patient is a 22-year-old male who now resides in the Baiyun District of Guangzhou City, Guangdong Province; he developed symptoms such as fever on September 25, was admitted to the hospital for treatment on September 26, and is currently treated in isolation in the hospital.
The patient was slaughtered and ate live poultry prior to the onset of the disease.
Since April 2014, there have been H5N6 avian influenza confirmed cases in Sichuan, Guangdong, Yunnan, Hubei, Hunan, Anhui and Guangxi Zhuang autonomous regions.
The Health Bureau will continue to maintain close contact with the health departments of the country and neighboring regions and the World Health Organization to closely monitor the epidemic in various places and in Macao.
In order to prevent human infection with avian influenza, the Health Bureau calls on the public to pay attention to the following matters:
Avoid contact with birds or their secretions and excreta; wash your hands immediately if there is contact;
Do not buy or carry unsanitary birds.
Do not ate uncooked poultry meat, internal organs, blood products and eggs;
Pay attention to personal hygiene and wash your hands frequently;
If there are symptoms such as fever, cough and difficulty breathing, you should wear a mask, go to the doctor as soon as possible, and detail the travel history and animal contact history to the doctor.
