In 2018, a French man named Jean-Claude Arnault disrupted the rhythm of the Nobel Prize after being accused of assaulting more than a dozen women.
His wife is a member of the Swedish Literature Institute and a judge of the Nobel Prize in Literature.
On the 1st local time, the Swedish court sentenced Arnault to two years in prison.
Arnault, a 71-year-old photographer who is also a powerful figure in Swedish culture, is accused of assaulting more than a dozen women.
The discredited Swedish Academy announced in May this year that it has decided to cancel the 2018 Nobel Prize in Literature.
The reporter learned from the China Railway Corporation that today's national railway has ushered in the peak passenger flow on the National Day holiday, and it is expected to send 16.19 million passengers and open 714 additional passenger trains, including 136 long-distance passenger trains in the cross-railway Bureau and 578 passenger trains under the railway administration.
On September 30, the national railway sent 13.108 million passengers, an increase of 58.4 million passengers, an increase of 4.7%, and the national railway transportation was stable and orderly.
Among them, the Shanghai bureau group company sent 25.6 million passengers, an increase of 202,000 passengers, an increase of 8.5%; Guangzhou bureau group company sent 1.855 million passengers, an increase of 212,000 passengers, an increase of 12.9 percent; Beijing bureau group company sent 1.283 million passengers, an increase of 20,000, an increase of 1.6 percent.
On October 1, the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong high-speed railway is expected to send 300,000 passengers (55,000 crossings) and 137 pairs of passenger trains (83 pairs across Hong Kong); the Hajja Railway is expected to send 28,000 passengers and open 30 passenger trains.
In order to meet the centralized travel needs of holiday passengers, the railway department scientifically arranges capacity, optimizes station services, and facilitates passenger travel.
Jinan bureau group company opened a special train for cultural and holiday tourism in the direction of â€œTaizhou and Shui Yun Yanchengâ€ ; Nan Ning Bureau Group Co., Ltd. opened Guangxi Nanning, Guilin to Inner Mongolia Ejin Banner, Guizhou Qianjiang River, Hubei Yichang Three Gorges and other directions to 7 autumn tourist trains; Lanzhou bureau group company added Dunhuang to the North 7528/7527 passenger train, ending the history of the North Mongolian Autonomous County.
In order to express the blessings to the motherland, the railway stations around the railway organization to celebrate the activities of the motherland.
The major railway stations of Zhengzhou Bureau Group Company carry out "I take a picture with the national flag", "the motherland, I like it for you" and other passenger and employee interactive theme activities; Wuhan bureau group company G586 times on the high-speed rail from Wuhan to Beijing, the bright five-star red flag will decorate the car with joy, train crew and passengers jointly perform the "high-speed rail concert"; Xi'an bureau group company Mercedes-Benz in the Shaanbei Lodhu Plateau.
The railway department reminds the majority of passenger friends that passengers travel during the holiday period is more concentrated, passengers who have been successfully booked through the Internet and the telephone but have not yet picked up the ticket, please try to pick up the ticket in advance; please bring a ticket and a valid identity document consistent with the ticket information, reserve sufficient time to collect tickets, security inspection, ticket verification, transfer, so as not to delay the trip.
Chinese State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said in a speech to the U.S. Committee on Foreign Relations on Friday that at present, China-US relations have once again come to a crossroads, and if the two sides can look at each other in a positive and inclusive manner, expand and deepen positive cooperation, and properly manage differences and contradictions, they can open up better prospects.
"The U.S.-China relationship is our common asset, we need to take care together."
He expressed the hope that people of insight from all walks of life in the two countries will take practical actions to safeguard the healthy and stable development of China-US relations and jointly promote China-US relations to continue in the right direction.
Wang Yi once again stressed that China will surely walk a development path different from that of traditional major powers.
This road with Chinese characteristics determines that China will not and cannot repeat the mistakes of national power, and it has also determined that China will not become the United States, will not challenge the United States, and it will not replace the United States.
In a speech entitled "Opportunities or challenges, partners or adversaries", Wang Yi said that the deep-seated crux of the current problem is that some American friends believe that China will also dominate and even challenge and replace the leadership of the United States in the world.
“It’s obviously a major strategic misjudgment.”
However, this self-imagining suspicion is spreading and amplifies the existing contradictions, spawning new doubts and making it more difficult to solve specific problems between China and the United States and encountering more resistance.
Wang Yi pointed out that China is following a path of peaceful development.
The Chinese have never had a gene for external expansion.
We believe that all countries can live together in harmony and learn from each other.
Whether in the past, the present or the future, China will neither copy the foreign model nor ask other countries to copy China’s approach.
When Wang Yi met with former U.S. Secretary of State Henry Kissinger in New York earlier, he said that Sino-US cooperation will be win-win, and confrontation will inevitably lose.
China has always been committed to developing long-term, healthy and stable China-US relations, so as to achieve non-confrontation, non-confrontation, mutual respect and win-win cooperation.
At a press conference held a press conference on Tuesday to introduce and interpret the white paper on the facts of Sino-US economic and trade frictions and China's position.
Chinese Vice Minister of Commerce said at the press conference that China is willing to work hard to promote bilateral trade in a more balanced direction, hoping that the United States can also show a positive attitude.
According to foreign media reports, the Indonesian island of Sulawesi was hit by a strong earthquake and tsunami on September 28, causing serious damage to many cities along the coast, and the latest news shows that the number of victims has increased to 1,200.
Donggala, the town of Donggala, close to the epicentre, was reported to have been hit by two rounds of tsunamis, and authorities believe the number of victims will continue to rise as the "golden 72 hours" of the rescue pass.
On September 30, 2018, local time, rescuers carried an earthquake survivor who was rescued from the rubble of a restaurant in Palu, Central Sulawesi Province, Indonesia.
Officials in the disaster relief department said the tsunami brought huge waves of up to 6 meters, and the impact of the earthquake and tsunami exceeded people's original estimates.
It is reported that at the time of the earthquake and tsunami, hundreds of people were celebrating the festival on the beach in Palu, and many people were killed by huge waves.
According to relevant officials, the tsunami rushed ashore at a speed of 800 kilometers per hour, and many buildings and infrastructure were destroyed.
Tens of thousands of homes, hospitals, shopping malls and hotels have collapsed and tsunami-induced mudslides cut off a major road in Palu, he said.
A bridge across a coastal river in Sulawesi collapsed.
On September 30, local time, Indonesian President Joko Widodo visited the city of Central Sulawisi Palu, where the earthquake occurred.
On September 30, Indonesian President Jo Widodo visited the affected areas and said that he had sent troops to assist in the search and rescue, and called on the affected people to be patient.
Widodo pointed out that due to the shortage of heavy machinery and manpower, the rescue operation is very difficult.
He was informed of the lack of water, food and fuel and other materials in many parts of the disaster area, coupled with the fact that many businesses had been closed after the earthquake and had sent aircraft airdropped materials.
He called on the affected people to be patient and stay in their original position to wait for rescue.
Search and rescue personnel in the city of Palu said that they heard a cry for help in a collapsed hotel in the city, but because there was no heavy machinery to remove the rubble and was helpless, and some people needed to save people with their bare hands.
Indonesia's vice-president Kalla said power and telecommunications had been cut off in some areas, resulting in unimpeded information and that the death toll from the earthquake and tsunami could eventually rise to thousands.
Shenyang Nov. 5 (Reporter Xu Zhiqiang Correspondent Yan Yina) The reporter learned today from the Liaoning provincial court to basically solve the implementation of the difficult scheduling meeting, Liaoning provincial courts in the six-month implementation of the "storm" campaign, severely cracked down on the refusal to implement the behavior, transferred a total of 241 people refused to commit crimes, and maintained the high-pressure situation of cracking down on illegal and illegal crimes.
It is understood that according to the unified deployment of the Liaoning High Court, from the beginning of April to the end of September, the Liaoning court carried out a six-month basic solution to the "thstorm" campaign, gathered superior forces, and launched a comprehensive general attack on the basic solution.
At the same time, in accordance with the law, the courts in the province have organized a "five batches" of fines, a batch of detentions, a batch of restrictions on consumption, a batch of dishonest punishment, and the transfer of a "five batches".
At the beginning of the activity, there were more than 132,000 unsettled execution cases in the courts in the province, and at the end of July, the cases were cleared.
Among the activities, the provincial courts fined the executors 1206.07 million yuan, detained 4,146 people, restricted consumption of 162,844 people, disciplinized 55,128 people, and transferred 241 people who refused to commit crimes.
From January to October of this year, Liaoning courts accepted a total of 29,738 execution cases, an increase of 13.28% year-on-year; implemented 228,558 cases, an increase of 83.18% year-on-year; and executed 31.236 billion yuan, an increase of 74.94% year-on-year.
“Where can I take a taxi, please?”
We want to go to the Golden Bauhinia Square to see the National Day flag-raising ceremony!"
On the morning of October 1, when Mr. and Mrs. Song, who deliberately took a flight from Ningxia to Shenzhen and transferred to the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong High-Speed Railway on the morning of October 1, he was interviewed by the China News Agency at the West Kowloon Station in Hong Kong.
On the morning of October 1, in order to celebrate the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, the Hong Kong Special Administrative Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government held a grand flag-raising ceremony in Golden Bauhinia Square.
According to immigration control station statistics show that as of September 30, the number of passengers entering Hong Kong through the high-speed rail West Kowloon Station has exceeded 300,000.
On the occasion of the 69th anniversary of the birth of the motherland, the West Kowloon border inspection station is expected to have a peak of passenger visits to Hong Kong on October 1st and 2nd.
At 7 a.m. on the 1st, many mainland tourists took advantage of the National Day Golden Week to take a high-speed rail and travel to Hong Kong.
The brisk-footed Mrs. Song told reporters that the National Day holiday is a rare long holiday in the year, to Hong Kong's Golden Bauhinia Square to see the raising of the flag has always been her wish, can achieve this wish on the National Day, feel particularly happy and excited.
However, at present, Ningxia's flights to and from Hong Kong are inconvenient, and it is best to open the high-speed railway in the Hong Kong section, Mr. Song inquired about the train schedule and found that the first bus can be reached at 7:30 a.m., connecting the city's vehicles to the Golden Bauhinia Square, the time is just right.
He sighed with the reporter: "High-speed rail is too convenient, fast and punctual!"
70 short-distance trains within one hour between Guangzhou South, Shenzhen North and Futian and West Kowloon have greatly Facilitate the arrival of residents in the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area.
Mr. Liu, who lives in Shenzhen after arriving in Hong Kong, is preparing to go to the top of the top of the central city of Hong Kong friends.
Mr. Liu said, â€œThe mainland and Hong Kong are on holiday on the National Day, and we intend to challenge ourselves to see if we can complete the 50-kilometer Hong Kong Island Trail!â€
He explained that without the opening of high-speed rail and convenient travel and plenty of time, they would not have dared to easily try such long-distance mountain activities.
Mrs. Yang from Dongguan took his 10-year-old son with her 10-year-old son to Hong Kong to participate in the piano competition, and she proudly told reporters that her son had been studying the piano for three years and spent the National Day in this way felt very meaningful.
Before coming to Hong Kong, she has been taking a bus, but time-consuming, she is worried about affecting the status of her son, this time by high-speed rail in Shenzhen, customs clearance is convenient, the halving of the time, the trip of the Hong Kong section is even more impressive, she said to the reporter: "It seems to take the subway, especially fast, I did not have time to take pictures!"
At 6:44 on September 23, the G5711 "Harmony" high-speed rail train departed from Shenzhen North Railway Station, galloped all the way, and a few minutes later the train entered the Hong Kong section of the Guangzhou-Shenzhen-Hong Kong high-speed rail, which is the first officially operated high-speed train in the Hong Kong section.
Integrating into the country's 25,000-kilometer high-speed rail network and directly to 38 long-distance stations across the country's high-speed rail Hong Kong section, it has also ushered in mainland tourists from different provinces in the north of Tiannan.
Mr. Gao, who came from Changsha to Hong Kong to visit his family, told reporters that before the high-speed rail can only sit in the north of Shenzhen, take the subway through Hong Kong and then transfer to the city's means of transport, change the troublesome and time-consuming, and now sit directly to the Kowloon Center, go home to eat the children's lunch, feel very happy.
He said that the convenience of the "one place, two inspections" customs clearance procedures is beyond imagination, "in less than 10 minutes, the two customs have passed."
The West Kowloon Station, which is adjacent to the airport express and connects land and air traffic, has also become the preferred location for many transit passengers.
Miss Wu from Fujian is ready to go from Hong Kong to the Philippines to spend the golden week, in the West Kowloon out of the gate she pushed the luggage, told the reporter unhurried: "I was not afraid to catch the plane, I did not expect so soon, the time is more than enough!"
According to the trade agreement released on Monday, the new U.S.-Mexico-Canada trade agreement will preserve U.S. President Donald Trump’s ability to impose a 25 percent tariff on imported cars, while essentially exempting imports of passenger cars, pickup trucks and auto parts from Canada and Mexico from tariffs.
If Trump imposes the so-called Chapter 232 tariffs on cars for national security reasons, then both Mexico and Canada will have a quota of 2.6 million passenger cars that are tax-exordinated to the United States every year.
According to the ancillary arrangements, pickup trucks produced in the two countries will be completely exempted from tariffs.
If Trump imposes auto tariffs, Mexico will get a $108 billion-a-year auto parts exemption tax quota, and Canada will get a $32.4 billion quota.
These two quotas are much higher than the existing production levels of the two countries, providing room for growth in their exports.
WASHINGTON, Sept 28 (Reuters) - U.S. President Donald U.S. President Donald Trump’s government and Canada are making concrete efforts to resolve their trade policy rifts after several days of debate, Mexico said on Friday that the North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA) is expected to maintain the form of a three-way agreement.
Although there is a lack of detail, this obvious progress is enough to prompt the governments of Mexico and the United States to suddenly stop their plans to publish the text of the two-party trade agreement and give Canada more time to join the agreement.
Mexican President-elect Andres Manuel Lopez Obrador told reporters in Mexico that the U.S. government had issued a new anti-recommendation to the Canadian government and said that he would continue to urge all three countries to participate in NAFTA.
Mexico’s Economy Minister Ildefonso Guajardo said the timing of submitting the text of the U.S.-Mexico trade agreement to Mexican and U.S. legislation had been delayed because the Canadian and U.S. administrations were “very serious” trying to reach an agreement.
â€œIn the next 48 hours, we will find out whether we have reached the text of a three-way agreement or that we will have to publish the text of the agreement between the two parties,â€ Guajardo said.
Guajardo said his U.S. and Canadian counterparts at the U.S. and U.S. class had “specially asked” to delay the release of the text.
A spokesman for the U.S. Trade Representative’s Office (USTR) declined to comment on the text of the U.S.-Mexico trade agreement or U.S.-Canada consultations.
Officials in Canada’s prime minister’s office and the foreign minister’s office didn’t respond to a request for comment on the anti-recommendations.
According to foreign media reports, in a conservation center on the outskirts of Pretoria, the capital of South Africa, two young lions playing together, it is difficult to see that there are any abnormalities, but in fact, they are unique.
The University of Pretoria announced: â€œThis is the world's first pair of lion cubs born in artificial insemination.â€
Scientists at the university are trying to study the reproductive system of female lions in Africa.
Gans Winter, director of the Mammal Research Institute at the University of Pretoria, said that the two cubs born on August 25 are quite healthy and normal.
After 18 months of intensive testing, his team finally achieved this breakthrough.
"We collect sperm from a healthy lion," Ganswinter said in an interview.
Next, when the hormone content in the body of the lioness, such as the researchers, artificial inseminates it when the hormone content reaches the appropriate level.
â€œFortunately, the result was a success.â€
The researchers, he said, â€œhas made several attempts, but surprisingly, it didn't spend a lot of effort," he said.
He said that the above-mentioned research breakthrough can be repeatedly verified, and scientists hope to use this technology to salvage endangered large cats.
According to the International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN), lions have become extinct in 26 African countries, and the total number of surviving wild lions has plummeted by 43% over the past 20 years, leaving only about 20,000.
African lions are classified by this organization as a vulnerable animal.
“If we don’t do something about these animals, they’re going to be extinct,” Ganswinter says.
The new technique doesn’t have to allow lions to be reared, he said, but simply injects sperm into a congenitable lioness, just as it did for captive elephants in North America and Europe.
South Korea’s exports fell the most in more than two years in more than two years in September, but analysts blamed fewer working-day trips and said global demand for South Korean goods remained strong despite rising U.S.-China trade tensions.
In fact, South Korea's average daily exports increased last month.
In addition, preliminary data released earlier showed a double-digit increase in exports in the first few weeks of September before the long holiday.
South Korea's exports fell the most year-on-year since July 2016 in September, a 5.7 per cent drop larger than the 5.7 per cent forecast by 11 analysts polled by Reuters.
The preliminary value released on Monday showed exports of 50.6 billion US dollars in September, down from $51.2 billion in August.
South Korea's exports to China rose 7.8 per cent in September for the 23rd consecutive month, despite concerns that a growing U.S.-China trade dispute could hurt other Chinese-independent neighbors.
South Korea's exports to the U.S. fell 11.8 percent as sales of petroleum products fell.
South Korea's overseas sales of memory chips and petroleum products increased by 28.3% and 13.5%, respectively, although the market is worried that the so-called chip "super cycle" may have peaked.
However, the impact of the trade conflict will be inevitable, because South Korea's exports are quite dependent on the US and Chinese markets."
Imports fell 2.1% to $4.8 billion, or 3.1% as expected in a Reuters poll.
The initial trade surplus in September was $9.7 billion, up from $6.9 billion in August.
The Ministry of Industry said that thanks to the United States and EU countries, the global manufacturing industry will remain prosperous, which is a favorable factor for South Korea's exports.
â€œIncreased export prices caused by rising oil prices will also be beneficial to exports in the second half of this year,â€ the statement said.
However, the continuation of the trade conflict between the United States and China, coupled with increased market volatility in the United States after raising interest rates, is the negative pressure on exports.
On average, exports rose to $2.6 billion per business day in September, compared to $2.1 billion in August.
South Korea's Mid-Autumn Festival this year falls on September 24-26, so there are only 19.5 working days in September, four days less than the same period last year.
South Korea's exports increased by 4.7% in January-September compared with the same period last year.
According to the Nikkei/Markit Purchasing Managers’ Index, South Korea’s manufacturing activity picked up in September, but was supported by domestic orders, as orders from China and Japan fell, which could overwhelm the outlook for other exports.
North Korean media criticize the U.S. for not easing sanctions
North Korea's "Labor News" on September 30 issued a signed opinion article criticizing the United States for seeking dialogue with the DPRK without relaxing sanctions, calling it a "contradictory" approach.
U.S. Secretary of State Mike Pompeo said on the 14th that "in order to achieve the denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula, the key is to fulfill the sanctions against the DPRK", emphasizing that the United States continues to implement the United Nations sanctions resolution.
In the joint statement between the DPRK and the United States in Singapore, the two sides pledged to establish a new DPRK-US relationship that is compatible with the aspirations of the people of the DPRK and the United States looking forward to peace and prosperity.
While the United States has stepped up its efforts to impose sanctions and calls for dialogue, it is undeniably self-contradictory.
In order to establish a new DPRK-U.S. relationship with the United States, build a permanent and consolidated peace regime on the Korean Peninsula, and realize the complete denuclearization of the Korean Peninsula, we should put the building of trust in the first place and resolve it in stages one by one, starting with what can be done.
The article also said that the U.S. should understand that sanctions will not work against North Korea.
The article said that even the "Northern Devinsk" before the "Kazan" also made the U.S. military admiring.
"We're going to meet a strong potential adversary. It's enough to just look at Submarine U.S. Devinsk."
The current commander-in-chief of the U.S. Navy in Europe Vogo also praised the "Northern Devinsk" submarine.
â€œIt's an impressive submarine. If you look at the development of the Russian Navy and how you use the resources, you will see that its main efforts in its research and development are first and foremost to strengthen the submarine fleet,â€ he said.
However, National Interest still believes that the U.S. still maintains an advantage over Russia in this area.
Fogo said: "I believe that Western countries still have asymmetrical advantages."
Earlier, it was reported that the Russian Navy will install the Kazan submarine in 2019.
Kazan, Novosibirsk , Krasnoyarsk and Arkhangelsk multi-role submarines are "Affoid-M" improved version, with a displacement of 13,800 tons, a diving depth of 520 meters, a staff of 64 people, an underwater velocity speed of 31, will carry mines, torpedoes and "calibre" cruise missiles.
Beijing News (Reporter Ni Wei) On September 29, the General Administration of Radio and Television issued the "Notice on Carrying out the special remediation of radio and television advertisements" to carry out the special rectification of radio and television advertisements from now until the end of this year.
The remediation content includes advertisements with vulgar content, style and low taste problems, and medical health programs that broadcast problems without record management.
According to the notice, the special rectification work focuses on finding and rectification around nine aspects.
In particular, there are advertisements with guiding problems; advertisements with vulgar content, low style and low taste; advertisements with excessive overtime and non-proportion in accordance with regulations; advertisements that exaggerate false propaganda, mislead the audience, or medical, drugs, medical devices, health food, cosmetics, beauty and other issues such as unpreceitable publicity, unobtrusion, unobtrusion, unobtrusion, unobtrusion.
The remediation work will achieve full coverage in the whole country, the rectification and standardization of the requirements of the full implementation to all levels of radio and television media, the frequency of each channel, the program columns and periods, "do not leave blind spots, do not leave dead spots, do not engage in exceptions."
The notice requires that all kinds of illegal and illegal advertisements found in the supervision and inspection should be dealt with strictly in accordance with the "Administrative Measures of Radio and Television Broadcasting Institutions".
If the violation is serious, it is necessary to give serious treatment such as exhortation, notification of criticism, suspension of advertising broadcast until the suspension of frequency channel broadcast, and expose it to the public according to the situation.
In the past few years, the SARFT has repeatedly stopped illegal advertisements.
This year, the State Administration of Radio and Television issued a notice to publicly stop the "0 bubble fruit milk", "Sava Cocktail", "Bonrit plant anti-degeneration and devotion" and other leading deviations and exaggeration of propaganda, misleading the audience and other serious violations of the advertisement.
SARFT has formulated a number of regulations and notices to regulate the advertising behavior of radio and television broadcasts.
According to the "Notice on Further Enhancing the Advertising Management of TV Shopping Short Films", the "Notice on Further Enhancing the Advertising Management of TV Shopping Short Films" stipulates that each video channel shall not broadcast advertisements for TV shopping short films every day from 18 o'clock to 24 o'clock.
During other periods, when airing advertisements for TV shopping shorts, they shall not use the moderator for publicity, shall not use the "sale style" exaggerated dubbing, intonation, actions, etc. for propaganda, shall not use "Orthotic", "shape", "fat-to-fat" and other propaganda or disguised publicity breast augmentation and weight loss products.
"Notice on further strengthening the management of radio and television advertising" stipulates that when the TV station inserts advertisements in the middle of film and television dramas, it is necessary to strictly abide by the provisions of Order No. 61 of the General Administration: 2 commercial advertisements can be interpolated in non-golden time per episode (by 45 minutes), and the duration should not exceed 1 minute and 30 seconds each time; the length of the advertisement should be prompted.
The notice also stipulates that radio and television broadcasting institutions should strictly examine statutory materials such as the qualifications and certification of health information advertisements such as medical treatment, drugs, medical devices, and health food, and resolutely prohibit the broadcast of sex-related advertisements.
In order to standardize the form of health information advertising, it is not possible to publish advertisements disguised in the form of health information special programs.
The special program of health information should focus on scientific knowledge such as disease prevention, control and treatment, and must not contain advertising content such as promoting medical treatment, drugs, medical devices, and health food, and should not be certified in the name of patients and doctors, pharmacists, and experts.
Manturov said, â€œFor the first time, weâ€TMve changed the format of the MAKS International Aerospace Salon. We recommend that China serve as host country. Our Chinese counterparts agreed and accepted our invitation,â€ Manturov said.
Not long ago, Chinese President Xi Jinping attended the 4th Eastern Economic Forum at the invitation of Russian President Vladimir Putin.
It was the first time he had attended the forum.
Ignore the U.S. threat!
The European Union may reach a crude oil purchase agreement with Iran.
The U.S. government recently announced that it will restart a new round of sanctions on Iran in November and even urge other countries to reduce imports of Iranian oil.
U.S. allies don’t seem to listen.
On the 29th, Iranian Foreign Minister Zarif revealed in an interview that although the United States threatened to impose sanctions on any country doing business with Iran, Tehran is close to reaching an agreement with the European Union on the sale of crude oil.
The core purpose of this agreement is to try to establish a new payment mechanism, that is, to replace US dollar transactions in the form of barter or local currency.
The purpose of this method is to bypass the United States and prevent the United States from hindering financial transfers.
At the same time, although the European Union is committed to facilitating the agreement, some French and British officials are also worried that if the agreement is realized, it will be the most open confrontation between the EU and the United States, which opposes the withdrawal of the United States.
According to US media, in the one-hour interview, Zarif's words sounded more optimistic than in recent months.
Because the agreement has the ability to "stripping away" the traditional allies of the United States and effectively break the United States' attempts to reduce Iran's revenue.
â€œThis will make sure that we sell oil and benefit,â€ Zarif believes that under the agreement reached in 2015, countries have the legal right to trade with Iran.
Federica Mogherini, the EU’s head of foreign policy, also said recently that “no sovereign state or organization can accept other people’s decisions about who they can trade with.”
However, she also predicted that U.S. leaders may adopt a series of financial measures aimed at targeting banks, businessmen and countries that do business with Tehran before the U.S. government’s next sanctions in November.
In May of this year, the U.S. government unilaterally withdrew from the Iranian nuclear agreement on the grounds that the agreement was flawed, saying that the agreement could not permanently prohibit Iran's production of nuclear fuel.
The U.S. then threatened to ban companies buying Iranian oil and other goods from doing business in the United States.
This threat caused some companies to withdraw from Tehran, and the Iranian currency plummeted.
Companies such as Airbus and French oil giant Total have scrapped multi-billion-dollar investments in Iran.
British and French officials have said the U.S. government is likely to "have the upper hand."
Of course, according to a recent report in the Turkish media, the US sanctions do not seem to have a great impact on Iran's oil exports.
Iran's oil minister recently revealed that no other country except South Korea has stopped buying Iranian oil.
Zarif and Iranian President Hassan Rouhani both believe that the purpose of a series of US actions is to "tempt" Iran to violate the agreement.
Zarif was also disdainful of a series of verbal attacks by the U.S. side. When asked whether the U.S. would overthrew the current Iranian government with mounting fiscal pressure, Zarif even laughed, “It’s a strategy of regime change, and that’s the U.S.’s real purpose.”
â€œRe-journ Battery Remembrance Fanghuaâ€ : Xiamen Hulishan Fortress Cultural Tourism Market
At that time, Fujian's front-line radio station's first announcer Chen Feifei came to the fort to reminisce about the history of the fort.
The well-marked tourist scenic area, which is separated from the Golden Gate by the water of Xiamen Hulishan Battery, used to be the place where the Chinese People's Liberation Army set up a "front-line broadcasting station".
On the occasion of the 60th anniversary of the "frontline broadcasting station", on the 30th, Scenic areas held the "remembrance" event, inviting a number of historical witnesses to the front-line radio station to talk about the historical changes and witness the development and change of cross-strait relations.
At that time, the historical witnesses of the front-line radio station talked about the history of the fort.
This is one of the 2nd "Xiamen Hulishan Fortress Cultural Tourism Market" series created by Huli Mountain View.
Previously, it successfully held the first event here to create an exclusive cultural tourism brand event that integrates cultural tourism IP, creative market and traditional folk culture experience.
On the same day, under the guidance of the Xiamen Municipal Tourism and Development Commission, the second cultural tourism market of "ancient fort and a new era" hosted by the Xiamen Hulishan Battery Scenic Area was officially kicked off, and in a six-day event, the Mid-Autumn Festival and National Day "happy reunion" as the main tone, so that the people who came to the sightseeing and sightseeing can experience the rich southern style in "eating", "traveling" and "entertainment".
"Hearing the sound of the sea" concert has become a major point of view of the fort cultural tourism market.
Wang Yong, director of the Hulishan Battery Management Department, said that in order to commemorate the 60th anniversary of the launch of the front-line radio station of the People's Liberation People's Liberation Army's Hulishan Fortress, the "Renavigating the Battery Remembrance" event was held to invite a number of old radiotakers to tell the history of the fort, so that people can remember the past.
In addition, this year's series of tourism market activities also includes choral concert activities on the 40th anniversary of reform and opening up, old photo selection activities, 2018 cross-strait large-scale single art installation public welfare exhibition activities.
Among them, "hear the sound of the sea" concert, as a major point of view of the fort cultural tourism market, it is an exclusive cultural brand activity created by the scenic spot, inviting the Xiamen Youth Palace Phoenix Flower Women's choir to work hard to help, singing the 40th anniversary choral concert of the 40th anniversary of reform and opening-up, showing the collision of "ancient fort" and "the new era".
Cross-strait â€œbunny concubinesâ€ large-scale individual art installation public welfare exhibition activities, during the National Day in the fort scenic area to carry out, efforts to create a â€œeyeball effectâ€ , attracting a large number of tourists, the public to visit, take photos, forward the circle of friends, shooting trembling, so that the city of Xiamen added a "net red" factor.
And "Xiamen · 40 years, you and me" - the old photo selection activities, in the scenic area to set up an exhibition of award-winning works, through a photo with a temperature, deep excavation of those moments of happiness and emotion.
Fuzhou, September 30 (Reporter Long Min) The sixth meeting of the Standing Committee of the 13th National People's Congress of Fujian Province passed the "Regulations on the Promotion of Ecological Civilization Construction in Fujian Province".
"Green water and green mountain is Jinshan Yinshan" was first written into the legislation of Fujian Province for the first time, through the entire regulations, has become an operable and implementable provision.
Fujian is China's first national eco-civilization test area.
The person in charge of Fujian Provincial People's Government Legal Affairs Office said that it is very necessary and urgent to form a basic law on the construction of an ecological civilization based on the whole and the overall situation to solve the problem of decentralized laws and regulations and policy documents to regulate the construction of ecological civilization, and to provide a legal basis for the formulation and promulgation of relevant regulations, normative documents and measures.
The regulations fully reflect the characteristics of Fujian, the practice of mature experience in the construction of ecological civilization into the form of laws and regulations to be promoted and implemented: such as Fujian's soil and water conservation governance work can be copied, can be popularized, the provisions of the Fujian province's water and soil conservation management experience to summarize and improve, stipulates that local people's governments at or above the county level should strengthen the unified leadership of water and soil conservation work, according to the results of the investigation of water and soil erosion.
According to the regulations, the lifelong accountability system for ecological and environmental damage should be implemented.
Those who violate the requirements of scientific development and cause serious damage to the ecological and environmental resources shall be held accountable to the major leading cadres and relevant responsible persons who have leadership responsibilities for life.
According to reports, the "Fujian Province ecological civilization construction promotion regulations" will be implemented on November 1 this year.
China and Pakistan agreed to complete the construction project of the economic corridor in a timely manner and accelerate the construction of Gwadar port.
China's foreign ministry said on Sunday that China and Pakistan had agreed to further consolidate and expand economic relations between the two countries.
China and Pakistan issued a joint statement on Sunday to further strengthen their strategic partnership.
The two sides reiterated their "commitment to the construction of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor" and "opposing negative propaganda against the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor".
China's foreign ministry said it would "strengthen practical cooperation in the field of trade and investment and enhance Pakistan's industrial capacity by establishing joint ventures in priority areas, transferring labor-intensive industries, and carrying out cooperation with small and medium-sized enterprises."
According to the press release published on the website of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the two sides agreed to complete the projects under construction of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor in a timely manner, accelerate the construction of ports and supporting projects in Gwadar, focusing on economic and social development, creating jobs and improving people's livelihood, and accelerating cooperation in industries and parks and agricultural fields.
"The two sides also agreed to complete the second phase of China-Pakistan Free Trade Agreement negotiations as soon as possible, and continue to promote the negotiation of the China-Pakistan Service Trade Agreement."
In the joint statement signed on Sunday, the two sides reaffirmed their commitment to the construction of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor (CPEC), which is a win-win cooperation plan that will promote regional interconnectedness and bring prosperity and development to the entire region.
The two sides agreed that the Gwadar port is an important node for cross-regional connectivity and a pillar of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.
The two sides agreed to accelerate the construction of Gwadar port ports and supporting projects.
China and Pakistan also said in a joint statement that they were opposed to the negative propaganda against the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.
The two sides agreed to establish a China-Pakistan Foreign Minister's strategic dialogue and adjust the original strategic dialogue at the deputy foreign minister's ministerial level into diplomatic consultations.
In addition, the two countries will further strengthen defense cooperation and maintain high-level military visits and exchanges between various departments and levels.
In order to further encourage foreign investors to invest in China, China's Ministry of Finance and other four ministries and commissions jointly announced that since January 1, 2018, the profits distributed by foreign investors from China's resident enterprises will not be levied on the scope of application of the withholding income tax policy for domestic direct investment, which will be extended to all non-prohibited projects and areas.
According to the relevant notice published on the website of the Ministry of Finance, overseas investors must meet several conditions at the same time, including direct investment made by foreign investors to obtain profits, including overseas investors to share profits to increase capital, new construction, equity acquisition and other equity investment behavior, but does not include the addition, conversion and acquisition of shares of listed companies (except for qualified strategic investments).
It also includes the profits obtained by foreign investors, which belong to the dividends, dividends and other equity investment income formed by the actual distribution of the realized retained income to the investor by domestic resident enterprises in China.
And the profits used by foreign investors for direct investment are paid in the form of cash, and the relevant funds are directly transferred from the account of the profit-distributed enterprise to the account of the invested enterprise or the equity transferor, which shall not be revolving in other accounts at home and abroad before the direct investment; the profits used by foreign investors for direct investment shall be paid in the form of non-cash such as in kind and marketable securities.
The notice also said that foreign investors, through equity transfer, repurchase, liquidation and other ways to actually recover the direct investment that is not subject to withholding income tax policy, and within 7 days after the actual collection of the corresponding funds, the deferred tax shall be reported to the tax department in accordance with the prescribed procedures.
In order to encourage foreign investors to continue to invest and operate in China, the Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of Commerce and other four ministries jointly issued a notice at the end of 2017, from January 1, 2017, the profits distributed by foreign investors from domestic resident enterprises in China are directly invested in incentive investment projects.
The executive meeting of the State Council of the People's Republic of China decided last week to expand the scope of application of foreign reinvestment without withholding income tax to all non-prohibited foreign-funded projects and fields, so as to further strengthen the protection of intellectual property rights.
The reporter learned from the National Health and Health Commission that compared with a few decades ago, the incidence of malnutrition among children and adolescents in China has decreased, but the incidence of overweight and obesity has increased significantly.
In this regard, experts pointed out that to maintain a healthy weight, the most important concept is to "cure the disease" and vigorously promote scientific fitness and a reasonable diet.
According to China's National Health and Health Commission recently released "China's youth health education core information and interpretation (2018 version)", the key to maintaining a healthy weight is a reasonable diet and scientific exercise.
Overweight, obesity and blind weight loss are not good for your health.
The health risks behind the "little fat pier" can not be ignored.
Ding Gangqiang, director of the nutrition and health institute of the Chinese Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, said that overweight and obesity endanger the normal growth and development of young people, have adverse effects on their psychology, behavior, cognition and intelligence, and may even lead to high blood pressure, high blood sugar and high blood lipids in children.
At the same time, overweight and obesity in adolescents are likely to continue into adulthood, which will increase the risk of chronic diseases such as high blood pressure and diabetes in adulthood.
From 2010 to 2012, China's resident nutrition and health status test showed that China's 6-17-year-old children and adolescents had an overweight rate of 9.6% and an obesity rate of 6.4%, adding up to 16%.
At the same time, overweight and obesity in children and adolescents are higher than that of girls and higher in urban areas than in rural areas, and the rate of overweight and obesity has increased significantly in recent decades.
How do young people cope with obesity?
Zhang Li, deputy director of the scientific fitness and health promotion and research center of the General Administration of Sports, pointed out that the main reasons for adolescent obesity at present are excessive caloric intake and insufficient physical activity.
For this simple obesity, we should pay attention to scientific exercise coupled with reasonable dietary control.
Zhang Li pointed out that to maintain a healthy weight, the most important concept is to "cure the disease", which is a very important part of schools, parents and students to carry out a full range of popular science education, popularize the dangers of overweight and obesity, and to improve the awareness of adolescents.
Teenagers should have regular physical examination, monitor growth and development indicators such as height and weight, and detect and scientifically determine whether the problem of overweight and obesity occurs in a timely manner, so as to take timely interventions.
For teenagers who are already overweight and obese, Ding Gang strongly recommends that in addition to actively and scientifically arranging meals and exercise, young people are in a special physiological stage and should avoid the use of hungry or semi-starvation therapies to control and lose weight.
Sept 28 (Reuters) - Facebook (FB.O) said on Friday that hackers had stolen digital login code, giving them access to nearly 50 million user accounts in an unprecedented amount of security breach.
With more than 2.2 billion monthly users, it said it had not yet determined whether the attackers had misused any accounts or stolen personal information.
The company also did not find the location of the hackers, and it is uncertain whether the hackers targeted specific victims.
Its initial analysis shows that this was a large-scale attack.
In a media conference call, CEO Mark Zuckerberg described the incident as "really serious."
A spokesperson for the company said that his account, as well as the account of CEO Sheryl Sandberg, were also affected.
Facebook's shares fell 2.6% on Friday, dragging down major Wall Street indexes.
U.S. lawmakers said on Friday that the attack could heighten calls for data privacy legislation.
“It’s yet another sad piece of evidence that Congress needs to take action to protect the privacy and security of social media users,” Democratic Senator Mark Warner said in a statement.
Rohit Chopra, a member of the Federal Trade Commission (FTC), said on Twitter that I would like to get an answer to the Reuters report on the security breach.
Zhongxin network Changsha September 30th (Zheng Yingliang Tianjin) September 30th is China's fifth Martyrs' Day.
On such a special day, people from all walks of life, such as the family members of the anti-Japanese war, the representatives of party members and representatives of the Hunan Veterinarian's House, came to the "Tang People's Life Garden and the Anti-War Theme Park" located in Changsha City to participate in the collective burial ceremony of the 2018 Martyrs' Remembrance Day and send away the partners of 10 anti-war veterans and 4 anti-war veterans.
â€œThe veterans of the anti-Japanese war are the witnesses of China's anti-Japanese war, which is a true, vivid and vivid textbook of patriotism.â€
Liu Xiao, the former vice chairman of the Hunan Provincial Political Consultative Conference, said that the patriotic spirit of the veterans of the War of Resistance is a valuable spiritual wealth to the contemporary nation.
In his speech, Zhu Jianjun, vice chairman of the Changsha Municipal Committee and chairman of the Changsha Municipal Party Committee, pointed out that in recent years, the "Caring Against War Veterans" project has provided caring services for anti-war veterans in the form of living subsidies, free old-age care, and free burial, which has become an excellent brand in the social service work of Changsha.
He believes that only by engraving history in the heart can the spirit of the War of Resistance be passed down.
At 11 o'clock in the morning, in the solemn and heavy sound of music, the people who came to participate in the event stood up.
The members of the ceremonial team were dressed in gowns, bosuncing with flowers, marching at a tidy pace, handing out the partners of 10 anti-war veterans and 4 anti-war veterans with a neat queue.
The people who participated in the event offered flowers for the anti-war veterans, and there were still many children in the crowd, and together with their parents, they paid tribute to the anti-war heroes.
"Tang People's Wanshou Garden and Anti-war Theme Park" is the country's first anti-war-themed mausoleum jointly created by the Changsha Municipal Party Committee of the People's Republic of China and Hunan Tangren Wanshou Park Co., Ltd., and was completed in 2014.
The first phase of the mausoleum project covers an area of more than 2,000 square meters and is composed of "hero immortal monument", "Victory Square" and "Anti-war hero mausoleum".
"Anti-war hero's mausoleum" free of charge for the Xiang anti-war heroes to provide behind the cemetery, is praised as "anti-war veterans of the last military camp".
Every year before and after Qingming and National Day, the mausoleum will hold a large-scale public ceremony and burial ceremony.
Since 2015, there have been seven collective burial rituals of anti-war veterans here, and there have been 102 anti-war veterans and their partners.
The newly revised "Three Gorges-Gezhouba Water Conservancy Hub Navigation Dispatch Procedures" (hereinafter referred to as the "dispatching regulations") officially began on October 1, and the Three Gorges Ascension aircraft was officially implemented after two years of trial navigation.
On the first day of the implementation of the new regulations, the navigational order of the Three Gorges-Gezhouba waters was in good order.
The Yangtze River Three Gorges Navigation Authority issued the first security inspection plan at 21:00 on September 30, and carried out the security inspection of 160 ships, and a total of 124 ships passed the security inspection.
At 1400 hours on October 1, the navigation department arranged the first transit plan after the implementation of the new regulations.
After the implementation of the new regulations, the security inspection plan will be issued at 9 o'clock and 21 o'clock every day, and the dam clearance plan will be released at 14 o'clock and 20 o'clock every day, so as to make it easy for the ship to flexibly arrange the dam clearance plan.
The "dispatching regulations" have added the principle of "classification and control" of ship dam dispatching, according to the functional positioning of locks and lifting machines to clarify the priorities of levee ships, and adjusting the short-term passenger ships through the locks to the same priority level as demonstration ships and integrity ships.
This is also after the second anniversary of the test operation of the ascension machine, and it is officially unified dispatch with the lock.
For the first time, Sichuan River and Three Gorges Reservoir Demonstration Veod Demonstration Vessels and new energy-powered ships have also reached the priority level for the first time.
At the same time, the â€œRegistration Regulationsâ€œRegistrarization and Dispatch Management Watersâ€ from the previous 180-kilometer near-dam waters to the Yunyang Yangtze Yangtze River Bridge to the 541.8-kilometer waters, and divided into â€œcore waters, near dam waters, controlling waters, and dispatching watersâ€.
This is conducive to the ship's choice of the appropriate waters for the gate, and to reduce the backlog of dam-by-gate vessels.
Based on the characteristics of the current ship levies and waiting locks, it also put forward integrity restrictions such as canceling the declaration of non-violable ships and delaying the dam crossing for 24 hours.
After the Three Gorges, the navigation conditions in the reservoir area have been improved, which has promoted the rapid development of the Yangtze River shipping.
According to the data, the annual cargo pass of Three Gorges locks and Gezhouba locks increased from 34.3 million tons in 2004 to 138 million tons and 140 million tons respectively in 2017.
In the past two years, 5,767 ships, 162,200 passengers and 1,712,800 tons of cargo have passed the ship.
Chen Dongyuan, deputy director of the Three Gorges Navigation Management Bureau, said that the "dispatching regulations" play a positive role in promoting the management of good-faith floodgates, maintaining the navigational order of the two dam hubs, dredging the pressure of ships in the dam area, and improving the navigation ability.
