The price of oil or ushered in the "three consecutive rises" National Day self-driving travel can be filled with oil in advance.
BEIJING, Sept. 30 (Reporter Qiu Yu) At 24:00 on September 30, a new round of refined oil price adjustment window will be opened simultaneously with the National Day holiday.
A number of institutions predict that oil prices will rise sharply to achieve "three consecutive increases."
The car owners who plan to drive themselves can fill the car with fuel before raising the price.
According to the data of Longzhong information calculation, it is expected that the corresponding increase in domestic refined oil products will be about 190 yuan / ton; the increase of Zhuo Chuang information calculation will be 220 yuan / ton.
In September, there have been two increases in oil prices: on September 3, gasoline increased by 180 yuan / ton, diesel increased by 170 yuan / ton; on September 17th, gasoline increased by 145 yuan / ton, diesel increased by 145 yuan / ton.
The domestic oil price is pegged to the international oil price, since the current round of pricing cycle, the international oil price has fluctuated, and Brent crude oil has broken through the $80 mark and continues to explore.
As of the close on September 28th, U.S. WTI crude oil futures closed up $1.13 at $73.25/barrel.
Brent crude futures closed up $1.0 to $83.72/barrel.
"From the perspective of the international situation, U.S. sanctions on Iran and other tensions, the overall trend of oil prices is strong, and then the OPEC production reduction meeting explicitly refused to increase production, to give market confidence, oil prices steadily moved."
Zhuo Chuang information refined oil analyst Yan Wengang said.
In terms of retail sales, the current gasoline prices of Beijing PetroChina and Sinopec gas stations No. 92 and No. 95 are 7.66 yuan / liter and 8.15 yuan / liter, respectively.
According to Longzhong information analyst Li Yan, the preferential promotion strategy of gas station retail has not changed much, and the preferential range of Sinopec and other main stations is more than 0.5-0.7 yuan / liter, while the preferential range of private gas stations is more than 0.5-1.2 yuan / liter.
"The current round of retail prices is about 'three consecutive rises', equivalent to the price increase of about 0.14-0.16 yuan, it is recommended that private car owners in the National Day holiday before the arrival of full oil and then travel."
Primary school students to do the wrong topic by the teacher corporal punishment involved in the school to cancel the annual evaluation qualification-Zhongxin.com
In response to the incident of Suining a small student doing the wrong subject to corporal punishment by a teacher, the official micro-blog of the Hedong New District Management Committee of Suining City issued a notice yesterday saying that after investigation, Luo XX, a teacher of Suizhou Foreign Language Primary School, is true, has been transferred out of the teacher's post, and the schools involved have cancelled the annual "approval" qualification.
A few days ago, some parents reported that a girl in the 6th grade of a primary school in Suining was beaten by a class math teacher in the school because she did the wrong question, causing widespread concern.
Subsequently, the Social Affairs Bureau of Hedong New District of Suining City set up an investigation team to enter the school to investigate and ask the relevant personnel, collected evidence on the spot, and transferred the involved teachers from the teacher's post.
Yesterday, Suining Hedong New District Management Committee official micro-blog issued a notice saying that after investigation, Suizhou foreign language primary school teacher Luo XX corporal punishment of students is true.
According to the study, the "one-vote rejection" of the year-end assessment of Suizhou foreign-language primary schools will cancel the annual "approval" qualification.
The report also said that a collective admonition conversation should be carried out on the administrative team of Suizhou foreign language primary school to deal with according to the relevant provisions of leadership and class guidance in accordance with the relevant regulations; to transfer the teacher's position and seriously deal with it in accordance with the relevant provisions; to order Suizhou foreign language primary schools to make in-depth inspections, and to carry out teacher-moral construction activities, take practical measures to prevent such incidents from happening again.
At the same time, the school should take the initiative to communicate with the parents of the students and properly deal with the follow-up work.
The 69th International Astronautical Congress opens in Germany
The 69th International Astronautical Congress kicked off on October 1 at the Bremen Convention and Exhibition Center in Germany, with more than 6,300 astronauts, space agencies and business representatives, experts, scholars and young students from all over the world.
Jean-Yves Regal, president of the International Astronautical Federation, said in a speech at the opening ceremony that the global space industry is no longer with the participation of only a few countries and institutions, and the number of participants this year has increased significantly compared with the previous one, indicating that more and more institutions and people are joining it.
He called on all countries to strengthen cooperation and innovation and jointly promote the development of the aerospace industry.
China's Vice Minister of Industry and Information Technology and director of the National Space Administration Zhang Kejun introduced China's space program when he attended the exchange event and said that China will expand international cooperation in the field of space and contribute to mankind's space industry.
China Aerospace Science and Technology Corporation, China Aerospace Science and Industry Corporation and a number of representatives of private enterprises participated in the meeting and demonstrated the latest achievements of China's aerospace industry, including various types of launch vehicles, satellites and aerospace science and technology application products.
The International Astronautical Congress has been held every year since 1950 and is the world's largest aviation event.
The five-day conference was co-sponsored by the International Astronautical Federation, the International Academy of Aeronautics and Astronautics, the Research Centre for Applied Science and Microgravity at the University of Bremen and the International Institute of Space Law.
BEIJING, Nov 5 (Reuters) - China’s Foreign Trade Center said in a press release issued on Sunday that the Canton Fair showed that China's foreign trade situation is still complicated and severe, with 80.6 per cent of companies expecting their exports in 2018 to be better than the previous year or flat.
However, taking into account the continuous increase in the cost of comprehensive factors such as domestic raw materials and labor, and the external environment with increasing the impact of Sino-US trade frictions, the participating enterprises also believe that the export situation next year is not optimistic.
At the closing press conference of the 124th Canton Fair, Xu Bing, deputy secretary-general of the Canton Fair, press spokesman and deputy director of the China Foreign Trade Center, said that the number of overseas purchasers and export transactions in the Canton Fair decreased slightly year-on-year.
Buyers attended 189,812 people from 215 countries and regions, down 1.11% year-on-year.
The export turnover was 206.494 billion yuan (equivalent to 29.86 billion US dollars), a decrease of 1% year-on-year.
From the perspective of the market, the transactions of Japan, the ten ASEAN countries, the "BRIC countries" and South Korea increased by 74.4%, 10.4%, 7.2% and 2.5% respectively, and the traditional markets such as the United States, Australia, Canada and the European Union fell by 30.3%, 8.9%, 7.3% and 0.8% respectively.
From the perspective of the industry, means of transportation, machinery and equipment, construction and decoration materials, electronic consumer goods and information products, and bathroom equipment increased by 24.8%, 21.1%, 20.00%, 15.1%, and 7.6% respectively, while textiles, clothing and household appliances decreased by 13.0% and 6.7% respectively.
Xu Bing said that as a barometer of China's foreign trade and a weather vane, the current Canton Fair purchaser's participation situation and export transaction data show that China's foreign trade development will still face many uncertain and unstable factors next year.
However, with the in-depth promotion of supply-side structural reform, as well as policies and measures such as "six stability" at the national and local levels, the new momentum of China's foreign trade development is speeding up, and new progress has been made in the diversification of the corporate market, which is an important foundation and strong condition for the development of foreign trade.
"Combined with various factors, it is expected that China's foreign trade imports and exports will maintain steady growth throughout the year, and the quality and efficiency will be further improved."
China's General Administration of Customs announced that exports in US dollar-denominated in September increased by 14.5% year-on-year, imports increased by 14.3% year-on-year, the trade surplus was 31.69 billion U.S. dollars in September, and the export growth and trade surplus in September were the highest since February this year.
Despite the escalation of Sino-US trade frictions, China's export performance in September is still significantly more than expected, strong external demand, enterprises in the United States before the imposition of tariffs to seize exports superimposed RMB exchange rate depreciation, or the main supporting factors, but also to a certain extent shows the resilience of China's foreign trade, but the Sino-US trade war on confidence, the impact on the industrial chain can not be underestimated, analysts believe that the challenge of China's foreign trade may appear in the fourth quarter or next year.
U.S. fund managers recommended an increase in their cash holdings in September, continuing a cautious stance as the U.S. and the U.S. began the latest round of mutual import tariffs and the dispute showed no signs of conciliating.
However, according to the 12 fund managers participating in the survey, North America's asset allocation rose to the highest level since June 2017, while the United Kingdom, the euro area, especially emerging market positions declined.
The global stock allocation accounted for an average of 56.6%, and bonds accounted for 55.5%, which is basically in line with last month's survey.
The most obvious change is that the cash ratio has risen to 5.1%, the highest since December 2014.
â€œSome economic data brings confidence to the market, but the trade war is still the biggest concern, so it’s best to be prepared to enter when the market pulls back,â€ said a fund manager of a large fund company.
However, fund managers still favored stocks in September, especially U.S. stocks, even though U.S. stocks were thought to be overpriced.
Today, the world's world's first large-scale import-themed national-level exhibition, the China International Import Expo, has officially kicked off in China's popular expectations.
An exhibition is like a â€œwindowâ€ that allows the world to better understand a city and a country.
Through this â€œwindowâ€ of CIIEâ€ , people have seen moving toward a higher level â€œopen Chinaâ€ ; with the â€œwindowâ€ of CIIEâ€ , we can welcome the world and â€œre-openingâ€ .
"For a country, openness is like a cocoon into butterflies, although it will go through a period of pain, but it will be replaced by a new birth."
General Secretary Xi Jinping's summary of the road to openness pointed out an important reason for "why China can".
Looking back on the past 40 years of reform and opening-up, China, which has dared to enter the world market, although it has encountered vortexes and waves, has always faced all risks and challenges with an open attitude, continuously releasing endogenous power and continuously improving its competitiveness.
It can be said that with its practical achievements, China has effectively interpreted the value and significance of openness.
Standing at a new historical starting point and holding an import-themed expo is a major decision made by the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core to promote a new round of high-level opening-up, a major measure for China to take the initiative to open its own market to the world, a practical action in China's support for economic globalization and trade liberalization, and a strong and clear will to show that "the door to China's opening-up will not be closed, it will only get bigger and bigger."
Exhibitors from all over the world are eager to sign up, and the booth is a "difficult to find", which is the greatest affirmation and the best response to China's development of an open economy on a wider, wider and deeper level.
More importantly, the current global economic and trade order has reached a crossroads.
Some countries have built a wall of trade protectionism and returned to the old path of unilateralism, which has increased the international community's concern about the prospects of free trade, and also added a lot of uncertainty to the emerging world economy.
In the context of such an era, this grand event on the Huangpu River reflects China's defense of free trade, so that the world can see China's self-confidence in opening up the market and sharing the future.
Go alone and go far away.
China's openness and embrace of the world has not only effectively promoted its own development, but also brought a surging "Chinese opportunity" to countries and regions around the world.
In recent years, advocating and promoting the co-construction of â€œBelt and Roadâ€, initiating the establishment of the AIIB, and the establishment of the Silk Road Fund... China has provided a series of international public goods, provided real export markets, development opportunities and jobs, and allowed enterprises from all over the world to take the â€œfast trainâ€ and â€œhappy trainâ€ of China's development.
The Expo is also a public product and a big platform for global economic and trade cooperation.
On top of this platform, more than 3,000 enterprises from more than 130 countries and regions, with their own distinctive high-quality products and services, took a new step in the Chinese market.
In addition to national enterprises, there are also domestic consumers who really benefit.
Through the construction of this "optimum" platform, it provides a multi-channel high-quality supply for consumption upgrading to meet the personalized, diversified and differentiated consumption needs of the people.
As China's door of opening up is getting wider and wider, the goods are flowing smoothly, making the best use, and the steps towards a better life will become more solid.
From a more macro point of view, the significance of the Expo has gone beyond the scope of economy and trade, focusing on the future, conveying the concepts of openness, inclusiveness, inclusiveness, balance and win-win results, and forming a consensus to jointly cope with today's challenges.
The world is good, China can be good; if China is good, the world is better.
We look forward to the expo to bring the world wonderful and consummated; we look forward to moving towards a higher-level "open China" with the world to work together to build a community with a shared future for mankind.
The United States and Canada reached a framework agreement on the North American Free Trade Agreement.
The agreement includes Canada's opening of its dairy market to the U.S., as well as the U.S. not imposing temporary tariffs on Canadian-made vehicles.
According to foreign media reports, a Canadian source revealed on the evening of September 30 local time that the United States and Canada have reached a framework agreement on the North American Free Trade Agreement.
According to reports, the agreement includes Canada's opening of its dairy market to the United States, and the United States temporarily does not impose tariffs on Canadian-made cars.
On the 27th of last month, the United States and Mexico announced that they had reached a preliminary agreement in principle to update the North American Free Trade Agreement, but the United States and Canada failed to reach an agreement before the August 31 deadline set by the United States to extend the negotiation period to September 30.
Earlier, Canadian Foreign Minister Freeland's spokesman said that Canada will only sign a favorable agreement, "the focus is on the substance, not the timetable. We will continue to negotiate and hope to reach an agreement that is in Canada's national interest."
More than 90 per cent of female Brazilian voters say presidential candidates do not take into account the needs of women.
According to data recently released by Brazil's National Geographic Research Institute (IBGE), more than 90% of Brazilian female people do not believe that presidential candidates consider women's needs.
At present, the number of women in Brazil has reached 107 million, and if the women of the whole of Brazil are gathered together to form a country, the country's population will be the 13th in the world, more than twice the population of the whole of Spain.
In Brazil, female voters account for 52% of the total number of voters and 48% of men, and although the proportion of women is very high among the voters, the proportion of women accounts for only 10% of Brazil's Congress.
Of the world's 193 countries, Brazilian women are only 154th in politics, ahead of Arab countries.
After more than more than two decades of struggle for their rights, Brazilian women still do not succeed in obtaining their rights.
Brazilian sociologist Natalia Mori pointed out that this phenomenon is due to the combination of ancient patrilineal society, racism, and capitalist values.
"Political politics should be for the people to advocate for civil rights, identity, access to public goods, and the formation of multiple social groups in the same society. But Brazilian politics belongs to the monopolies of a certain group, and the majority of the population is not represented."
According to a previous study conducted by Locomotiva, 94% of Brazilian women don’t feel that elected politicians can represent their rights, 90% of Brazilian women don’t agree with the decisions made by politicians, and 93% don’t agree with the current government’s governance policies.
“We need to reverse the underrepresentation of women in parliament. Brazil’s political system continues to be affected by inequality. So far, there are still high levels of gender, class and racial discrimination in Brazil’s political sphere,” said Natalia Morrie.
Although women’s rights are inadequate, the majority of Brazilian women still believe in the power of democracy.
The survey shows that 76% of women believe they can make a difference in democratic elections, and 72% of women are interested in politics.
In addition, 55% of women believe that democratic politics is the best way to expose women to less prejudice.
Astana, October 1 (Reporter Wen Longjie) The Chinese Embassy in Kazakhstan held a stately flag-raising ceremony on October 1 to welcome the 69-year-old birthday of New China.
More than 80 representatives of the Chinese Embassy in Kazakhstan, news agencies in Kazakhstan, financial institutions, Chinese-funded enterprises, overseas Chinese, Confucius Institutes and international students participated in the event.
On October 1, the Chinese Embassy in Kazakhstan held a flag-raising ceremony to welcome the 69-year-old birthday of New China.
After the flag-raising ceremony, Chinese Ambassador to Kazakhstan Zhang Xiao said that on the occasion of the 69th birthday of the great motherland, we solemnly raised the national flag ceremony in a foreign country, which is a profound patriotic education activity.
Although everyone has been living overseas for a long time, they are always worried about the great motherland.
Zhang Xiao said that the Chinese nation is closer than ever to achieving the great goal of national rejuvenation today, closer than ever to the center of the world stage.
â€œOur mission, responsibilities, and work are more honorable, arduous and onerous than ever before.â€
Zhang Xiao stressed that it is necessary not to forget the original intention, keep in mind the mission, and promote China-Koccal co-construction of the "Belt and Road" to move steadily, go deep and solidly, draw a more beautiful co-construction of the "Belt and Road" and "work strokes", for the development and construction of the motherland, Sino-Khal friendship and cooperation.
Guangxi Guilin Liangjiang International Airport T2 terminal was officially opened on the 30th.
Zhao Le Qin, secretary of the Guilin Municipal Party Committee of the Communist Party of China, said that after the opening of the new terminal, it will be able to meet the annual passenger throughput demand of 12 million passengers and build a new advantage of Guilin air traffic, which will be of great significance to further improve the "four-in-one" modern three-dimensional traffic pattern of Guangxi Jianghai linkage, sea and rail transport, water and land, and airport connection.
Guilin is expected to receive more than 90 million tourists this year.
Guilin Liangjiang International Airport's T2 terminal and station ping supporting facilities expansion project is a major public welfare project for the 60th anniversary of the founding of Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region and a landmark project for the construction of Guilin international tourist attractions.
The project was started in December 2015, with a construction area of 100,000 square meters, with a total investment of 3.258 billion yuan, which can meet the annual passenger throughput of 12 million passengers, 101,200 take-off and landing, and 95,000 tons of cargo and mail throughput.
On the same day, more than 200 flights took off and landed at Terminal T2 of Guilin Liangjiang International Airport.
The design of the new terminal is inspired by Guilin mountains and waters, and looks like a â€œmountain laurel crownâ€ , and looks close to the â€œdragon ridge terracesâ€ and the eaves of laurel houses in the north, which intersect with Guilin mountains and waters.
According to reports, Guilin Airport's new terminal can meet the peak traffic of nearly 4000 passengers per hour, the use of intelligent baggage sorting system, security integration platform, face recognition and other "smart airport" technical means, the planning covers catering, department stores, duty-free and leisure and other forms of commercial areas.
As growth in Europe, Asia, and emerging markets is mostly not encouraging, the U.S. has increasingly become a major engine of global growth.
On September 23, 2018, a container ship was moored in the port of New Jersey, United States.
However, because the current growth in the United States has benefited from the fiscal stimulus of tax cuts, the country's economy has also been closely watched by the outside world.
“As the U.S. returns to full employment, an economic downturn is inevitable.”
The only question, he said, was when it would happen, and in his opinion, it would probably only go ahead without delay.
Although Barclays is optimistic about the U.S. economic outlook until the end of the year, the bank acknowledged that it would be more difficult to make a prediction for a longer period of time.
â€œIn the absence of more sustainable investment growth to boost the potential for economic growth, fiscal-policy-motivated growth today will not be sustainable,â€ the economists at Barclays said in a research note.
â€œIn the absence of investment growth, the risk of a hard landing in the economy will rise in 2020,â€ they said.
A series of enterprise surveys will roughly show that the major economies will be in the economic cycle stage at the end of the third quarter.
The Eurozone and U.S. manufacturing surveys, scheduled to be released on Monday, will receive attention, with the services sector survey to be released on Wednesday.
But next week’s data will necessarily focus on U.S. non-farm payroll data to be released next Friday, which will provide clues as to whether the tight job market is driving wage growth.
It is important not only because it is important for the profitability of companies and the purchasing power of consumers, but also because rising wages or triggering an overall rise in inflation may unsettles Federal Reserve officials.
“Salaries will be of great concern, as there could be a sharp rise again from the previous month.
The increase in September compared to the same period of the previous year may not exceed 3%, but we can fully expect a breakthrough next month," ING economists wrote in a research note.
At a time when holidays in China and other parts of the Asian region lead to a languing of the region’s data next week, European politics is likely to become a source of market volatility.
The Italian government ignores its previous financial commitments to the European Union, and other EU member states will have to quickly determine whether or not to categorically oppose Italy’s decision. Tria does not support the decision, and he wants to abide by EU rules.
As the Brexit negotiations enter a critical phase, the annual meeting to be held by the British Conservative Party in Birmingham may also be sparkling.
At the same time, with the much-anticipated presidential election taking place next weekend in Brazil, it is unlikely that the concerns around emerging markets will abduce.
After the ship is completed, it will be submitted to the East China Sea Branch of the State Oceanic Administration of the People's Republic of China for use, and the head of the observation department of the marine early warning and monitoring department of the Ministry of Natural Resources of the People's Republic of China said that the commissioning of the ship will be of great significance for the development of China's offshore marine observation system and the promotion of global ocean observation.
On September 29, China's first 3,000-ton large-scale buoy "Xianyang Red 22" ship was launched by the China Armed Forces Group.
After the completion of the ship, it will break China's equipment bottlenecks in large-scale buoys, submersible cloth placement, recycling, and repair.
The "Xianyang Red 22" wheel is mainly used for regular inspection and maintenance of buoys/submersible standards, regular deployment and recycling, emergency laying, recycling, repair and other support work, while having the ability to carry out comprehensive marine investigation tasks such as cross-sectional surveys.
The new ship has a total length of 89 meters, a width of 18 meters, a depth of 7.2 meters, and a endurance of 10,000 nautical miles.
Wang Weiling, deputy general manager of Wushu Group, said: â€œXianyang Red 22 ship is China's first large-scale buoy operating ship, and it is also the only working ship in China that has the ability to hoist ten meters of large-scale buoy operation, which will further enhance China's large-scale buoy protection capability.â€
It is understood that after the completion of the ship will be submitted to the East Sea Branch of the State Oceanic Administration of the People's Republic of China for use, China's Ministry of Natural Resources Marine Early Warning and Monitoring Department of the Observing Department of the Observing Director Chen Yan said that the ship put into use will be of great significance for the development of China's offshore marine observation system and the promotion of global ocean observation.
At the same time, the ship has a large-scale buoy cloth maintenance operation, as well as a comprehensive marine investigation capability, which is the first comprehensive ship dedicated to the operation and comprehensive investigation of the ocean in China.
With such buoy operating vessels, our ocean observations and ocean surveys in the future will have a powerful tool.”
QINGDAO, Oct. 1 (Xinhua) -- Affected by Typhoon "Tanmei", the 2018 International Extreme Sailing Series, which was originally scheduled to start on September 30, "Marzer Run Cup" postponed the first competition day to October 1, and held a pre-game meeting at the Qingdao Aofan Center before the race, and the captains of the 12 hydrofoil catamarans from 6 countries and regions were all unveiled.
Affected by Typhoon "Tanmei", the strong wind in the Hong Kong Pond continued, the maximum wind speed was even as high as 24 knots, the departure signal was postponed for nearly 90 minutes from 1 p.m. on the 30th, and the wind speed still did not decrease.
â€œThe strong winds blowing from the shore continue, and the sea condition is too violent.â€
"In such a situation, no one knows when the gusts are blowing towards the ship.
Close to the city's arena, in terms of the current wind conditions, the cancellation of the game is the wisest choice."
There was still some disillusionment among the crew who were ready.
â€œThe boat is ready to stop, and we are in a good state.â€
"But I know that the rescheduling of the game is the right choice, and I hope that today's wind energy is smaller, we can show our hand."
Omica Wilkinson, known as the "Star of Hope" for the New Zealand team at the 2020 Tokyo Olympic Games, said: "The loss of a day makes the game even more interesting.
Because today's game will increase, and there are only two games left.
It’s going to be a lot of hard work.”
Although the sea breeze is fierce, the French ABM team's rudder Pierre Ivez Durand appealed at the pre-match meeting to say that he and the game's host Qingdao's warm past: five years ago, the international extreme regatta series himself was accidentally injured, the muscles were fractured, thanks to the treatment of the medical team of the local event, so that they could stand on the competition venue today 5 years later.
It is reported that the International Extreme Sailing Series was founded in 2007 and is in line with the World Sailing League events such as Volvo, the America's Cup and the World Sailing Confrontation Tour.
The Qingdao station competition will use the "flying ghost" hydrofoil binomial sail (FlyingPhantom).
2018 is the 8th year that the event has landed in the "sailing capital" of Qingdao, and the Qingdao station is also the final battle of the series.
Although the global financial market turbulence continued, the Hong Kong Monetary Authority said on Monday that the foreign exchange fund's investment income in the third quarter of this year fell by 97% year-on-year, but better than the performance of the previous quarter, because under the Sino-US trade war, overseas stocks rose, and foreign exchange losses were also significantly narrowed.
According to the latest data of the HKMA, from July to September 2018, the foreign exchange fund recorded an investment income of HK$1.6 billion, which is significantly lower than HK$61.8 billion in the same period last year, but it is better than HK$100 million revised in the second quarter of this year.
Chen Delin, president of the HKMA, said at the legislative meeting that at the beginning of the Sino-US trade war, the Hong Kong and emerging market stock indexes ran against the U.S. stock index until the end of September and the beginning of October, when the U.S. stock market index began to reverse, because investors gradually realized that the trade war was also unfavorable to the United States itself.
"The change in market sentiment is a good thing, if the trade war has only a one-sided impact, it will not help to solve the problem."
However, he also pointed out that "if the Sino-US trade war is not resolved, the volatility of financial markets will continue to rise."
In the third quarter of this year, the foreign exchange fund's stock investment loss in Hong Kong narrowed by 8% from the previous quarter to HK$4.7 billion, and overseas equity investment income increased by 172% to HK$1.28 billion; foreign exchange losses of HK$16.2 billion, bond income of 9.7 billion Hong Kong dollars, a decrease of 24% and 31% respectively, mainly reflecting the general rise of the US dollar against the main currencies in the middle of the quarter.
Foreign exchange funds are mainly used to support the Hong Kong dollar.
Since 1983, Hong Kong has implemented a linked exchange rate system between the Hong Kong dollar and the United States dollar.
Regarding the current financial situation in Hong Kong, Chen Delin said that economic and asset market uncertainties have increased and downside risks have increased, but Hong Kong's financial system is stable, it is also well-defensive and has sufficient earthquake resistance.
"Hong Kong's ample international investment position, foreign net asset value of $1.4 trillion is equivalent to four times of GDP, higher than Singapore's 2.5 times and Japan's 0.6 times, to cope with the economic downturn cycle or reverse enough."
Recently, the Hong Kong dollar interest rate has continued to fall and expand with the U.S. dollar spread, Chen Deling pointed out that the Hong Kong dollar exchange rate rose more than 400 basis points on September 21, the market is generally believed to be mainly related to the rise of the Hong Kong dollar, and then the Hong Kong dollar against the U.S. dollar hovered around the level of 7.80-7.84, to the recent Hong Kong dollar interest rate continued to fall, and the U.
However, he believes that with the beginning of the Hong Kong bank's interest rate hike cycle and the normalization of the interest rate of the Hong Kong dollar in progress, the situation in which the Hong Kong dollar interest rate is lower than the interest rate of the US dollar will change in the future.
"The interest rate of the Hong Kong dollar and the trend of the US dollar interest rate will be more consistent, we must be more careful to manage the risk and be prepared to cope with market fluctuations."
The three-month interest rate was reduced by 0.9 per cent to 2.08179 per cent on Monday, expanding from 46 basis points to 51 basis points; the one-month interest rate cuts hit a five-month low, and the spread with the U.S. dollar was widened from 120 basis points to 127 basis points.
From May to the middle of September, the Hong Kong dollar spot exchange rate for most of the time is close to 7.85 to the US dollar.
During this period, due to factors such as the outflow of funds obtained from the Hong Kong dollar after arbitrage activities and large-scale prospecting activities were completed, the weak party exchange guarantee was triggered several times in May and August after being triggered for the first time in April.
In accordance with the linked exchange rate system, the HKMA bought the Hong Kong dollar at the level of 7.85 and released the United States dollar in order to maintain the stability of the Hong Kong dollar exchange rate.
The HKMA bought a total of about HK$52.1 billion in May and August under the Weak Exchange Assurance Mechanism.
Does the new tax law still provide incentives for foreigners?
In response to a reporter's question on the 30th, the relevant person in charge of the Ministry of Finance and the General Administration of Taxation said that in order to maintain policy stability, the next step in the implementation of the new personal income tax law will consider continuing to make preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan.
The newly revised personal income tax law adjusts China's personal income tax resident taxpayers from one year to 183 days.
When implementing the law in the next step, is there any preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan?
The person in charge responded that the current personal income tax law implementing regulations have special preferential provisions on the payment of taxes for overseas people, and individuals who do not have a residence in China but have lived for more than one year or more than five years have income derived from income outside China and can only pay personal income tax on the part paid by units or individuals in China.
The official said that in order to maintain the stability of the policy, the next step in the implementation of the new personal income tax law will consider continuing to make preferential arrangements for overseas people, including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan.
There is no "thresistance" moon child center: quality certification to promote the improvement of quality.
With the pull of the "two-child economy" and the prosperity of the mother and baby market, from the north to the third and fourth-tier cities, a variety of grades have sprouted monthly clubhouses in various places.
At the same time, it meets the consumption needs of the masses, ranging from tens of thousands or even hundreds of thousands of yuan, but it is also in an embarrassing situation, this institution has no threshold so far, and there is still a blank area of supervision.
The State Administration of Market Supervision recently carried out a series of national "quality month" activities in 2018, and the reporter came to a five-star children's center in Tianjin to visit the certification experience of maternal and child care services.
The general monthly center provides neonatal care, nutritious meals, post-partum rejuvenation and other services.
In this monthly child center, the reporter saw that the nurse checked the breastfeeding situation of newborns every day, and professional carers provided detailed nursing services such as bathing and touching for newborns.
At the same time, in order to meet the needs of new mothers, from wound care at the beginning of the moon, to services such as beauty care in the middle and late months of the moon, medical treatment and beauty and other care projects are provided to help the mothers to regain their posture.
A new mother who lived told reporters that she had booked the clubhouse eight months in advance.
The service items directly affect the degree of comfort and physical recovery during the mother's period, and some small-scale clubhouses can only provide a number of simple monthly services, and there are problems such as irregular disinfection hygiene, prone to cross-infection, and a single unscruptive diet.
The person in charge said that they are the only one of all the five-star children's centers in Tianjin to have obtained B-level service certification.
"Although some customers did not initially understand the meaning of B-level certification, but through the certification forced enterprises to strictly standardized process management, so that customers benefit, the long-term development of the enterprise is of great significance," he said.
Pan Lifen, deputy director of the certification and supervision department of the State Administration of Market Supervision, said that service certification is based on customer perception, pay attention to the degree of organizational quality management and service characteristics, which is an important part of the country's quality infrastructure, which plays a positive role in improving the proportion of high-quality service supply and enhancing the international competitiveness of China's services.
After more than 10 years of development in China, after more than 10 years of development, the service certification project has undergone a process of gradual development from scratch, and a number of services such as financial service certification, maternal and child care service certification, commodity after-sales service certification, e-commerce service certification, and health care service certification have a certain influence.
According to the statistics of the State Administration of market supervision, there are currently more than 130 service certification institutions in China, more than 2,000 service certification personnel, and nearly 8,000 valid certification certificates.
Pan Lifen said that it is necessary to further guide and promote the development of service certification, gradually expand service certification coverage in the fields of health, education, education, sports, finance, and e-commerce, and promote the supply-side reform and quality improvement of the service industry.
HONG KONG, Nov 5 (Reuters) - Hong Kong’s property prices fell for two consecutive months after peaking, and Hong Kong Monetary Authority (HKMA) President Chen Delin said on Monday that fashion needs time to observe whether the property market has entered a downward cycle, if confirmed, it could be considered that the tightening of counter-cyclical measures can be relaxed at an appropriate time.
Chen Delin also pointed out that in the event of a correction in property prices, it will be the people who will be the first to be affected at the height of the real estate market, but it is expected that there will be a sharp decline in property prices such as the 1997 Asian financial crisis, and the opportunity for the public to significantly reduce the sale of property is much lower.
Chen Delin led a number of high-level members of the HKMA to attend the Legislative Council briefing, saying that if it is confirmed that the real estate market has entered a downward cycle, it can gradually relax the measures at an appropriate time.
"But only a few weeks of data, relaxation is still too early, there is still some more time to see whether the housing market has entered the downward cycle."
Since the 10th of 2009, the HKMA has successively launched eight rounds of counter-cyclical measures, which have significantly tightened the Mortgages of various properties, including reducing the number of mortgages, mortgage applicants having to pass rigorous stress tests to improve bank risk management and earthquake resistance.
As Hong Kong has officially entered the rate hike cycle, Hong Kong's private residential property price index peaked for two consecutive months from August to September, and the month-on-month decline widened to 1.44% in September.
However, in the first three quarters of this year, the cumulative increase still reached 10.2%.
In the second quarter of this year, Hong Kong's undebtor-free home-to-residential household ratio reached 66%, up from an average of 60 per cent in 2009-11, compared with an average of 60 per cent in 2009-11; the contribution-to-income ratio of newly approved mortgages and newly-issued Mortgages was 47% and 34%, respectively, a significant improvement from 64% and 41% in 2009-11.
However, Chen Delin said that the high earthquake resistance does not mean that the citizens who have already owned the property will not be damaged by the economic downturn, because the valuation of the property will fall, and those who buy buildings at the peak will bear the brunt.
Although the HKMA has tightened bank lending to mortgage lenders, homebuyers can also obtain a high number of mortgage loans through mortgage insurance or mortgage loans provided by developers.
At present, together with the mortgage loans provided to developers, the borrower's Mortgage ratio can reach 85-90%, and if the property price drops by 10%, there will be negative assets (that is, the market value of the property will fall below the level of the total amount of outstanding mortgage loans).
However, Ruan Guoheng, vice president of the HKMA, pointed out that the authorities estimate that the total number of mortgages provided by developers accounts for only 2-2.5% of the total number of bank mortgages, and the proportion is still very low.
At the peak of Hong Kong's negative assets in 2003, the number of negative assets exceeded 100,000, accounting for 22% of the supply of buildings.
As of the third quarter of this year this year, Hong Kong has recorded zero negative assets for seven consecutive quarters.
BEIJING, Oct. 1 /PRNewswire-USNewswire/ -- E-commerce retail export enterprises ushered in another wave of tax benefits on October 1, involving value-added tax and consumption tax exemption.
The Ministry of Finance, the State Administration of Taxation, the Ministry of Commerce and the General Administration of Customs have recently jointly issued a clear statement that the e-commerce export enterprises in the cross-border e-commerce comprehensive test area have not obtained a valid purchase certificate, while meeting the following conditions, the value-added tax and consumption tax exemption policies will be tested.
First, the e-commerce export enterprise is registered in the comprehensive trial area, and the export date, the name of the goods, the unit of measurement, the quantity, the unit of measurement, the unit, the unit price and the amount are registered on the cross-border e-commerce cross-border e-commerce online comprehensive service platform at the place of registration.
Second, the export goods go through the e-commerce export declaration formalities through the customs where the comprehensive test area is located.
Third, the exported goods do not belong to the Ministry of Finance and the State Administration of Taxation in accordance with the decision of the State Council to explicitly cancel the export refund (exemption) of goods.
According to the notice, the General Administration of Customs regularly transmits the electronic information of the e-commerce export commodity declaration list to the State Administration of Taxation.
The tax authorities of each comprehensive test area shall strengthen the tax-exempt management of export goods according to the electronic information of the export commodity declaration list divided by the State Administration of Taxation.
The notice pointed out that the specific duty-free management measures shall be formulated by the provincial tax departments and the financial and commercial departments.
The office of the leading group for the construction of the comprehensive test areas and the competent departments of commerce should comprehensively promote communication and coordination between departments and the implementation of relevant policies, accelerate the establishment of an e-commerce export statistical monitoring system, and promote the healthy and rapid development of cross-border e-commerce.
Nov. 5 (Zhang Linhu) Due to differences in the allocation of money, a man in Liaoning Province actually killed and left his lover, and then absconded to the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region.
On the 5th, the reporter learned from the Public Security Bureau of Dongsheng District of Ordos City, Inner Mongolia, that after a joint investigation by the police of the two places, the man was successfully arrested.
On June 26, 2018, a woman in Anshan City, Liaoning Province, went missing, and her family reported it to the local police.
After investigation and judgment by the police, this is not a simple case of disappearance of the people, the missing person is most likely to be killed by his lover Wang, and the police immediately set up a special task force to carry out further investigation.
On October 30, the task force found that the criminal suspect Wang may have been hiding in the Dongsheng District of Ordos City, and the Dongsheng police immediately organized a competent police force to fully cooperate with the Liaoning police to solve the case.
After 5 days of investigation, the police finally figured out Wang's foothold and sorted out his relatives in detail.
On November 4, the police of the two places jointly arrested the criminal suspect Wang in an excavator accessories store in Dongsheng District.
According to Wang's account, he had a relationship with the victim's white lover, because Bai's sister had a large amount of funds in the name of Bai, and the two decided to occupy the money for themselves.
On June 22, 2018, due to disagreements between Wang and Bai on the control of the funds, Wang then killed Bai in the rental house, decomposing the body.
At present, the criminal suspect Wang has been handed over to Liaoning Anshan police.
"Five major development beautiful Anhui" "green development in action" theme train on-line operation
"Five major development, beautiful Anhui" second theme train - "green development in action" theme train was officially put into operation on the 5th.
In order to fully display the brilliant results achieved in the construction of the "Five Major Developments and Beautiful Anhui", Hefei Rail Company and Golden Cuckoo Media Technology Co., Ltd. jointly designed and produced a series of theme trains of "Five Developments and Beautiful Anhui".
Among them, the "innovation and development in action" theme train has been officially put into operation on October 1, Hefei Rail Transit Line 1, which was officially put into operation.
The on-line theme train chooses the blue-green color symbolizing the landscape as the main color, which reflects the sense of origin, vitality and purity.
Propaganda content focuses on the core ideological concept of the "Five Major and Beautiful Anhui" and the province's 18 representative cases of green development achievements, such as the Jianghuai Canal project, the forest chief system, the protection and development of the Yangtze River economic belt, and the forest growth project of tens of millions of acres.
In addition, "coordinating development in action", "open development in action", "shared development in action" and "shared development in action" will also go online in the near future.
SHENZHEN, Oct. 1 /PRNewswire-USNewswire/ -- October 1 is the first day of the "golden week" of the mainland's National Day, the last day of Hong Kong's National Day public holiday, many mainland residents use the holidays to go abroad to play and shop, and there are also a lot of deep Hong Kong residents returning to Hong Kong on the same day, the traffic "explosive" situation at various ports in Shenzhen.
According to the data provided by the Shenzhen border inspection station, as of 16 p.m. on the same day, there were more than 429,000 arrivals and departures at the Shenzhen port, and the number of transportation tools reached more than 16,800 vehicles (ships, racks and columns), and the ports were always busy, maintaining a good entry and exit order.
It is understood that due to many favorable factors such as the increase in the number of countries that provide out-of-the-way visa-free policies for Chinese citizens, the number of tourists who use the National Day holiday to travel to Europe and Southeast Asia and other countries continues to increase.
In the early morning of the 1st, Luohu, Shenzhen Bay, Huanggang, Futian and other ports will usher in the peak of passenger (car) flow, of which Luohu port passenger flow peak from 9:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m. from 9:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m.
According to reports, in order to cope with the peak of inbound and out-of-passenger (car) traffic, the Shenzhen border inspection station in accordance with the unified deployment of the National Immigration Administration, the start of the passenger (car) rush hour service mode, arrange overtime police to support the first line of duty, open a sufficient inspection channel in advance, guide passengers and vehicles for orderly inspection, to ensure that the entry and exit queuing of Chinese citizens does not exceed more than 30 minutes, while taking into account the customs clearance efficiency of foreigners.
At the same time, the Shenzhen border inspection station reminds incoming and outgoing passengers that they should pay attention to the validity period of documents, visas and signatures before travel, rationally arrange the itinerary, try to avoid the rush hour of passenger flow, and choose the right time to travel at the right port.
Passengers traveling to Hong Kong on the Guangzhou-Shenzhen high-speed rail are required to hold a valid entry/exit certificate and a visa signature, the high-speed rail ticket is only a travel certificate, can not be used as an entry-exit certificate, if it is unable to leave Hong Kong due to non-conformity and other reasons, they should follow the guidelines of the border police on duty, and wait at a designated location for MTR company staff to take them back to the mainland.
Systemic lupus lupus is a chronic disease that involves multiple organs throughout the body, and has been considered an "incurable disease" in the past.
Because the pathogenesis is unknown, diagnosis and treatment are difficult, and there is a lack of effective treatment.
Recently, Liu Wanli, a researcher at the School of Life Sciences of Tsinghua University, and the director of the Rheumatic Immunity Center of Peking University People's Hospital jointly discovered that human immunoglobulin has a molecular variant that increases the susceptibility to systemic lupus lupus, and this variant participates in the regulation of immunized B cells.
In short, the two teams confirmed that an abnormal immune molecule in the human body is an important cause of systemic lupus.
According to one of the authors of the article, Peking University People's Hospital Sun Xiaolin, the team collected nearly 2,000 large samples of systemic lupus erythematosus patients and found that the immunoglobulin mutated patients have produced disease-causing cells and a large number of autoantiantibodies, nephritis, arthritis, pulpitis, vasculitis and other gravitation.
Through a variety of research methods such as immune cell tracking, animal testing, and sequencing, Liu Wanli's team has discovered the immune signaling pathway activated by this immune molecular variant and the pathogenic mechanism that promotes the secretion of various autoantibodies by B cells.
The reporter learned that the two teams are strongly united to give full play to their respective advantages and realize the close integration of basic research and clinical applications.
Liu Wanli's team is committed to the study of immune recognition and immune activation of B lymphocytes, and the team has long been engaged in the clinical study of systemic lupus erythematosus.
"This research is one of the results of years of cooperation between the two teams, and it is also the first time in the academic community to memorize the understanding that immunoglobulin gene abnormalities will induce systemic lupus, laying a solid foundation for further academic research and clinical targeted therapy."
It’s not a matter of protection, it’s about acting in accordance with the law.
Is the lawyer holding a court session with an axe?
At first glance, the news is indeed very exciting, but also in the legal circle opened the pot.
Fujian Quanzhou Zhongfa subsequently fined 500 yuan to the lawyers involved, and recommended in writing the Quanzhou Bar Association to investigate and deal with it.
According to the Beijing News, a few days ago, the Quanzhou Municipal Law Association issued an official notice that the behavior of the two lawyers does not involve violations of the law and will not be punished according to the law.
Judging from many reports, the treatment of the Quanzhou Municipal Law Association is not to protect short or engage in confrontation, but to be recognized by the Quanzhou Middle Court.
An incident that might have triggered tensions within the legal community was finally properly resolved.
The reversal of the matter stems from a more complete restoration of the truth: the axe carried by the relevant lawyer is the same style and model as the defendant's murder weapon, but it has not been bladed, and it only provides auxiliary evidence in the cross-examination process, and there is no act of intimidation or the subjective intention to "endanger the safety of the court".
There are four very important details to pay attention to in determining whether the actions of the lawyers in question are illegal: first, the local court held two sessions before, only showed the axe photo, from the defense point of view, it is necessary to show the axe original; second, the axe was purchased only 1 hour before the trial, it is not that the lawyer did not want to seek the consent of the judge, but objectively failed to contact the judge; Third, the entire axe was not excessive or improperly used.
Combined with these plots, it can be seen that the lawyers involved have nothing to do with "bringing an axe in court", but only for the defense.
After sorting out the whole facts, the Quanzhou Municipal Law Association did not push the boat along the water, but withstood the pressure and made a decision not to punish.
And this decision can also stand the test of fact and law.
As far as it can be brought to the court as an axe of controlled knives without the permission of the court, it is indeed prone to uneasiness and misunderstanding.
For the sake of security and prudence, the previous fine penalties and judicial recommendations of the Quanzhou Middle Court are also understandable.
In order to maintain the dignity of lawyers and prevent individual courts from resorting to lawyers, the Supreme People's Court issued the "Rules for Judicial Police Security Inspections in People's People's Courts" in 2014, establishing the principle that lawyers do not need to carry out personal safety inspections in court.
Since the issuance of this rule, the vast number of lawyers have led by example, and there have rarely been incidents that endanger the safety of the court due to security loopholes.
In very rare cases such as Quanzhou, misunderstandings are not difficult to eliminate as long as they communicate in the spirit of mutual respect and understanding.
As a self-regulatory organization in the lawyer industry, the Bar Association undertakes the dual mission of disciplinary illegality and ensuring legality.
In the past, individual legal association organizations were criticized because of their focus on discipline and loss of protection.
The decision of the Quanzhou Law Association, both in terms of the process and the results, is worthy of praise, setting an example for the correct performance of its duties.
From October 1, what tax benefits will affect our wallets?
SHANGHAI, Oct. 1 (Xinhua) -- The new personal income tax law will come into effect on January 1, 2019, in order to allow the broad masses of the people to enjoy the tax reduction dividend as soon as possible, starting from October 1, the actual wages and salaries of taxpayers will be deducted according to the starting point of 5,000 yuan per month, and the new tax schedule will be applied.
With the implementation of the New Deal, what are the benefits that will affect the people's money bags?
Positive one: the tax reduction rate of wages and salaries is obvious
Taxpayers who have obtained wages and salaries after October 1 can deduct 5,000 yuan/month of basic deduction costs and apply the new tax schedule, and most taxpayers have different degrees of tax cuts, especially for low- and middle-income earners.
According to the tax reduction table of different income groups, after deducting the "three risks and one gold", the monthly income of 8000 yuan, 10,000 yuan, 20,000 yuan, 50,000 yuan, the tax payable after the tax reform is 90 yuan, 290 yuan, 1590 yuan, 9090 yuan, compared with 3,500 yuan, the corresponding tax reduction ratio is 73.9%, 61%, 49.0%, 18.8%.
It should be noted that due to the holiday reasons, the wages issued by various units at the end of September, which should be paid in October according to law, can be applied to the new basic deduction fees and tax rates.
To this end, the withholding client software uniformly promoted by the tax department has provided the corresponding tax calculation function, but the corresponding tax still needs to be declared and paid during the statutory reporting period.
Positive two: the distance of the low tax rate is obviously increased.
In addition to raising the starting points, the new tax schedule will be applied from October 1.
The seven tax rates of wages and salaries are the same as before, and there is no change, but there has been a significant change in the tax rate, and the three-grade low tax rates of 3%, 10% and 20% have been significantly expanded, and the tax rate distance of 25% has been narrowed, while 30%, 35%, and 45% have remained unchanged.
It is worth noting that the tax law has also adjusted the tax rates of production and operation income, of which the lower limit of the highest 35% tax rate has been increased from 100,000 yuan to 500,000 yuan.
This means that self-employed businesses and sole proprietorships will benefit from the tax reform.
Judging from the calculation of individual tax cuts for taxpayers in Shanghai in the early stage, the majority of taxpayers will fully feel the dividends of individual tax reform, especially for low- and middle- and low-income people.
Lan Min, head of the personal income tax department of the Shanghai Municipal Taxation Bureau of the State Administration of Taxation, said.
Good three: more convenient optimization of tax payment services
Since the promulgation of the new personal income tax law, the tax department in Shanghai has carried out a series of comprehensive and extensive tax publicity actions.
On the one hand, "one-to-one, peer-to-to-peer" policy counseling is carried out for key tax sources and key enterprises.
The Pudong New Area Taxation Bureau successively visited large-scale enterprises such as Apple Trade (Shanghai) Co., Ltd., Alipay (China) Network Technology Co., Ltd., and Red Xing Mei Kailong Household Group Co., Ltd., which has a large number of employees, large withholding and with-the-paid workload, a large amount of taxes, and the tax department has taken the initiative to guide and answer questions; Xuhui District Taxation Bureau has visited Zhongzhi Financial Consulting Co., Ltd.
On the other hand, for the vast number of public taxpayers, carry out "all-round, multi-dimensional and three-dimensional" tax policies.
The use of Shanghai tax official website, WeChat public number, Weibo and other channels to push policy hotspots in a timely manner to ensure that policy publicity is put in place.
At the same time, since September 28th, the Shanghai tax WeChat public number on-line 12366 intelligent consulting platform, through "artificial + intelligent" tax service consultation, to carry out "targeted" intelligent integrated tax reform publicity services.
On the evening of the 4th Beijing time, the official website of the English FA officially announced that the former England captain Rooney will return to the English national team and play the warm-up match of the English team against the United States on November 15.
Last August, Rooney withdrew from the England national team.
Rooney had previously made 119 appearances for England, scoring 53 goals, making it the team's all-time first goalscorer and ranking second in history.
According to the FA's official website, the match with the U.S. team was aimed at raising money for Rooney's children's charitable foundation, and Rooney himself was very excited: "It's a pleasure to play on behalf of England at Wembley again, and thank Southgate and the FA for inviting me to help my foundation.
It's the greatest glory of my career to play for England, the 120th and the last time I'll play for England, it's going to be a special reminiscence for me."
The annual Yangcheng Lake Crab Cultural Tourism Festival kicked off on the 30th, according to Gu Wenhua, secretary of the party committee of Yangcheng Lake Dachshund Crab, the annual economic output value is nearly 3.8 billion yuan, with a net income of more than 600 million yuan and a net income of more than 600 million yuan.
Yangcheng Lake crab is also known as golden claw crab, because the crab does not touch the mud, commonly known as the clear water crab, green shell white belly, meat paste, it has the reputation of "the king of crabs".
It has become a common practice for people to eat crabs during the golden autumn.
The big crab is the most well-known image spokesperson in the city.
Peel crab shells, squeezing crab feet, squeezing crab meat and dipling crabs, diners feel the beauty of being in Jiangnan.
This year, more diners will spend more time to stay in Bacheng, near Yangcheng Lake, watching white herons predating, enjoying the fun of catching crabs, and enjoying the slow-paced aquatic life.
Due to the widespread introduction of large-scale seedlings in the cities and towns of Pakistan, this year's large crabs are much larger than before.
Crab farmers who have been dealing with crabs for nearly 20 years are planning to export the crab seedlings and breeding technology of Yangchenghu crabs to Thailand, so as to cross national boundaries and promote cultural exchanges with overseas cuisines.
"Kunqu town" is a cultural signature of Bacheng.
At present, Bacheng has built a Crab Garden, a fisherman's lamp, a spring and autumn water city, a lake crab city, the five major crab markets and a food street, around the Yangcheng Lake big crab to do the catering business as many as 1,300 large and small hotels, scaly compared to all kinds of crabs are dazzling.
"One crab" attracts nearly 3 million tourists at home and abroad every year, but also the formation of two longitudinal, living and fragrant Bacheng Old Street.
Ba Xiyi station Kunqu theme post office, painting concept book bar, ink baby theme museum, Kunqu theme homestay, embroidery museum, cheongsam hall and many other tourism products have been unveiled, Kunqu scholar Yang Shousong, flute master Chen Dongbao, the famous Kunqu Xiaosheng Yu Linglin, bamboo engraving craft master Ni Xiaozhou, folk song inheritor Lu Zhenliang and a number of celebrity studios.
It is reported that during the crab cultural and tourism festival, the 4th Kunqu small town and Bacheng heavy Yang song meeting will also be opened again, and music friends from all over the world will gather together to relive the jade mountains.
A number of cultural venues, such as the historical and cultural exhibition center, Kunqu promenades, Ayu Yayuan, Chong Literature Academy, and Kun Opera Grand Theatre, will also be unveiled, which will present the cultural charm of Kun Quyuan Township, the hometown of Chinese calligraphy Township, and Jiangnan Yumi Water Township.
A trilateral trade deal between the U.S. and Canada will create new opportunities for 500 million people.
According to foreign media reports, a joint statement published on the Canadian government's Canadian government's website by Canadian Foreign Minister Freeland and U.S. Trade Representative Lighthizer said that the United States, Canada and Mexico have reached a trilateral trade agreement, which will be known as the "USMCA".
Earlier, Canada's CTV News television quoted senior US sources as saying that Canada and the United States had eliminated their differences and reached an agreement on the North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA).
The Washington Post quoted two sources familiar with the situation as saying that the agreement reached by the United States and Canada on September 30 will retain the North American Free Trade Agreement as a three-way trade agreement, and the three heads of state will sign a new agreement within two months.
“Today, Canada, the U.S., and Mexico have agreed on a new trade deal – the US-Mexico-Canada Tripartite (USMCA), which will provide high-standard trade agreements for our workers, farmers, and companies that will lead to freer markets, fairer transactions, and more sustainable economic growth. The agreement will strengthen the middle class, create high-paying jobs, and create new opportunities for about 500 million people.”
The current North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA) was signed between the United States, Mexico and Canada in 1994.
After taking the presidency, Trump announced plans to reconsider the agreement and sign a new agreement.
The three countries began this negotiation process in 2017.
The Okinawa governor's election, which was carried out in advance due to the illness and death of the former governor Aung Chang Xiong, announced the results in the early hours of the morning of the 1st local time on the morning of the 1st local time, and Yucheng Danny, who was opposed to the relocation plan of the U.S. military base in Japan, was successfully elected.
According to the final results, Yucheng received a total of 396,632 votes, creating the highest number of votes in the history of the Okinawa Prefectural Governor's election, with more than 80,000 more votes than his main opponent.
A total of four candidates participated in the election, with a turnout rate of 63.24%, a decrease of 0.89 percentage points from the 2014 Okinawa Prefectural Governor's election.
Yucheng told the media on the 1st that the results of the election showed that the county people did not want Governor Weng's efforts in vain, and he will continue to make efforts to the Japanese government and the U.S. government on opposing the relocation plan of the U.S. military base and the closure of the Futenma base.
The U.S. military base is located in the city of Yino Bay in Okinawa Prefecture and has long been criticized, and the Japanese and U.S. governments had previously agreed to relocate it to the former area of the city, but the people of Okinawa strongly objected, hoping to completely move the base out of Okinawa.
With regard to the relocation plan strongly opposed by the county people and the request to revoke the land reclamation permit on the ancient coast, Yucheng said that he did not stand in an opposing and divisive position with the central government at the beginning, and hoped that the two sides can fully exchange views and show their intention to resolve through consultation.
On the morning of the 1st, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe also told the media to earnestly accept this result, and will make efforts to revitalize Okinawa and reduce the burden on the base.
Japan's Chief Cabinet Secretary Suga said at a press conference on the 1st that the government's policy on relocating the U.S. military base as soon as possible has not changed.
At the same time, he also expressed his intention to hold talks with Yucheng.
Yucheng will officially become the governor of Okinawa Prefecture on the 4th of this month.
Since the mid-2000s, as China’s demand for oilseeds has grown, North Dakota farmer Paul Thomas has been planting more and more soybeans in his fields.
The shift peaked this year, when he planted 1,600 acres of soybeans on 5,000 acres, a scale never seen before.
But Thomas and a lot of farmers like him plan to switch to the staple crops of the former U.S. agricultural region in 2019: corn and wheat.
U.S. farmers planted more soybeans this year than corn for the first time in 35 years.
It is planned to switch to other food crops because U.S. farmers are struggling to sell soybeans in the context of U.S. President Donald Trump’s trade war with China.
China typically buys about 60 percent of U.S. soybeans for U.S. soybeans because of the trade war, which in recent months has sent soybean prices down to a ten-decade low.
Thomas intends to plant more wheat next year, hoping to make more money by reducing its dependence on crops that depend on Chinese demand.
Soybean prices â€œgive us a grieving blow,â€ Thomas said.
Without China’s demand, the spot price of soybeans near farms is $7.10 per bushel, compared with $8.50 required to cover the cost, he said.
U.S. farmers planted a record amount of soybeans this year, and the harvest is also expected to reach a record high.
It was at such an easy-to-shock moment that they encountered the blow of the trade war.
In view of Trump's imposition of tariffs on imports of Chinese goods, China imposed import tariffs on imported U.S. soybeans in July.
The U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) will release its first estimate for next year’s acreage, which is expected to include consideration of the impact of the tariffs.
It is expected that this estimate will confirm the expectations of private institutions that the soybean planting area will be reduced.
According to a report seen by Reuters, Informa Economics on October 19 predicted that corn acreage in 2019 will increase by 4% to 92.7 million acres (37.5 million hectares), and soybean acreage will be reduced by 7% to 83 million acres.
Informa also expects U.S. wheat acreage to increase by 4%.
Soybeans grown before retaliatory tariffs rose to 98.6 million acres this year, about 15 million acres higher than a decade ago.
Corn acreage has increased by less than 5 million to 89.1 million acres since 2008, with 47.8 million acres of wheat planted this year, nearly the lowest level in 100 years.
Aron Carlson, president of the Illinois Corn Growers, has 3,600-acre acreage, and he’ll spend nearly half on soybeans this year, but plans to cut back in the future.
It's likely to add up to 20 percent to his farm in northern Illinois, the largest U.S. soybean-growing state, he said.
Soybeans yield less per acre than corn, but they also require less fertiliser, making soybeans generally less expensive to grow.
If farmers move to end-to-quantivated corn, it may raise costs, but it will benefit a number of businesses, including Andersons Inc’s fertilizer sellers.
Anderson’s chief executive, Pat Bowe, told Reuters that he expected the conversion of corn to be beneficial for fertilizer use.
Bayer is also expected to benefit from farmers switching to corn.
The director of the Don Muang Airport Authority in Bangkok, Thailand, held a press conference on the 29th to apologize for the beating of a Chinese citizen at the airport, and said that Thailand welcomes Chinese tourists, and the relevant departments will strengthen management, improve service awareness, and avoid similar incidents.
According to reports, on the 27th, the security guard of Don Muang Airport had a physical confrontation with a Chinese man who was refused entry.
Sutirava said that the serious violations of the security personnel involved, the airport authority has suspended him, and in accordance with the procedure to set up a commission of inquiry to investigate the matter, if the matter is true will be dismissed from the security guard.
At present, the Thai immigration authorities have arranged for the man to return to China.
Sutirawa apologized for the incident that damaged Thailand's image and said that the Thai side attaches great importance to the matter and is willing to make every effort to reduce the impact of the incident on the injured tourists, and will send a letter of apology to the parties through the Chinese Embassy in Thailand.
He pointed out that Don Muang Airport is willing to provide convenience for Chinese tourists to Thailand, and jointly with the Thai Immigration Bureau in Bangkok's five major international airports such as Suvarnabhumi, Don Muang, Chiang Mai, Phuket and Hoai to set up a special entry channel for Chinese tourists.
He said that in the next step, the airport authority will carry out rectification of the visa-on-arrival area, express the cost of the landing visa, and improve the service quality and communication ability of the staff.
After the Chinese Embassy in Thailand learned of the incident, it was the first time to get in touch with the parties to find out what had happened.
At the same time, representations were submitted to the heads of the Thai Immigration Bureau, the Airport Authority and the Ministry of Tourism and Sports, asking the Thai side to thoroughly investigate the incident, severely punish the perpetrators, and will continue to maintain close communication with the Thai side, properly handle the matter, and safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of the parties concerned.
To defend multilateralism, China is united in its knowledge and actions.
At a time when unilateralism is surging, international rules and the multilateral order have been affected.
To a certain extent, the confrontation between unilateralism and multilateralism has entered a critical period.
As a responsible big country, with the concept of following the general trend and taking a solid and forceful approach, China will work with the international community to safeguard multilateralism and promote multilateralism to move forward.
In the face of the new situation and new challenges, China issued a loud voice on the development direction and path of multilateralism.
Just as State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi said in his speech at the general debate of the 73rd session of the United Nations General Assembly, multilateralism in the new era should adhere to the goal of win-win cooperation, be based on the rule order, take fairness and justice as the essence, and be guided by effective actions.
At the same time, China calls for the construction of a global development cooperation pattern with the United Nations as the core, North-South cooperation as the main channel, and South-South cooperation as a complement, and calls on all parties to work together to build a community with a shared future for mankind.
China's thinking and voice reflect the mainstream voice of the international community.
As the President of the 73rd session of the United Nations General Assembly Espinosa said, in the current situation, â€œthe United Nations needs to promote multilateralism and safeguard the rules-based international system more than ever.
IMF Managing Director Christine Lagarde said that the international community should continue to firmly uphold the multilateral trading system, adhere to international trade rules, and resolve differences through consultation.
In recent years, with the adjustment of the balance of global economic and political forces, the rise of some emerging markets and groups of developing countries has played a greater role in major international multilateral mechanisms, providing a new driving force for multilateralism that has encountered headwinds.
Based on the consideration of this dimension, China's commitment to building a big family rather than piecing together a small circle, adhering to the concept of multilateralism such as co-construction rather than a winner-take-all, conforms to the trend of the times, is an inevitable choice to deal with global challenges and solve the world's problems, and represents the common aspirations of most countries in the world.
There are advanced ideas and more solid actions.
The “Belt and Road” initiative proposed by China has become the largest platform for international cooperation.
International and regional cooperation initiatives such as the "Belt and Road", the Asian Infrastructure and Investment Bank and the "16+1 cooperation" initiated by China to promote international and regional cooperation, improve and supplement the existing international system and order, bring innovative vitality to multilateral cooperation, and contribute to the development of the international order in a more just and reasonable direction.
As a defender of the international order and a practitioner of multilateralism, China's actions are becoming more and more powerful on the multilateral stage of the United Nations.
Promote international hot spots, combat climate change, participate in peacekeeping operations, vigorously reduce poverty and alleviate poverty, and help other countries implement the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.
As United Nations Secretary-General António Guterres said, China has become an important pillar of multilateralism.
When the “trust deficit” that the world is facing, when the trend of populism and polarization rises, it is the world’s most urgent need for multilateral co-operation.
At such a historical juncture, the international community needs to join hands to turn consensus into action, resolutely defend multilateralism, and jointly promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind.
GUANGZHOU, China, Sept. 30 (reporter) Guangdong's first national standard 4K Demonstration Community was unveiled on September 30 in Jianzhen Garden Community, Haizhu District, Guangzhou. On the same day, the province's 4K business was officially launched, and the 4K ultra-high-definition channel of the central radio and television station was launched in Guangdong Province.
The day's activities were co-sponsored by Guangdong Cable Radio and Television Network Co., Ltd. and Haizhu Datang District Leading Group for Co-construction, Co-governance and Shared Social Governance.
According to the deployment of the Guangdong Provincial Party Committee and Provincial Government, the Guangdong radio and television network actively implements the new digital home 4K action plan. In December 2017, it released the country's first new digital home gateway terminal product that supports IPv6 and the country's radio and television's first to support 4-way real 4K concombination - "U point home server" (with AVS2 standard 4K box, Xunfei voice remote control), to accelerate the construction of 4K ultra-high-definition video, the next-generation Internet, wired and wireless integrated network applications.
In 2018, the Guangdong Radio and Television Network launched a series of radio and television Huimin initiatives, and launched the â€œradio 4K service monthâ€ to fully promote the â€œU point home serverâ€ in the province.
On the same day of the event, the 4K business of Guangdong radio and television network was officially launched, the first 4K smart TV safety home sharing platform project based on 4K applications was also officially unveiled and launched, the platform was co-constructed and co-cultivated and shared social governance leading group office jointly created by Guangdong Cable and Haizhu District.
Chen Xiaorui, chief engineer of the Guangdong Provincial Bureau of Journalism, Publication, Radio and Television, said at the event that the event was a useful cooperation of the radio and television network enterprises to actively serve the work of the party committee and the government actively used the "Internet +" to create a "digital government" to serve the people, and hoped that through cooperation and promotion, the Guangdong radio and television network can help Haizhu District, Guangzhou and even the province to create a model of co-construction and shared social governance.
The ceremony showcased and popularized a new digital home application with 4K smart TV safety home sharing platform and 4K TV as the core.
The first phase of the "4K smart TV safe home sharing platform" will have "Guangzhou Neighborhood", "New Guangzhou People's House", "wisdom community" and "smart family" four modules on-line, and strive to explore the construction of smart communities.
It is reported that the Guangdong radio and television network has opened 5 sets of 4K live broadcast channels, the National Day will also be the province's exclusive 4K ultra-high-definition channels.
September 30 is the country’s 5th Martyr’s Remembrance Day.
At 10 a.m. on the same day, Xi Jinping and other party and state leaders, together with representatives from all walks of life in the capital, attended the flower basket ceremony to the people's heroes and remember the heroes and martyrs.
According to CCTV, this is the first Martyr's Remembrance Day after China's Heroes and Martyrs Protection Law was implemented.
Five years ago, the Martyrs' Day was established on the eve of the National People's Day, showing the great journey of the Chinese nation from suffering to glory, and we must always wake up: "Where do we come from and where are we going."
General Secretary Xi Jinping profoundly pointed out that "Abandoning the tradition and throwing it away is tantamount to severing one's own spiritual lifeline."
â€œYou don't forget history to open up the future.â€
When we worship heroes and commemorate martyrs, it is necessary to always remember the history, continue the heroic spirit, and gather the strong positive energy of national rejuvenation.
It is pointed out that Yingliu is the backbone of the nation.
To honor the martyrs and to honor the martyrs is to make Yinglie a noble, holy and powerful eternal memory in our hearts.
According to incomplete statistics, there are about 20 million martyrs who died bravely for national independence, people's liberation and national prosperity, and people's happiness.
Every martyr who died for the country will be remembered, and the spirit of every spirit and loyalty will be looked forward to.
It is in order to pay tribute to them in the name of the country, to deeply remember their great achievements, and to learn to pass on the precious spirit of their love for the motherland, loyalty to the people, selfless dedication, and courage to sacrifice.
Party committees and governments at all levels have perfected the pension preferential treatment system, continuously improved the level of pension treatment, and the party and the state have practiced respect for heroes with concrete actions.
Every year, countless people visit the Martyrs Cemetery, so that we can appreciate the deep feelings of the masses and feel the rejuvenation momentum rising in the national bloodline.
Admire heroes, defend heroes, learn heroes, and care for heroes in the whole society.
Today, when socialism with Chinese characteristics has entered a new era, we can soothe the heroes who are sleeping: a strong China is rising in the east, and the Chinese dream of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation is becoming a reality in our hands.
Let's forge ahead with a heroic spirit and work towards a great goal!
The Ministry of Finance exempts cross-border e-commerce from value-added tax
The notice pointed out that if the e-commerce export enterprises in the comprehensive test area have exported goods that have not obtained a valid purchase certificate, and at the same time meet the relevant conditions, the value-added tax and consumption tax exemption policies will be piloted.
The e-commerce export enterprise is registered in the comprehensive test area, and the export date, the name of the goods, the unit of measurement, the unit of measurement, the quantity, the unit price and the amount are registered on the cross-border e-commerce cross-border e-commerce online comprehensive service platform at the registered place.
(B) the export goods through the comprehensive test area of the local customs to go through the e-commerce export declaration formalities.
(3) The exported goods do not belong to the goods of the Ministry of Finance and the General Administration of Taxation, in accordance with the decision of the State Council to explicitly cancel the export refund (exemption).
It is reported that the above-mentioned notice has been implemented since October 1, 2018, and the specific date is based on the export date indicated in the export commodity declaration list.
The fifth "disabled speech month" to pay attention to the issue of sex education for disabled adolescents
In recent years, the topic of sex education for young people in China has been widely discussed, but the challenge is still arduous for sex education for adolescents with disabilities.
Recently, a seminar on comprehensive sexual education challenges and practical strategies for people with disabilities was held in Beijing.
Sex education for children and young people with disabilities has become an important topic in this workshop.
According to the report on sexual knowledge, attitudes and behaviors of children and young people with disabilities in China released at the meeting, the proportion of children with disabilities subjected to sexual harassment and sexual assault is higher than that of healthy children.
For children and young people with disabilities, the society pays more attention to "sexual protection".
The purpose of this seminar is to explore the promotion of comprehensive sexual education for children and young people with disabilities in China from the aspects of family support, school education and institutional services, and to support children and adolescents with disabilities at the source, so that they, like others, have the right to freely enjoy love.
According to expert experts, the Chinese public's understanding of disabled groups has always remained at a not-so-depth level.
Affected by traditional concepts and other factors, China's comprehensive sex education for people with disabilities, especially children and adolescents with disabilities, is not in-depth.
However, in recent years, with the support of UNESCO and public welfare personnel, the comprehensive development of sexual and reproductive health education practices and realization paths for people with disabilities in China has achieved gratifying development.
The "Report" shows that children and young people with visual impairments, hearing impairments, intellectual disabilities and physical disabilities will have more difficulties in obtaining sexual knowledge and understanding of intimate relationships than ordinary people, but they have generally developed towards convenience and enrichment.
The Seminar on Comprehensive Sex Education Challenges and Practical Strategies for Persons with Disabilities is sponsored by the Shanghai Public Welfare Foundation and jointly supported by the United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization Representative Office in China (France), and the United Nations Population Fund Representative Office in China, which aims to jointly explore sexual and reproductive health education practices and realization paths for people with disabilities in a full-cycle comprehensive development of sexual and reproductive health education for people with disabilities in the context of the Greater Strategy, and to promote the comprehensive education of policy makers, educators, researchers, social service organizations, parents and other stakeholders in the field of special education.
BEIJING, Sept 30 (Reuters) - The People’s Bank of China (PBOC) on Sunday released data on short-term outbursts of foreign-currency-denominated foreign-currency forwards and futures contracts as at the end of August this year.
According to the central bank's previous data, as of the end of August last year, the central bank's short positions in foreign currency-to-local currency forward contracts and futures contracts were 60.44 billion US dollars, unchanged for the fourth consecutive month; the SDR (Special Drawing Rights) short positions were 4.276 billion SDR.
Since then, the central bank’s foreign exchange forward short position has been zero.
At the end of March 2016, the central bank released the data for the first time at the end of March; the data showed that at the end of February 2016, the central bank's foreign currency-to-currency forwards and futures contract long positions of 2.438 billion U.S. dollars and 28.9 billion U.
The September data released at the end of October of the same year for the first time showed a negative net increase of 16.401 billion US dollars to 45.301 billion US dollars.
The central bank has previously said that the foreign currency's forward-to-current and futures short position mainly reflects the central bank's foreign exchange forward operations with commercial banks in order to meet the hedging needs of corporate foreign currency liabilities, and will continue to provide long-term safe-haven products in accordance with the principle of actual demand, and the central bank's long-term operation will have a small impact on the scale of future foreign exchange reserves.
On the evening of September 20th this year, on the K158 train, Qiao, who was studying junior in Zhengzhou, took a ride to Hebi.
A master on the train bought a seatless ticket, but occupied her seat: "Shoot it."
After a two-hour drive, the conductor persuaded him that an hour would still be ineffective.
In the end, a male passenger in the same car could not see and drag the master.
Juddging from public opinion, although most of the final results are that the overlords have been condemned by the public, have been administratively punished by the public security department, and have even been included in the integrity blacklist, the public still feels that they do not "resolve hatred": Why can't the overlords be punished on the spot?
Why can't they be prevented on the spot from unethical or even illegal behavior, but after the fact that they can be punished?
And for the unwarranted behavior of the "overlord", why is only a male passenger "unsatisfied the road" and pulled it up?
The main reason is that only the long-distance trains are equipped with police, and short-distance trains are generally not; even if there are police officers, the police are more worried about the possible rogue reactions of the overlords and do not take compulsory removal measures.
Repeated hegemonic incidents make people realize that they must be forcibly removed or even punished on the spot in order to play a deterrent effect.
This requires that our train police should dare to take strong measures in a timely manner, and trains that do not take police should be deployed as soon as possible in order to prevent and stop and crack down on illegal acts in a timely manner.
On October 1, on the first day of the National Day long holiday, the number of vehicles in the direction of Songpan in Songpan, Maoxian County through Beichuan Qiang Autonomous Prefecture in Sichuan, soared.
At about 13 o'clock, the Beichuan traffic police received a call for help, saying that his family was involved in a traffic accident in Songpan, due to limited local medical conditions, it urgently needs to be sent to Mianyang for medical treatment.
It coincides with the implementation of one-way traffic control on the lake ring road in Tangjiashan, Beichuan, and I would like to ask the traffic police to release the 120 emergency vehicles.
After receiving the call for help, the on-duty police quickly reported the situation to the brigade, captain Huang Xuemin simply understood the situation, and immediately arranged for the control of the police on duty to communicate with the helpers and asked to do a good job of escort.
"There were more than a thousand vehicles entering the controlled section at that time, and after contacting 120 emergency vehicles, it is expected to arrive in Beichuan at about 15:00, and we immediately make arrangements for deployment."
Beichuan traffic police Yuli squadron leader Wei Wei introduced, emergency vehicles need to be detoured from the Tangjia mountain mound lake around the lake, and the road is steep and narrow, in order to prevent vehicles that have already entered this section of the road to double row parallel, the traffic police one hour in advance of the three points on the road to implement segmental control, and remind all through the driver to open the side of the road, for the emergency vehicle wrong.
Subsequently, Drum Squadron police also temporarily stopped the vehicle from entering the controlled section and lined up for 120 emergency vehicles that were about to arrive.
At about 15 o'clock, a Chuan U-plate ambulance drove into the territory of Beichuan, and the Beichuan traffic police sent a police car to drive the emergency vehicles all the way retrograde into the controlled section.
It is understood that only one car can pass in some places around the lake road, and the police temporarily control these places in advance to ensure the smooth passage of 120 emergency vehicles.
Arriving in the village of Shili Monument in Liping Township, there was a road that could not be wrong, so the traffic police made contact with the two committees of the village in advance, borrowed the village bypass, and banned social vehicles from entering.
"It took only 40 minutes from Beichuan to receive 120 first-aided vehicles to enter the 302 provincial highway normal road."
According to Wei, according to the normal situation, the entire passage time will take 4 hours.
â€œThis arrangement has successfully obtained valuable treatment time for the patient.â€
It is reported that at 17:20, critically ill patients were sent to Mianyang for medical treatment in a timely manner.
The confirmed death toll from the earthquake and tsunami in Indonesia quickly rose to 832, and authorities fear that the number would rise as rescuers struggled to provide aid to remote areas without contact.
Of particular concern is Dungra, an area with a population of 300,000 people north of Baru, near the epicentre of the earthquake.
Two other areas have lost contact with the outside world since Friday.
“We have not yet received reports from the other three regions.”
Communication and electricity are still interrupted.
Nugroho said the missing included five foreigners, three of whom were French nationals, a South Korean and a Malaysian.
An earthquake and tsunami killed 832 people.
Indonesia's vice-president Kalla said the death toll could rise to thousands.
Earlier, Indonesian President Joko Widodo visited the disaster area and called on the people to be patient.
November 4 (Reuters) - Britain’s Daily Telegraph reported on Sunday that Dominic Raab, Britain’s secretary of state for Britain’s right to “guaranteed” arrangements after a three-month departure from the Irish border.
At a private meeting in London on Tuesday, Raab made the request to Ireland’s Deputy Prime Minister and Minister for Foreign Affairs and Trade Simon Coveney.
According to the report, the request was a "clear contradiction" with the remarks made three days later by David Lidington's visit to Dublin.
The Brexit ministry said it would not comment on a private meeting.
At 8:05 a.m. yesterday morning, the two pickpocketing suspects were captured when they were pickpocketed from Yongdingmen Station on the 20th bus to Zhushikou Station.
The two pickpocketing men cut off the passenger's coat pocket and stole 800 yuan of cash, so that the police who had already squatted next to them.
This is the first case of pickpocketing cracked by the Beijing police during the National Day.
At more than five o'clock in the morning, the Beijing Public Security Mobile Investigative Corps counterattack investigators arrived at the predetermined position.
According to the past experience, where the flow of people is concentrated, the bus hub and the bus subway line, including the Tiananmen Square to watch the flag-raising people, are the key areas of their work.
In the flow of people, plainclothes police officers calmly observed the passing crowd.
At more than seven o'clock in the morning, the investigators who were squatting at the bus station found that two suspicious men followed by a male passenger on the No. 20 bus.
In the car, the two suspicious men, one to the left and one on the right, caught the male passenger in the middle, one of whom tried to cover the other.
However, they did not know that their every move had already fallen into the eyes of the plainclothes police who were watching.
In the process of waiting for the men to steal, the police in plainclothes who were looking at the theft, the police stared intently at the man who was preparing to steal, and was caught by the investigators in one fell swoop after they were stolen.
The Beijing Morning News reporter saw that the police seized 800 yuan in cash from the theft suspect.
"That's the money they're taking from a passenger's pocket."
The police pointed to a broken coat pocket and said: "They cut it here and stole 800 yuan from a passenger who came to Beijing, and when we caught them, the money was put in their own pockets."
The reporter learned that in order to catch these two people, the plainclothes police followed for an hour, and they were finally captured in one fell swoop during their crimes.
The two suspects are currently under police scrutiny.
The plainclothes police told reporters that who is suspicious in the crowd, this problem is very simple for the police.
In addition to staring at people's pockets and backpacks, they also like to drill into the crowd, rather than hiding from people."
The police also told reporters that the suspects and other cars often have no purpose, they like to wander around the station, and they will follow the car when they find the object of pickpocketing.
"It's a lot of experience, plainclothes for a long time, naturally you know."
In addition, the police also suggested, "clothes are the most convenient, but also the most likely to be stolen."
Pay attention to your belongings during the ride to prevent theft.
On the 30th (Zhang Linhu) on the 30th, the Propaganda Department Propaganda Department of the Tongliao Municipal Party Committee of the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region issued a message saying that the Standing Committee and the Propaganda Minister of Tongliao City, the Standing Committee and the Propaganda Minister Han Baiyla caused the death of 3 people.
On the afternoon of September 29, the 52-year-in-year-old Standing Committee member and Propaganda Minister Han Baiyera was involved in a traffic accident driving a small ordinary passenger car and a sanitation electric tricycle, resulting in 2 deaths on the spot and 1 serious injury to a serious injury.
It is understood that the responsible suspect Han Bai Beira caused casualties due to drunk dangerous driving, has been criminally detained by the public security organs, Tongliu Municipal Discipline Inspection and Supervision Commission has been involved in the investigation.
The incident is currently under further investigation.
The reporter learned from the Traffic Management Bureau of the Ministry of Public Security of China on October 1 that on the first day of the National Day holiday, the traffic flow of roads and highways around the major cities increased significantly, as of 17:00 on the same day, in addition to a small number of nodes, there are still vehicles in the slow-moving section, the traffic of highways and provincial highways in various places is generally stable and orderly.
In the early morning of the same day, travel peaks were generally ushered in in various places, the traffic flow of roads and highways around the major cities increased significantly, and local sections, as well as toll booths, service areas, bridges, tunnels, communicative interchange and other nodes due to excessive traffic, road bottlenecks, scraping accidents and other reasons, there have been varying degrees of slow queuing of vehicles, especially the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei, the Yangtze River Delta, the Pearl River Delta and the Chengdu area.
It is known that on the first day of the holiday, the national traffic police launched holiday traffic security wartime services, a total of more than 190,000 police personnel, more than 70,000 police vehicles, strict patrol and control, strict control of traffic order, timely management of traffic, rapid handling of accidents, widely publicized tips and guidance, and made every effort to ensure smooth road safety on the first day of the holiday.
It is expected that on the 2nd, the traffic flow of urban highways and provincial highways will still be running at a high level, while the flow of tourist scenic spots will increase significantly, and traffic congestion and security risks will increase.
British Prime Minister Theresa May on Sunday called on her party to unite in support of her Brexit plan, directly calling on critics to support it, saying they wanted a free-trade deal was at the heart of her Brexit plan.
On September 30, 2018, British Prime Minister Theresa May went to the Conservative Party meeting in Birmingham, England.
Theresa May's plans were again slammed by two former cabinet ministers, including former Foreign Secretary Boris Johnson, who called May's "derangement".
But she also received strong support from other pro-Brexit ministers, who â€œlaud Theresa May for being one of the most courteous people,â€ and International Trade Secretary John Fox and Foreign Secretary Jeremy Hunt also shoved their irritations toward the EU.
Theresa May’s already-fragile leadership came under further pressure this month as the EU rejected parts of the so-called Chekes plan.
But Theresa May viewed the talks positively, saying that she was prepared to take into account the EU’s concerns.
â€œMy message to my own party is, let’s work together to find the best deal for the UK,â€ May said.
Former British Foreign Secretary Boris Johnson called May’s plans “deranged” and slammed her lack of confidence in Brexit.
He and former Brexit Secretary David Davis are pushing for a Canadian-style free-trade agreement with the EU.
Theresa May said the proposal would allow Northern Ireland to impose different tariff rules that would be tantamount to a break-in from the United Kingdom.
After a lapse of 6 years, Tencent ushered in major organizational structure adjustments clearly do not lay off employees
On the 30th, Tencent announced the official launch of a new round of overall strategic upgrading, the organizational structure ushered in a new round of optimization and adjustment after a lapse of 6 years, on the basis of the original seven business groups (BG) restructuring and integration into six, and said that the adjustment does not involve layoffs.
The new six major business groups.
After a lapse of six years, two new business groups appeared.
It is understood that the new business group not only maintains the advantages and characteristics of deep-ploughed vertical fields, retaining the original enterprise development business group (CDG), interactive entertainment business group (IEG), technical engineering business group (TEG), WeChat business group (WXG); but also highlighted the integration effect, the newly established cloud and smart industry business group (CSIG), platform and content business group (PCG).
The reporter noted that Tencent's original mobile Internet business group (MIG), the original network media business group (OMG) and so on have disappeared, especially OMG, the external visibility is very high.
Tencent said that the newly established platform and content business group (PCG (Platform & Content Group), the original social networking business group (SNG), the original mobile Internet business group (MIG), the original network media business group (OMG), with the social platform, traffic platform, digital content, the core technology and other highly related and highly integrated sectors, organic separation and reorganization.
The newly established Cloud and Smart Industries Group (CSIG) will integrate Tencent Cloud, Internet+, smart retail, education, health care, security and LBS and other industry solutions to promote the digital upgrading of the industry.
Ma Huateng, chairman and chief executive officer of Tencent, said that the second half of the Internet belongs to the industrial Internet, in the first half Tencent provides users with high-quality services through the connection, and in the second half, we will help the industry and consumers to form a more open new connection ecology.
Respond to the "redundancy" rumors: it is clear that there will be no layoffs.
After Tencent released the organizational structure adjustment news, there is news that the adjustment will involve layoffs.
"It can be clear that this organizational structure adjustment will not involve layoffs. We will shift the overall translation of the various business modules, the combination and then optimize it."
Macron urges France to protect French skills for "cousquet bread"
According to Reuters, European countries have successively applied for their own unique diet, followed by Belgian beer and spaghetti in Naples, Italy, France also recently plans to apply for sticky bread to be included in the UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage List.
It is reported that the plan was promoted by French President Emmanuel Emmanuel Macron, with the support of the French bread and pastry industry alliance.
They pointed out that many of the baguettes sold today are made from mass-produced frozen dough, adding materials other than flour, water, yeast and salt, and traditional artisanal bakeries are gradually fading, hoping to be included in the list to protect world-renowned French craftsmanship.
UNESCO will hold its annual meeting in Mauritius in late November to review the Intangible Cultural Heritage List.
The sinking of an illegal migrant boat in Turkey’s Aegean Sea has killed five people.
According to Turkish media reports on the 30th, an inflatable boat carrying illegal immigrants capsized in the Aegean Sea of Turkey on the same day, killing at least five people.
According to the report, the inflatable boat, which was scheduled to go to an island in Greece, sank near the Enez area of Edirne province in northwestern Turkey on the same day, and the reason for the sinking was unknown.
At present, it is not clear the number of illegal immigrants contained in the sinking inflatable ship.
It is estimated that there are still people trapped in the sea, the relevant search and rescue operations are still continuing.
The Aegean Sea was once the preferred route for illegal immigrants to smuggle into the European continent via Turkey.
After being controlled by Turkey in accordance with an agreement signed with the European Union in March 2016, there has been a significant reduction in the number of people smuggled through this channel.
However, since this year, there has been a rebound in the number of smugglers in this channel.
According to the official website of the Nobel Prize, at 11:30 a.m. local time on the 1st in Stockholm, Sweden, the American immunologist James Allison and the Japanese immunogiologist Honjong won the 2018 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine for discovering cancer therapies that inhibit negative immunomodulation.
According to Japanese media reports, the 26th Japanese to win the Nobel Prize and the 5th Japanese to win the Physiology or Medicine Prize, the 76-year-old has made significant contributions to the treatment of new drugs for the treatment of cancer, he learned of his award in his own laboratory.
Born on January 27, 1942, he is a Japanese doctor, a medical scientist, a foreign academician of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States, a member of the Japanese Academy of Sciences, and currently a visiting professor at Kyoto University.
In 1992, he discovered the T-cell inhibition receptor PD-1, which pioneered cancer immunotherapies in 2013, ranking first among the top ten scientific breakthroughs of science in Science.
On September 21, 2016, he was included in the censorious laurels of the year and was hailed as "one of the closest Japanese people to the Nobel Prize".
Chinese tourists were beaten at the Thai airport: the strikers were dismissed and the president of the airport was dismissed.
According to Thailand's headlines network reported on September 30, recently, the video of Chinese citizens being beaten at Bangkok's Don Muang airport has aroused widespread concern.
At 2 a.m. local time on the morning of the 29th local time, Surinwa, the president of the Thai airport company Langman Airport, explained that the airport's security personnel hit the tourists and deeply apologized.
On the other hand, according to the news, the Thai Deputy Prime Minister, Bayi, attaches great importance to the matter, has ordered the dismissal of the airport staff, and the Du Muang airport has been abolished.
The head of the airport authority said that at that time, the Chinese tourist was dissatisfied with being refused entry and did not want to obey the management and stay in the restricted area for repatriation, so there were push and physical clashes with the security personnel.
At present, the airport authority has suspended the security guard.
This incident has had an impact on Thailand's tourism image, and Don Muang Airport deeply apologizes for the incident, in order to do its best to make up for the loss, the airport will send a deep apology to the attacked Chinese tourists through the Chinese Embassy.
In the end, the president of the airport, Su Linwa, said that the majority of Chinese tourists are still welcome to travel to Thailand, which has now provided more help and convenience for Chinese tourists entering Thailand, including the opening of the Chinese passport service channel at the time of entry, of which Suvarnabhumi Airport has opened 18, Donovanman Airport has been opened, 18 have been opened to Puji Airport, and 8 have been opened to Chiang Mai Airport.
Thailand's headlines network from the new Thai National Bureau of Immigration, the former deputy director of Thailand's tourism police, Major General Surachi police, was informed that Thailand's Deputy Prime Minister Bayi attaches great importance to the matter, has ordered the dismissal of the airport staff, and the Don Muang airport chief abolished the job.
In recent years, there have been unqualified campus plastic runway incidents in many places.
To this end, the Ministry of Education has issued a notice, requesting that the new national standard must be implemented in the face-layer sports field of primary and secondary school synthetic materials delivered after November 1 of this year.
Compulsory national standard "Synthetic materials in primary and secondary schools" was led by the Ministry of Education, 26 scientific research institutes and testing institutions to participate in the drafting, after more than two years of revision, during which more than 100 expert meeting demonstrations, as well as nationwide field visits, sample testing, collected hundreds of companies on the market products countless verification experiments.
Compared with the old national standard in 2005, the new national standard is not only changed from the "national recommended standard" to the "national mandatory standard", but also added a lot of content, including thickness requirements, physical properties, aging resistance, inorganic filler content requirements, anti-slip glulin granular high-agglomeric content requirements, the surface of the finished chemical substances limit, non-solid and solid raw materials of harmful substances.
In particular, it is worth mentioning that the new national standard restricts the harmful substances that may be generated in the construction of plastic runways on the campus, increasing from the original 7 items to 18 items, and in accordance with the home improvement standards, the limits of volatile organic compounds of the runway after completion are stipulated.
For example, the release amount of harmful substances and odour is clearly stipulated in the â€œcurrent and prefabricated surface productsâ€ , the total volatile organic compounds shall not be higher than 5 mg / cubic meter, formaldehyde shall not be higher than 0.4 mg / cubic meter, carbon disulfide must not be higher than 7 mg / cubic meter, benzene shall not be higher than 0.1 mg / cubic meter, odor level shall not be higher than 3.
The new national standard also makes detailed provisions on the sampling requirements, inspection rules and judgment rules for plastic runways in primary and secondary schools.
In addition, for the first time, the campus artificial turf has also been included in the scope of mandatory testing of the national standard.
In the near future, various localities should carry out special work deployment on the implementation of the new national standard, and submit the implementation of the new national standard to the Department of Physical Health and Arts Education of the Ministry of Education during the year.
On the afternoon of the 30th, the final stage of the 2018 Women's Table Tennis World Cup staged the "National Table Tennis Civil War".
In the end, Grand Slam champion Ding Ning 4-0 Like home teammate Zhu Yuling, after a lapse of four years once again ascended the women's table tennis World Cup champion, which is also the 21st Chinese women's table tennis player won the championship.
Ding Ning and Zhu Yuling are teammates and friends, and the two sides are quite familiar with each other's skills and tactics.
Whether it’s a warm-up before a game or a pre-game warm-up, both sides follow suit.
Entering the final, the two of them unanimously said that they had completed the task of the competition.
However, the contest between Ding Ning and Zhu Yuling in the game can be described as a sword and shadow.
In the first game, Ding Ning, who had the best experience in the competition, took a 3:1 lead, and then Zhu Yuling used Ding Ning's mistake to chase the score into 3 levels.
Subsequently, Zhu Yuling's mistakes in the attack began to increase, Ding Ning seized the opportunity to take a 3-point 9:5 lead, with 10:6 to take the in-game point.
Although Zhu Yuling chased for 3 points, Ding Ning still used the service to win the first game at 11:9.
In the second game, Zhu Yuling's mistakes are still high, Ding Ning's advantage in the holding to 6:1 far ahead.
In the case of 2:7, Zhu Yuling relied on the rhythm to change the continuous score of 2 points, and then used the attack to chase the score to 8:9.
At the crucial moment, Ding Ning scored 2 points and 11:8 to win another game.
In the third game, the two of them began to bite more tightly into a 3:3 level.
Ding Ning then increased errors in the attack to lose 3 points, but she then used the sharp attack even scored 3 points to chase the score to 6 draws.
Zhu Yuling scored 2 consecutive points to establish an advantage again, and took the lead with 10:8 to get the point.
However, Ding Ning's attack was extremely ferocious, winning the third game at 12:10 after scoring 4 points.
In the fourth game, Zhu Yuling opened with a 4:2 lead.
But since then, Ding Ning has shown a strong offensive state, even after scoring 4 points to stop Zhu Yuling.
After the suspension came back, Zhu Yuling regained some of her status and gradually chased the score to 8:8.
At the critical moment, Ding Ning did not have a soft hand and even scored 2 points to get the match point.
With Zhu Yuling returning to the ball, Ding Ning 4:0 swept the opponent to win the championship.
Ding Ning won the Bulgarian Open last month, ending his 14-month-long championship drought and came to Chengdu, although she said she did not set a goal in this competition before the game, and in the semifinals at the end of the morning, Ding Ning said that he had completed the task.
In the end, Ding Ning defeated teammate Zhu Yuling and won the third individual World Cup, and she was very satisfied with her performance: "A championship is very important for every athlete.
I didn't expect this before the game, I just said a field to fight, the final itself is still very satisfied."
At-home battle, Chuan sister Zhu Yuling harvested a silver medal, did not complete the goal of defending, talking about whether the enthusiastic audience at home will cause invisible pressure on themselves, she said: "I think the whole game I can deal with in terms of pressure, today Ding Ning played very well, resulting in himself has not been able to find the rhythm."
To activate rural consumption, it is necessary to purify the market by normalizing the mechanism, guide the demand for healthy consumption, and improve the sense of acquisition of farmers' consumption.
According to the data, the consumption potential of rural residents has continued to be released, and in the first half of this year, the retail sales of rural consumer goods increased by 10.5%, and the growth rate was 1.3 percentage points higher than that in urban areas.
In a poor village in the western county to visit, the whole village has only a convenience store, into the store, some goods seem familiar, "golden dragon fish" marked as "gold dragon oil", "Wang Chai" has become "Wang milk", "shanzhai" a lot of goods.
In the past few years, similar phenomena have been frequently exposed, and some rural fake and shoddy goods are brand-name brands, with similar names, similar packaging, and false confusion, which is unstoppable and unstoppable.
According to a consumption survey report released by a city in the west, the problem of ultra-fake goods in rural businesses is serious, and 66% of users have bought fake goods in offline supermarkets in rural areas, of which food accounts for more than half.
The relevant departments rectified the rural market and shouted every year, why does "Li ghost" continue to fight?
Different from the urban market, there is a relatively small awareness of farmers' rights protection, coupled with the remote location of many rural areas, in a blind area with insufficient regulatory force, so that fake and inferior commodities have a breeding ground.
A commodity long tube, some departments manage the price, some manage the production, some manage the market, the function of the intersection, the annual anti-counterfeiting, the centralized governance of a gust of wind, fakes dodged the breeze, and slowly came out, just finished the old fake, the new fake came out again.
The lack of a long-term supervision mechanism, the rural market is difficult to purify, the illegal cost is low, and the benefits are large, resulting in some unscrupulous traders starting to "go to the countryside", and some rural areas have become a "waste market".
From subsistence to well-off, the vast number of farmers are moving towards development-oriented consumption.
A few days ago, the Party Central Committee and the State Council issued a number of opinions on improving the mechanism of promoting the consumption system to further excite the consumption potential of residents, which put forward to promote the upgrading of rural residents' consumption cascade, in order to let the vast number of farmers "can consume", "willing to consume" and "dare to consume", so that rural consumption can truly flourish.
On the one hand, it is necessary to deepen the reform, eliminate the shortcomings of market supervision and multi-headed management, improve the food safety and product quality supervision network according to local conditions, and constantly reduce the space of rural counterfeiting and selling fake.
On the other hand, it is necessary to increase law enforcement efforts, open up the "capillaries" of supervision, and never allow counterfeiting to breed and spread in the countryside.
Severely punishing pit farmers is the protection of farmers, no matter how many hidden counterfeiters, it should not become the breeding grounds of fake and inferior goods, the relevant departments should clarify their responsibilities, grass-roots regulatory forces sinking, which link, it is necessary to be held accountable, so that counterfeiters and counterfeiters have no place to hide.
Strictly control the market access, implement a strict qualification examination for production operators, control the circulation of the market, let the products come to the right way, to clear the road, from the source, the root to find a way, so that the legitimate distributors can operate with peace of mind, so that farmers can buy with peace of mind.
To activate rural consumption, it is necessary to guide the demand for healthy consumption.
Accompanied by the upgrading of consumption, many farmers not only strive to eat well, but also pursue high-quality life such as culture and health, and can not equal the rural market with "low-quality" and "cheap".
It is necessary to promote e-commerce to extend coverage to the vast number of rural areas, unblock the two-way linkage sales channels between urban and rural areas, promote the combination of offline industrial development platforms and online e-commerce trading platforms, and support the expansion of new modes of consumption to the rural market; promote qualified townships to combine commercial logistics with leisure agriculture, rural tourism, and product processing; improve the rural modern circulation network system, optimize the integration of stock facilities resources, and effectively reduce rural circulation costs.
To create a clear and secure market environment for the countryside, so that farmers do not worry about consumption, rural consumption can become more and more prosperous, in order to enhance the farmer's sense of acquisition, happiness.
From November 1, China will reduce the MFN tax rate on some commodities, and the total tariff level will be reduced to 7.5%.
According to the decision of the 26th executive meeting of the State Council, the Customs Tariff Commission of the State Council issued a notice on the 30th to reduce the most-favoured-nation tax rate for some commodities from November 1, 2018.
In accordance with the "Announcement of the Customs Tariff Commission of the State Council on the reduction of import tariffs on some commodities", in order to adapt to industrial upgrading, reduce corporate costs and meet the multi-level consumption needs of the masses, from November 1st this year, the most-favoured-nation tax rate of some industrial goods and other commodities will be reduced.
There are a total of 1,585 tax items, accounting for about 19% of China's total tax items, and the average tax rate is reduced from 10.5% to 7.8%, with an average reduction of 26%.
The tax reduction is mainly related to textiles; stone, ceramics, glass products; some steel and base metal products; electromechanical equipment and spare parts, such as metal processing machinery, textile machinery, construction machinery, power transmission and transformation equipment, electrical equipment, electrical equipment, instrumentation, etc.; resource-based commodities and primary processed products, such as non-metallic minerals, inorganic chemicals, wood and paper products, precious jade.
At the same time, with the reduction of the overall level of tariffs, especially the import tariffs on pharmaceuticals and consumer goods, the tax rate of import tariffs on imported goods will be reduced accordingly.
In order to implement the decision-making and deployment of the Party Central Committee and the State Council, China has implemented zero tariffs on the vast majority of imported drugs since May 1 this year, reduced import tariffs on automobiles and spare parts and some daily consumer goods since July 1, and implemented the third step of the information technology agreement to reduce tariffs.
The reporter learned from the State Council's Customs Tariff Commission that since this year, after several consecutive independent adjustments, China's overall tariff level will drop from 9.8% last year to 7.5%, with an average reduction of 23%.
Appropriately reducing tariffs is conducive to promoting the balanced development of foreign trade, promoting a higher level of opening-up, and making overall use of two kinds of international and domestic resources to promote domestic supply-side structural reform.
The relevant person in charge of the committee said that this year is the 40th anniversary of the reform and opening up, taking the initiative to reduce the overall level of tariffs is the practical action to implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at the Boao Forum for Asia, and it is also an important measure for China to further expand opening-up and actively expand imports according to its own high-quality development needs.
On September 29, the regional public brand conference for agricultural products in Huanxian County, Gansu Province, was held in Nankai District of Tianjin.
The Red Army millet, black beans, mountain children's gourmet goats, buckwrate tea, paper-cut shadow books, pure hand-sleeker slippers... A piece of beautifully packaged agricultural products are neatly placed in the booth, and they have a common brand name called â€œRural peopleâ€ .
â€œCreate the â€œRural peopleâ€ region brand, effectively solve the â€œmany and scattered, small and weakâ€ development bottlenecks of â€œmany and scattered, small and weakâ€ and has become a powerful carrier of â€œRuralistsâ€ ,â€œGuangsu Huan Countyâ€ ,â€ was held in Nankai District of Tianjin.
It is located at the junction of the three prefectures of Shaanxi Ganning Province, as an "advanced county for national food production", "the hometown of China's small grains" and "the hometown of China's shadow shadow", with a long history and rich resources.
Local snacks such as lamb meat, yellow rice wine, buckwheat noodles, swallow noodles and other local snacks are often remembered by tourists in their hometown.
With the continuous improvement of China's level of urbanization, the urban population has increased rapidly, and a large number of rural young people have left their hometowns to start urban life.
China's agricultural brand research expert Yang Qiaojia said: "Now the pace of urban life is fast, the pressure, more and more people are beginning to miss the rural life as a child, but, 'can't go back to the hometown, the most beautiful memory is the countryside' brand design is based on the countryside and nostalgia and nostalgia.
The climatic conditions are special, the sunshine time is long, the temperature difference between day and night is large, and the planting conditions of the characteristic small grains are unique.
There are more than 20 kinds of small miscellaneous grains in the country, which is the hometown of small miscellaneous grains in China, and its output ranks first in Gansu, and the quality is at the forefront in the country.
Wang Xiaoli is in Tianjin to go to school in Huanxian girls, this time as a volunteer to participate in the promotion meeting, she said: "the hometown of the people are the most affectionate, the taste of the hometown is the most beautiful, the 'neighbors' brand evoked too much nostalgia, memories, not to forget is the food there, I hope the 'humorality people' brand goes farther and bigger."
Dr. Tan Bin, a researcher at the Scientific Research Institute of the State Food and Material Reserve Bureau, said that through the detection of more than 900 sets of index data, the detection data of agricultural products such as buckwheat buckwheat, buckwheat buckwheat and black beans are outstanding, and the content of many physiologically active substances in miscellaneous grains is higher than the standard data.
Chai Chun, secretary of the Huanxian County Party Committee, said that through the release of the "Rural People" brand, it can further improve the quality, standardization and large-scale innovation and development level of high-quality agricultural products, which is conducive to shaping the good overall image of agricultural products and rapidly enhancing visibility, competitiveness and added value.
Canada's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 0.2% in July from the previous month, a higher-than-anticipated increase in market expectations that the Bank of Canada will raise interest rates next month.
If it does raise interest rates, it will be the central bank’s fifth rate hike in more than a little in more than a year.
Analysts interviewed by Reuters had previously forecast an increase of 0.1%.
Statistics Canada said on Friday that 12 out of 20 industries have achieved growth.
The data is noteworthy because the central bank predicted earlier this month that temporary factors may weigh on third-quarter GDP data.
Bank of Canada Governor Polloz on Thursday promised that the central bank will continue to gradually raise interest rates and will pay close attention to economic data.
The Bank of Canada’s next interest rate decision will be announced on October 24.
Due to Canada’s growing economy and near-record low unemployment, the Bank of Canada has raised interest rates four times since July 2017.
Stephen Brown, a senior Canadian economist at Capital Economics, said the country's third-quarter GDP is expected to grow at an annual rate of about 2 per cent in the third quarter.
â€œThis will be higher than the Bank of Canada’s expectations of 1.5%, and will therefore be another reason to expect the Bank of Canada to raise interest rates next month,â€ he said in a note.
According to the overnight index exchange, the market's estimate of the Bank of Canada's probability of raising interest rates in October increased from 76.46% to 78.27%.
The two Koreas jointly visited the mouth of the Han River into the sea for the first time in 65 years.
South Korea's Defense Ministry confirmed on the 5th that on the same day, the ROK will launch a joint visit to the waters of the Han River and the Linjin River into the sea.
This initiative is to provide preliminary preparations to ensure the freedom of navigation of civilian vessels on both sides.
South Korea's Ministry of National Defense reported to the media on the same day that it was the first joint inspection of the Han River into the sea since the signing of the armistice agreement for the Korean War in 1953.
In September this year, the two Koreas signed a military agreement and agreed to jointly visit waters such as the entrance of the Han River into the sea in November to ensure environmental protection, development and tourism of the waters in the future.
In October, the two Koreas carried out a joint survey of the waters at a general-level meeting.
On November 5, the inter-Korean waters joint inspection was officially launched.
The joint delegation consists of 20 people, including the ROK military and experts.
According to South Korea's Ministry of National Defense, during the visit, personnel on both sides did not carry weapons, and it was forbidden to use words and deeds to stimulate each other's words and deeds.
"Because there are no military dividing lines near the entrance to the sea, the area was an unexpectedly high-incidence area, but through joint inspection, it will be transformed into a new area of peace in the future."
The total length of the inter-Korean joint survey is about 70 kilometers, with a total area of about 280 square kilometers.
According to South Korea's Ministry of National Defense, the South Korean side will send six research vessels to detect the depth of the seawater to provide basic information for the safe navigation of the waters; after the completion of the investigation, it will provide a navigational map for civilian ships.
The two Koreas held a summit meeting in Pyongyang in October 2007 to reach an agreement on the joint use of the Han and Linjin rivers into the mouth of the sea, but the follow-up negotiations were stranded due to the tense situation on the Korean Peninsula.
According to the military agreement signed by the two Koreas in September, ships of the two sides need to inform each other in advance before navigating common waters in the future.
According to the website of the Chinese Embassy in Mongolia on the 4th news, recently, Chinese citizens Guo Yuqin and Mao Runxin lost contact during their tourism in Mongolia.
It is understood that the two are members of the blue sky rescue team, on October 19th, the two contacted relatives and friends in the country and said that they were about to venture into the mountains near Kusugul Lake and shared their location through WeChat, after which they lost contact and were suspected to have gone to the no-man's land.
The Chinese Embassy in Mongolia has always attached great importance to the protection of the legitimate rights and interests and security of Chinese citizens in Mongolia, and has attached great importance to consular protection and assistance.
After learning the news that the above two tourists lost contact, the embassy immediately launched an emergency plan, and strived to seize the golden rescue time and fully carry out its work.
The embassy maintained close communication with the family, assisted the family to immediately report the case to the Mongolian police, and provided the family with a list of interpreters to choose from.
The embassy immediately met with the person in charge of the Ministry of External Relations of Mongolia, the General Department of the Police and the General Administration of Emergencies to report the relevant situation, ask the Mongolian side to carry out the search and rescue as soon as possible, and to maintain close communication with the Mongolian side throughout the search and rescue process to ensure a timely grasp of the latest progress.
At the same time, the embassy assisted the family members in Mongolia to issue a search notice, and widely mobilized overseas Chinese and Chinese-funded enterprises to actively participate in tracing people, provided effective clues, and provided relevant assistance to a number of blue sky rescue team members who went to Mongolia to assist in the rescue.
Under the strong promotion of the embassy, the Mongolian side sent a rescue team for the first time, and promised to eliminate the cost of search and rescue.
The Civil Police Department and the General Department of Emergency Situations instructed the Kusugur provincial police and emergency department to make every effort to search and rescue.
Because Kusugur Lake is located on the border between northern Mongolia and Russia, it is remote, sparsely populated, extremely inconvenient for transportation and communication, and at present, Mongolia has entered a severe winter, the temperature is as low as minus 20 degrees, the local police and emergency departments have overcome great difficulties, mobilized almost all the police forces, and mobilized local herdsmen to carry out carpet search and rescue in a wide range around the missing position.
At the same time, in view of the special circumstances of the pastoral area, the Mongolian side has been publishing people's notices through the radio cycle for many days.
The relevant staff of the domestic blue sky rescue team have also actively participated in the rescue.
The safety of the two missing people has always touched our hearts.
It has been more than 10 days since the loss of contact between the two, the embassy has received a number of clues, but the two have not yet been found, and the search and rescue operation is still tense.
In accordance with the principle of "people-oriented", the embassy will continue to pay attention to this matter, promote the Mongolian side to continue to make all-out search and rescue, and provide maximum assistance to the families of the parties concerned.
The embassy called on compatriots and enterprises in Mongolia to contact the Chinese Embassy in Mongolia for the first time if they are aware of the relevant clues.
